window.EPISODES = [{"ep":1,"title":"Leaving Home","summary":"Thousands of years ago the Heaven Defying Bead, one of the three great treasures of the Cangwu Dao Realm, falls into the world and is claimed by Situ Nan, the strongest man of the Vermilion Bird country. Outside experts gang up on him for it, and as his body is destroyed he vows to return when the destined one appears. Ages later in the Country of Zhao, the poor teenager Wang Lin, called Tie Zhu at home, watches relatives bully his parents over clan debts. His Fourth Uncle brings a chance to try for the Heng Yue Sect through one of the Wang family's three places, won thanks to Elder Dao Xu's interest in cousin Wang Zhuo. Sect master Huang Long tests the children's spiritual roots, and Wang Lin fails while Wang Zhuo and Wang Hao pass. Wang Lin climbs the trial ladder through illusions of fire anyway, but sunset arrives before he reaches the top.","events":["Prologue: Situ Nan holds the Heaven Defying Bead against experts from outside the realm and is destroyed, vowing to return","Wang Lin (Tie Zhu) and his parents are humiliated by Wang clan relatives over debts","Fourth Uncle brings news that the Heng Yue Sect is recruiting and the Wang family has three places","Wang Lin, Wang Zhuo and Wang Hao go to the sect mountain hidden by the Wind Hanging Cloud Trace Formation","Huang Long's spiritual root test: Wang Zhuo and Wang Hao qualify, Wang Lin fails","Wang Lin attempts the ladder trial, pushing through illusions of fire and crippling","Sunset falls before he reaches the top; a voice in the dark welcomes him"],"introduced":["Wang Lin (Tie Zhu)","Situ Nan","Heaven Defying Bead","Wang Tianshui","Fourth Uncle","Wang Zhuo","Wang Hao","Dao Xu (mentioned)","Huang Long","Heng Yue Sect","Country of Zhao","Wang Clan","Immortal Meeting","Wind Hanging Cloud Trace Formation","spiritual root test","ladder trial","Finger of Death"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":2,"title":"Entering the Sect","summary":"Wang Lin, having failed the ladder, throws himself off a cliff, and the Heaven Defying Bead pulls him into its dream space, where the trapped soul of Situ Nan is waiting. Situ Nan tries to take his body but cannot, and scorns his poor aptitude. Moved by his perseverance, Huang Long accepts Wang Lin as a grey-robed registered disciple, and Zhang Kuang escorts him to the sect. There Wang Lin shares quarters with Zhang Hu and is given the hated water-carrying chores. He finds that water soaked in the bead heals him, and that dew upgrades its water attribute. Situ Nan begins teaching him: Wang Lin reaches level 1 Qi Condensation, learns the Gravity Technique, and is taken as a disciple by Elder Sun Dazhu. The episode ends as the bully Senior Brother Liu Shulang attacks Zhang Hu, and Wang Lin steps in.","events":["Wang Lin wakes in the bead's dream space and meets Situ Nan, trapped there for 1,000 years","Situ Nan fails to take over Wang Lin's mortal body","Huang Long makes an exception and accepts Wang Lin as a registered disciple; Zhang Kuang takes him to the sect","Zhang Hu befriends him; Wang Lin is given the red water-carrying mission card","Wang Lin discovers the bead's healing water and upgrades its water attribute with dew","Liu Shulang beats Wang Lin over 'hidden treasure'; Situ Nan agrees to teach him","Wang Lin reaches level 1 Qi Condensation and learns the Gravity Technique; Elder Sun Dazhu takes him as a disciple","Liu Shulang tries to kill Zhang Hu and Wang Lin intervenes"],"introduced":["Zhang Kuang","Zhang Hu","Liu Shulang","Sun Dazhu (Elder Sun)","Xuan Dao Sect (mentioned)","registered disciple (grey robes)","Heaven Defying Bead dream space","Gravity Technique","cultivation realms list","Zhao Fugui (mentioned)"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin reaches level 1 Qi Condensation. Inside the bead's space, time runs ten times faster than outside. Situ Nan lists the seven steps: Qi Condensation, Foundation Establishment, Core Formation, Nascent Soul, Soul Formation, Soul Transformation, Ascendant.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":3,"title":"The Exchange Match","summary":"After Zhang Hu kills Liu Shulang, Wang Lin covers it up and sends his friend away from the Heng Yue Sect. Situ Nan finds that Wang Lin's master, Sun Dazhu, has poisoned him so that his qi cannot condense, and proposes fighting poison with poison. When the Xuan Dao Sect arrives for the exchange contest, led by Ouyang and their Thousand-legged Centipede guardian beast, Wang Lin is assigned to feed the centipede and soaks himself in its venom. The poison clears and he shoots from level 1 to level 14 Qi Condensation, which he hides from Sun Dazhu. A female Xuan Dao disciple's charm wins over the Heng Yue men, and a young woman from the Luohe Sect, later revealed as Li Muwan, watches with her elder brother. At the contest, Zhou Peng of the Xuan Dao Sect, at level 13 Qi Condensation, beats Heng Yue's champions one after another, including Lu Song.","events":["Zhang Hu kills Liu Shulang; Wang Lin disposes of the body and Zhang Hu leaves the sect","Situ Nan discovers Sun Dazhu's poison blocking Wang Lin's qi","Ouyang brings the Xuan Dao Sect and its Thousand-legged Centipede to Heng Yue","Wang Lin feeds the centipede and uses its venom to burn out the poison, reaching level 14 Qi Condensation","Xuan Dao accuses Wang Lin over the sick centipede; Sun Dazhu shields him and teaches him to hide his cultivation","Li Muwan and her brother of the Luohe Sect arrive through an ancient teleportation array","Zhou Peng (level 13 Qi Condensation) defeats Heng Yue's fighters, including Lu Song"],"introduced":["Ouyang","Thousand-legged Centipede","Zhou Peng","Lu Song","Li Muwan (named in EP15)","Li Qiqing (named in EP15)","Luohe Sect","Ling Cao poison","exchange contest"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin breaks through from level 1 to level 14 Qi Condensation and hides it. Zhou Peng: level 13 Qi Condensation. Sun Dazhu wants Wang Lin at level 3 so he can withstand a soul search.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":4,"title":"Calamity at Heng Yue","summary":"Zhou Peng keeps crushing Heng Yue disciples until Wang Lin, looked down on as a registered disciple, enters the ring, reveals level 14 Qi Condensation and destroys his black ink python, forcing him to surrender. A Heng Yue ancestor makes Wang Lin an inner disciple, and Heng Yue wins the contest. Wang Lin visits his parents and gives them a jade bead to crush if they are ever in danger. Then the Xuan Dao Sect's Nascent Soul ancestor Pu Nanzi attacks Heng Yue Peak, announcing that Heng Yue's master and Nascent Soul ancestors have all died on a foreign battlefield. Huang Long burns his own lifespan to stop him and dies. During the chaos Sun Dazhu traps Wang Lin to take his treasure, but Wang Lin has already poisoned him with Three Corpse Cordyceps tea and kills him. Heng Yue Peak is lost, many disciples join the Xuan Dao Sect, and Wang Lin asks Situ Nan to teach him Foundation Establishment.","events":["Zhou Peng mocks Heng Yue; Wang Lin fights him and reveals level 14 Qi Condensation","Zhou Peng surrenders; a Xuan Dao elder stops Wang Lin and a Heng Yue ancestor protects him and makes him an inner disciple","Wang Lin visits his parents and gives them a jade bead of divine sense","Pu Nanzi of the Xuan Dao Sect comes to seize Heng Yue Peak; Heng Yue's Nascent Soul ancestors died on the foreign battlefield","Huang Long burns his lifespan against Pu Nanzi and dies","Sun Dazhu traps Wang Lin in a Spirit Binding Array; Wang Lin's cordyceps poison turns the tables and he kills him","Heng Yue Peak passes to the Xuan Dao Sect; many disciples defect","Four years later Wang Zhuo trains with the Xuan Dao Sect, and Chang Hao blunders into a senior in closed-door cultivation"],"introduced":["Pu Nanzi","Chang Hao","Spirit Binding Array","Three Corpse Cordyceps","Hualing grass","jade bead of divine sense","foreign battlefield (mentioned)","Heng Yue Peak","Mountain Guard Formation"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin is revealed at level 14 Qi Condensation (Zhou Peng took him for level 6). Pu Nanzi is a Nascent Soul cultivator. Wang Lin is at the peak of Qi Condensation and asks to learn Foundation Establishment.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":5,"title":"Old Friend","summary":"With Qi Condensation complete, Wang Lin travels toward Tianshui City with Yang Sen's escort caravan, looking for a top wood-attribute material for the bead, while Situ Nan turns the jade talisman into a Core Treasure and tells him about the Seize Foundation art. Bandits of Liu San's gang attack for a valuable ginseng, and Wang Lin finds his old friend Zhang Hu among them, serving the bandit chief Bai Zhan. Bai Zhan, at the great perfection of Qi Condensation and a disciple of Ji Mo, sees through Wang Lin and attacks with a fast flying sword. Wang Lin tests Sun Dazhu's treasures on him and kills him with the Core Treasure, and Situ Nan wipes the escorts' memories. Wang Lin and Zhang Hu go to Teng Family City, ruled by a clan with a new Nascent Soul ancestor, where Wang Lin learns the Blood Refining method to bind the captured flying sword. Meanwhile Ji Mo pays the Teng ancestor to avenge his disciple, and the job goes to the ancestor's grandson Teng Li.","events":["Wang Lin joins Yang Sen's escort caravan on the way to Tianshui City","Situ Nan finishes refining the jade talisman into a Core Treasure","Liu San's bandits attack; Zhang Hu is with them, under Bai Zhan","Wang Lin fights Bai Zhan (Qi Condensation great perfection) and kills him with the Core Treasure","Situ Nan erases the escorts' memories; Wang Lin and Zhang Hu reunite","They enter Teng Family City; a Corpse Yin Sect cultivator passes with a corpse puppet","Wang Lin learns the Blood Refining technique for the flying sword","Ji Mo asks the Teng ancestor for revenge; Teng Li takes the task"],"introduced":["Yang Sen","Tianshui City","Liu San","Bai Zhan","Ji Mo","Teng Family City","Teng Huayuan (as the Teng ancestor; named in EP7)","Teng Li","Teng Clan","Corpse Yin Sect","corpse puppet","Core Treasure","Seize Foundation art","Blood Refining technique","Xiao Linzi (Situ Nan's name for Wang Lin)"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin has completed Qi Condensation. Bai Zhan is at Qi Condensation great perfection (level 15), the same as Wang Lin. Zhang Hu is at level 8 Qi Condensation. A Core Treasure holds one strike of a Core Formation cultivator. The Teng clan has a new Nascent Soul ancestor.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":6,"title":"The Teng Family","summary":"In Teng Family City, Zhang Hu tries to sell a thousand-year blood ginseng and is ambushed, and Wang Lin is attacked by Teng disciples hunting Bai Zhan's killer. Teng Li, at late Foundation Establishment, takes Zhang Hu, lures Wang Lin in, and tries to take his blood-refined little sword. Wang Lin, still in Qi Condensation, holds him off with tricks and breaks the lantern formation that blocks flying in the city. Grandfather Teng then lets Teng Li use a Nascent Soul-grade flying sword even if it costs the city, and Situ Nan has to teleport Wang Lin away again and again, draining his own Nascent Soul power. Wang Lin flees into the Mysterious Forest five hundred miles south, full of miasma and the qi-draining Blue Thread Vine. Teng Li follows with his Black Gold Heart Mirror, and Wang Lin swears to cut off the root of anyone who wrongs him twice.","events":["Zhang Hu haggles over the blood ginseng and is ambushed","Wang Lin fights Teng disciples; his little sword is now a top-grade Core Treasure bound to his life","Teng Li (late Foundation Establishment) holds Zhang Hu and fights Wang Lin","Wang Lin breaks the city's lantern formation","The Teng ancestor lets Teng Li use a Nascent Soul flying sword; Situ Nan teleports Wang Lin out","Teng Li's Black Gold Heart Mirror, a Nascent Soul protective treasure, blocks Wang Lin's attacks","Both enter the Mysterious Forest of Blue Thread Vines; Situ Nan is near exhausted"],"introduced":["blood ginseng","Teng Family City lantern formation","Black Gold Heart Mirror","Mysterious Forest","Blue Thread Vine","Nascent Soul flying sword"],"cultivation":"Teng Li: late Foundation Establishment. Wang Lin is still in Qi Condensation. Situ Nan's Nascent Soul power is badly depleted and he can only teleport a few more times.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":7,"title":"Seize Foundation","summary":"Teng Li hunts Wang Lin through the Mysterious Forest, and in a flashback a low-level cultivator is robbed of his heirloom by the spoiled Teng heir. Wang Lin wears Teng Li down with traps and lures him toward a hidden, intelligent corpse demon that fears even the Blue Thread Vines. When its green core, a demonic counterpart of a golden core, explodes and leaves Teng Li exhausted, Wang Lin bets that his flying sword is faster than Teng Li's teleport and kills him. He then uses the Seize Foundation art on Teng Li's body and destroys his soul just as Teng Huayuan arrives too late to save his great-grandson. Teng Huayuan names himself, swears revenge, and spends lifespan to curse Wang Lin so that he can teleport to him whenever Wang Lin comes near. Situ Nan says he can hide Wang Lin as long as they keep their distance, and sends him to find the most yin place to practise the Underworld Ascension Method.","events":["Teng Li bullies a low-level cultivator for an heirloom (flashback)","Wang Lin traps Teng Li in the forest and uses the Black Gold Heart Mirror's limits","A corpse demon's green core explodes on Teng Li","Wang Lin's flying sword kills the exhausted Teng Li","Wang Lin performs the Seize Foundation art on Teng Li and destroys his soul","Teng Huayuan arrives, names himself and lays a lifespan-burning curse on his kin's killer","Situ Nan sends Wang Lin to seek an extreme-yin place for the Underworld Ascension Method"],"introduced":["corpse demon","green core","Seize Foundation art (performed)","Teng Huayuan's curse","Underworld Ascension Method","extreme-yin place"],"cultivation":"Teng Li was at late Foundation Establishment, which is why Situ Nan says he is fit for Seize Foundation. After taking it Wang Lin's cultivation 'greatly advances'; the realm reached is not stated. Teng Huayuan is a Nascent Soul cultivator.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":8,"title":"Dead Ruins","summary":"Situ Nan falls into a deep sleep after spending too much of his Nascent Soul essence, and Wang Lin sets out alone to find a yin-rich place, promising to wake him by forming a core. In ruins that were destroyed overnight, a land of countless deaths, he begins the Underworld Ascension Method, whose nine levels force open three aperture points and form cold cores that may lead straight to Core Formation. A strange figure in yellow paper attacks him; Wang Lin sees through its Core Formation disguise and wins an illusion bead in exchange for his Little Lost Formation. Moving deeper, he breaks through to the fifth level of the method in a tenth-grade extreme-yin spot. A sane corpse puppet called Adai has followed him, hunting the master it rebelled against. That master, Corpse Yin Sect ancestor Wu Yu, is trapped as a Nascent Soul in a statue and offers to teleport Wang Lin to the Corpse Yin Sect if he will bring back his junior brother Ye Zizai, and Wang Lin accepts.","events":["Situ Nan sleeps; Wang Lin leaves to find an extreme-yin place","Wang Lin sets up the Little Lost Formation and starts the Underworld Ascension Method","A yellow-paper weirdo attacks; Wang Lin sees through the Core Formation illusion and gains an illusion bead","In a stronger yin spot, he completes the fifth level of the method","The sane corpse puppet Adai follows him, searching for its master's Nascent Soul","Wu Yu, a Corpse Yin Sect ancestor trapped in a statue, explains corpse puppets and begs for help","Wu Yu opens a teleportation array to the Corpse Yin Sect, and Wang Lin goes to fetch Ye Zizai"],"introduced":["Adai","Wu Yu","Ye Zizai (mentioned)","Little Lost Formation","illusion bead","cold core","Underworld Ascension Method levels","corpse puppet (explained)"],"cultivation":"The Underworld Ascension Method has nine levels; every three levels break one aperture (dantian, qi sea, foot aperture) and form a cold core, and merging the three cold cores can lead directly to Core Formation. Wang Lin completes the fifth level. Wu Yu is a Nascent Soul ancestor of the Corpse Yin Sect.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":9,"title":"Entering the Corpse Yin Sect","summary":"Wang Lin teleports to the Corpse Yin Sect and delivers Wu Yu's message to Ye Zizai, who makes him Wu Yu's disciple, a second-generation disciple of the sect, and keeps Adai for himself but has no intention of rescuing his junior brother. Elder Mu Rong takes Wang Lin to a top-grade earth-yin retreat cave, where he senses a vast trapped presence above Nascent Soul crying for help. Ye Zizai's own corpse puppet, the Flying Rakshasa, turns out to hold an ancient cultivator's spirit that means to devour him. A Cultivation Alliance envoy gathers Zhao's Nascent Soul masters, including Pu Nanzi and the giant demon Chi. Every five hundred years a passage opens to the foreign battlefield, Zhao gets three sect places to fight for in Cassia Valley, and the envoy offers a reward for a particular bead. Teng Huayuan asks Gao Qiming for help tracking Wang Lin and his closest relatives. Ye Zizai sends his Foundation Establishment disciples to Cassia Valley as fodder for their corpse puppets, but Wang Lin, his soul blood not yet taken, turns on Mu Rong's group.","events":["Wang Lin meets Ye Zizai and becomes Wu Yu's disciple; Ye Zizai keeps Adai","Mu Rong leads Wang Lin to an earth-yin retreat; a presence above Nascent Soul begs for help below","Ye Zizai's corpse puppet (the Flying Rakshasa) reveals it is inhabited by an elder's spirit","The Cultivation Alliance envoy convenes Zhao's Nascent Soul cultivators; Pu Nanzi admits destroying Heng Yue","Rules of the Cassia Valley battle: seven tokens, three sects, Foundation Establishment disciples only","The envoy demands a certain bead from the foreign battlefield","Teng Huayuan bribes Gao Qiming with a turtle-shell treasure to find Wang Lin's kin","In Cassia Valley the Corpse Yin disciples' puppets rebel; Wang Lin settles his score with Mu Rong's group"],"introduced":["Ye Zizai","Mu Rong","Flying Rakshasa","Cultivation Alliance","Cultivation Alliance envoy","Chi (giant demon)","Lin Yi","Gao Qiming","He Huan Sect","Cassia Valley","foreign battlefield","qualification tokens","seven-colour lotus","turtle-shell treasure"],"cultivation":"Ye Zizai's corpse puppet is at late Nascent Soul. A visitor's pressure is at Soul Transformation. Mu Rong is at late Foundation Establishment. Wang Lin must reach mid Foundation Establishment before leaving the retreat cave. Only Foundation Establishment disciples may enter Cassia Valley.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":10,"title":"Mourning","summary":"Wang Zhuo and Wang Hao come home to a celebration in the Wang family village, where the family still waits for Tie Zhu. Teng Huayuan arrives with Gao Qiming, finds the village through Wang Lin's blood ties, and starts slaughtering the Wang clan. Wang Lin appears and shouts that he alone killed Teng Li, but he cannot stop the old monster. Before his eyes his father and mother die, refusing to crush the jade bead that would call him back into danger, and Teng Huayuan seals their souls in a Soul Flag, giving Wang Lin three months to come to Cassia Valley. Wang Zhuo and Wang Hao are spared at Pu Nanzi's request. In his grief Wang Lin breaks a bottleneck into the Extreme Realm, which makes him the strongest at his level but caps him at Nascent Soul. Situ Nan says the souls in the flag can one day be revived, and Wang Lin enters Cassia Valley to seize all seven tokens, learning from a captive that Liu Mei holds the last one.","events":["Wang Zhuo (Xuan Dao Sect) and Wang Hao are welcomed home","Teng Huayuan tracks Wang Lin's blood relatives to the village","Teng Huayuan massacres the Wang clan; Wang Lin calls him out but cannot stop him","Wang Lin's parents die; their souls are sealed in the Soul Flag","Wang Zhuo and Wang Hao are spared because Pu Nanzi asked","Wang Lin breaks into the Extreme Realm; Situ Nan explains its price","In Cassia Valley Wang Lin takes tokens from other sects and learns Liu Mei holds the last","Teng Huayuan arrives at the valley"],"introduced":["Wang family village","Soul Flag","Extreme Realm","Liu Mei (mentioned)","Piao Miao Sect"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin breaks a bottleneck and forms the Extreme Realm: the strongest at its level, but from now on he can only reach Nascent Soul. Wang Lin is at Foundation Establishment in Cassia Valley.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":11,"title":"Body Destroyed","summary":"When the Cassia Valley deadline expires, only one of seven tokens remains and word spreads that one person took them all. Wang Lin appears before the gathered Nascent Soul ancestors and challenges Teng Huayuan, using the illusion bead to pass himself off as a mid Nascent Soul expert. He fights with illusions, Blue Ice Flash and a replica flying sword, then breaks open the Soul Flag to reach his parents' souls, but Teng Huayuan seals him in and lets the souls gnaw at him. Wang Lin destroys the last token so that no Zhao sect can enter the foreign battlefield for another five hundred years. As his body is destroyed he looks back on Heng Yue, Zhang Hu and the Wang family, asking whether weakness is the original sin. Situ Nan wakes, uses the last of his soul power to send Wang Lin's last thread of consciousness into the foreign battlefield, and falls asleep again. There, a troll-race expert at Soul Transformation and other cultivators scavenge among dangerous space rifts.","events":["The valley closes; one person has taken all the tokens","Wang Lin confronts Teng Huayuan, using the illusion bead to appear as mid Nascent Soul","Illusions, Blue Ice Flash and a replica sword; Wang Lin cuts off his own hand to contain an explosion","Wang Lin reaches his parents in the Soul Flag and is trapped","All seven tokens are destroyed, closing the foreign battlefield to Zhao for 500 years","Wang Lin's body is destroyed; Situ Nan uses his last power to save his consciousness","Inside the foreign battlefield: troll armour, a space rift, and a Soul Transformation troll"],"introduced":["Blue Ice Flash","space rift","troll race","Qinglong Palace (mentioned)"],"cultivation":"Teng Huayuan calls Wang Lin early Foundation Establishment. Teng Huayuan is a Nascent Soul ancestor. The trolls are said to take human form only at Soul Transformation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":12,"title":"Possession","summary":"A flashback shows Pu Nanzi five hundred years ago, saved near a space rift by a fellow cultivator. Wang Lin's consciousness is swallowed by a rift and drifts in a dead space where he meets Soul Swallowers, who hunt two-tentacled wandering spirits and tell him the rift can only be opened from outside. He spends three hundred years there, only three years outside, growing as a Soul Swallower while the Cultivation Alliance's envoys puzzle over the unstable battlefield and plan to evacuate it. When his consciousness slips out, he finds Ma Liang, a War Shrine Sect disciple from the Fire Country, being robbed by the infamous killers Xu Hao and Ge Yang. Ge Yang stabs Ma Liang in the back after letting him go. As Ma Liang dies, Wang Lin offers a deal: Ma Liang's body in exchange for killing his murderers, and he takes the body.","events":["Flashback: Pu Nanzi is saved near a space rift 500 years ago","Wang Lin's consciousness becomes a Soul Swallower among wandering spirits","300 years pass inside the rift, 3 years outside","Alliance envoys decide to cancel the cleanup and evacuate in three days","Ma Liang is robbed and stabbed by Xu Hao and Ge Yang","Wang Lin's consciousness strikes a deal with the dying Ma Liang and takes his body"],"introduced":["Soul Swallowers","wandering spirits","Ma Liang","Xu Hao","Ge Yang","War Shrine Sect","Fire Country (Hou Fen)"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin is at late Foundation Establishment as he returns.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":13,"title":"Law","summary":"As the foreign battlefield collapses, Wang Lin, now in Ma Liang's body, asks his Soul Swallower friends to slow the collapse and learns that souls cannot cross the boundary law into the living world. Travelling with Ma Liang's comrades Zhou Zihong and a senior brother, he finds that the wandering spirits avoid him, and he uses them to corner Ge Yang and Xu Hao for Ma Liang's token. Xu Hao dies and Ge Yang begs to become his slave, while Zhou Zihong guesses that Ma Liang is gone. At the teleportation array, a black-silk boundary law wipes out every wandering spirit that touches it, and it attacks Wang Lin as a powerful Soul Swallower. Forcing his way through, he is tempered by the law until his consciousness becomes a thread of Extreme consciousness. He crosses back into the living world and vows to repay Teng Huayuan and the Teng family blood for blood.","events":["The Soul Swallowers explain boundary laws and agree to slow the collapse","Wang Lin as Ma Liang rejoins Zhou Zihong and a senior brother; monsters leave them alone","Wandering spirits corner Xu Hao and Ge Yang; Xu Hao is killed and Ge Yang submits","Zhou Zihong learns the real Ma Liang is dead","The black-silk boundary law destroys the spirits at the teleportation array","Wang Lin endures the law, forming an Extreme consciousness, and returns to the living world"],"introduced":["Zhou Zihong","boundary law (black silk)","Extreme consciousness","Ma Liang's token"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's consciousness is refined into a thread of Extreme consciousness, said to let him easily kill anyone at the same level in the living world.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":14,"title":"Refining","summary":"Ma Liang's comrades return to the War Shrine Sect in the Fire Country, and Wang Lin, still posing as Ma Liang, hands Elder Huo his collected materials and goes off alone. In a quiet retreat he explores Ma Liang's body and sea of consciousness, where his Extreme consciousness wakes the Heaven Defying Bead and his little sword. A year later he reaches mid Foundation Establishment. At the Burning Gold Mountains, where the four great sects pick the Burning Gold Fruit, he takes the plant whole, and the Tiangang Sect cultivator Xu Liguo takes him for a devil. Wang Lin erases the original consciousness of Xu Liguo, a former Nascent Soul cultivator, and trains his soul into his own devil servant. He holds the soul blood of Lin Tao and the other two to make them fetch weapon-refining jade slips and maps, then a Nascent Soul elder appears and demands his disciple's soul blood back.","events":["The survivors report to the War Shrine Sect; Wang Lin as Ma Liang meets Elder Huo and leaves","Wang Lin's Extreme consciousness wakes the bead and the little sword","One year later: mid Foundation Establishment","Junior Sister An and others come to pick Burning Gold Fruit; Wang Lin takes the whole plant","Wang Lin turns Xu Liguo's soul into his devil","Lin Tao brings a weapon-refining jade slip and promises a map in ten days","A Nascent Soul elder demands back her disciple's soul blood"],"introduced":["Elder Huo","Lin Tao","An Zi (Junior Sister An)","Xu Liguo","Tiangang Sect","Burning Gold Mountains","Burning Gold Fruit","Melting Spirit Pill","devil (soul servant)","Divine Path technique (War Shrine Sect)"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin reaches mid Foundation Establishment in Ma Liang's body. Xu Liguo says he was a Nascent Soul cultivator in life.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":15,"title":"Fire Beasts","summary":"The Nascent Soul elder is Zhou Zihong's master, and after hearing Wang Lin's terms she lets him return the soul blood on his own word. At the Luohe Sect's alchemy hall a thief tries to steal the Tianli Pill, and Senior Sister Li Muwan foils him. Her brother Li Qiqing mistakes Wang Lin for the thief and attacks him, then apologises. The real thief, Sun Youcai of the Evil Demon Sect, latches onto Wang Lin and leads him to a remote valley to kill him with his senior brother, a fake-core cultivator. Wang Lin kills the senior brother with a single word, his devil swallows the soul, and Sun Youcai flees with the Earth Escape Technique, sure he has met a Soul Formation master. Chasing him, Wang Lin falls into a volcano and finds the lair of fire beasts that capture cultivators, where the Heaven Defying Bead reacts to a fireball that may be the fire beast king.","events":["Zhou Zihong's master lets Wang Lin keep and later return the soul blood","A thief raids the Luohe Sect alchemy hall; Li Muwan stops him","Li Qiqing attacks Wang Lin by mistake and apologises","Sun Youcai of the Evil Demon Sect follows Wang Lin and lures him to a valley","Wang Lin defeats Sun Youcai's fake-core senior brother; Sun Youcai escapes underground","Wang Lin falls into a volcano and finds the fire beasts' lair","The bead reacts to a fireball, possibly the fire beast king"],"introduced":["Tianli Pill","Li Qiqing (named)","Li Muwan (named)","Sun Youcai","Evil Demon Sect","fake core","Earth Escape Technique","Xigufang City","fire beasts","Fire Spirit Beast King"],"cultivation":"Sun Youcai is at late Foundation Establishment; his senior brother is a fake core. Wang Lin is at mid Foundation Establishment.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":16,"title":"Relocation","summary":"The Heaven Defying Bead swallows the weakened fire beast king, perfecting its fire attribute and joining the already complete water attribute, while the enraged fire beasts break loose across the Fire Country. Wang Lin catches Sun Youcai again and gains a pseudo Earth Escape Technique and the Great Self Shura Technique, and chooses the escape technique. The fire beasts overrun the sects' seals and the Nascent Soul ancestors decide that all cultivators of the Fire Country will join a Fire Alliance and move to the Xuanwu Kingdom, leaving mortals to their fate. Li Muwan grieves for the mortals. Fleeing to the border, Wang Lin is caught up in the fighting and brought before the War Shrine Sect, where Feng Luan, Zhou Zihong's mother, reveals she knows his real name. Another War Shrine ancestor wants him dead for stealing Ma Liang's body, but Feng Luan takes Wang Lin as a registered disciple and gives him a Nascent Soul-grade talisman.","events":["The bead swallows the fire beast king and perfects its fire attribute","Wang Lin catches Sun Youcai and gains the pseudo Earth Escape Technique and Great Self Shura Technique","The four sects try to reinforce the volcano seals; the fire beasts break loose","The Luohe, War Shrine, Evil Demon and Corpse Yin sects form the Fire Alliance to move to Xuanwu","Luohe disciple Qingxuan escorts Wang Lin, posing as Ma Liang, to the War Shrine Sect","Feng Luan reveals Wang Lin's name and takes him as a registered disciple","Feng Luan gives Wang Lin a Nascent Soul talisman for the coming war"],"introduced":["Feng Luan","Qingxuan","Fire Alliance","Xuanwu Kingdom","Great Self Shura Technique","pseudo Earth Escape Technique","Nascent Soul talisman"],"cultivation":"Heaven Defying Bead: water and fire attributes perfected, wood at half, metal and earth still missing. Wang Lin is at mid Foundation Establishment.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":17,"title":"The Country Lock and the War on Xuan Wu","summary":"The fire beasts of Huo Fen mutate and grow stronger, and the cultivators of the Huo Chu Alliance break out toward the border with Xuan Wu Country. Li Muwan's elder brother Li Qiqing burns out his consciousness holding back the beasts so that she can escape. The four great sects seal the fire beasts' birthplace, and several Nascent Soul cultivators leave their Nascent Souls inside the Country-Locking Formation to keep the beasts shut inside Huo Fen. Once across the border the alliance storms the Qingxin Sect and announces rewards for kills, counted by a jade talisman, while Luo He Sect offers a Tianli Pill each month to whoever kills the most. Feng Luan gives Wang Lin the first part of Lin Tao's map and promises the rest if he kills 50 Foundation Establishment cultivators, and 150 enemies by the end of the war. Posted with the eighth team to block reinforcements, Wang Lin kills seven Foundation Establishment cultivators in an instant, then fights a late Foundation Establishment cultivator and a Core Formation cultivator who finds him using Earth Escape.","events":["The fire beasts mutate and the Huo Chu Alliance fights its way toward the Xuan Wu border","Li Qiqing dies holding back the beasts, and Li Muwan is told to live on for him","The four great sects seal the fire beasts' birthplace and Nascent Soul cultivators stay behind in the Country-Locking Formation","The alliance crosses into Xuan Wu and takes the Qingxin Sect's mountain gate","Kill rewards are announced, and Luo He Sect offers a monthly Tianli Pill","Feng Luan gives Wang Lin the first part of Lin Tao's map and sets kill targets for the rest","With the eighth team, Wang Lin kills seven Foundation Establishment cultivators at once","He takes on a late Foundation Establishment cultivator and then a Core Formation cultivator"],"introduced":["Country-Locking Formation","Huo Chu Alliance","Qingxin Sect","Xuan Wu Country","Tianli Pill","kill-count jade talisman"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin is at mid Foundation Establishment. The leader of his eighth team is at early Core Formation. Xu Liguo calls him unbeatable below Core Formation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":18,"title":"False Core and the Sea of Devils","summary":"Wang Lin is trapped in a formation by a Core Formation cultivator, kills him and takes his golden core. Absorbing a tenth of it lifts him from mid Foundation Establishment to the False Core stage, and Feng Luan gives him the second part of the map. News comes that the Nascent Souls guarding the Country-Locking Formation have been killed and the fire beasts are loose again. Feng Luan's daughter Zhou Zihong, who knows he is not the real Ma Liang, offers him the last map if he kills Xu Si and Zhou An, the pair who betrayed Ma Liang, and he kills them both. Fleeing the fire beasts, he saves Li Muwan of Luo He Sect from a mid Core Formation cultivator of the Dual Cultivation Sect and claims the half-finished Tianli Pill she carries. With her he crosses the border by Earth Escape into the cold, fog-covered Sea of Devils, where the fire beasts cannot follow. There he decides to dig a cave and form his core.","events":["A Core Formation cultivator traps Wang Lin in a formation; Wang Lin kills him and seizes his golden core","Absorbing a tenth of the core lifts Wang Lin to the False Core stage","Feng Luan gives him the second map","The Nascent Souls in the Country-Locking Formation are killed and the fire beasts break out","Zhou Zihong trades the last map for the deaths of Xu Si and Zhou An; Wang Lin kills them","Wang Lin saves Li Muwan from a Dual Cultivation Sect cultivator and learns she carries a half-finished Tianli Pill","The two flee by Earth Escape into the fog of the Sea of Devils"],"introduced":["Sea of Devils","False Core stage","Dual Cultivation Sect","Blood-Devouring Demon Formation"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin rises from mid Foundation Establishment to the False Core stage (a Foundation Establishment great perfection one step below Core Formation) after absorbing about 10% of a seized golden core. Li Muwan's attacker is at mid Core Formation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":19,"title":"The Jiao of the Fourteenth Valley","summary":"In the Sea of Devils three cultivators of the Fighting Evil Sect demand that Wang Lin hand over Li Muwan, and he kills them with what Li Muwan recognises as the death spell, an ancient demonic technique built from Yin energy, death energy and killing energy. He takes her into an abandoned cave, protects it with the Nine Li Corpse Bone Formation, and orders her to refine pills for him until he forms his core. He goes looking for spirit-beast bones to strengthen the formation, and a Fighting Evil Sect disciple, Sang Muya, guides him to the Valley of Corpses. In the icy fourteenth valley he kills a jiao dragon stronger than a Nascent Soul cultivator. He comes back after ten days instead of three, builds its bones into the Nine Li Jiao Dragon Formation, and gives Li Muwan the jiao's core and marrow. Using the Underworld Ascension Method, he forms cold pills in three places in his body, but they will not merge and he falls unconscious, and Xu Liguo sees his chance to break free.","events":["Wang Lin kills three Fighting Evil Sect cultivators who want Li Muwan","Li Muwan explains the death spell and the three energies behind it","Wang Lin sets up the Nine Li Corpse Bone Formation in an abandoned cave and demands Li Muwan's soul blood","Sang Muya kills his senior brother, then leads Wang Lin to the Valley of Corpses","Wang Lin kills a jiao dragon in the fourteenth valley and rebuilds the formation as the Nine Li Jiao Dragon Formation","Li Muwan makes a jiao-skin garment for him","Situ Nan explains the Underworld Ascension Method; the three cold pills fail to merge and Wang Lin collapses","Xu Liguo thinks his moment for freedom has come"],"introduced":["Fighting Evil Sect","Sang Muya","death spell","Nine Li Corpse Bone Formation","Valley of Corpses","Nine Li Jiao Dragon Formation","jiao core and dragon marrow","Underworld Ascension Method"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin is still in the False Core stage and tries to form a real core with the Underworld Ascension Method: three cold pills that must merge into one. The jiao he kills is said to be stronger than a Nascent Soul cultivator.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":20,"title":"Ice Flame, a Grade Nine Weapon Core and the Beast Spirit Furnace","summary":"Xu Liguo turns on the unconscious Wang Lin, but finds that Wang Lin left a strand of consciousness in him and backs down at once. Since his body cannot bear the cold of the merging pills, Wang Lin decides to make it completely cold and moves deep into the fourteenth valley to cultivate. Over three years the fire-beast crisis in Huo Fen is ended by a rank four cultivation country, and the war with Xuan Wu settles into a truce. His core embryo forms and an ice flame appears in him. From the spirit-beast skulls buried under the valley he refines a rare grade nine weapon core to upgrade his flying sword. He then goes to Nan Dou City, one of the 998 cities of the Sea of Devils, and trades a jiao skin at the Refining Pavilion for the grade five Hundred Beast Spirit Furnace, which the Fighting Evil Sect had reserved but never paid for. Three Core Formation cultivators chase him out of the city to take it.","events":["Xu Liguo turns on the unconscious Wang Lin, then backs down on finding Wang Lin's consciousness inside him","Li Muwan refuses to give up her Yin for the death spell; she will only refine pills","Wang Lin chills his body and cultivates deep in the fourteenth valley for three years","The fire-beast crisis ends and the Huo Chu Alliance settles in Xuan Wu","Wang Lin's core embryo forms; he finds an ice flame and refines a grade nine weapon core from buried skulls","In Nan Dou City he trades a jiao skin for the Hundred Beast Spirit Furnace","Three Core Formation cultivators hunt him outside the city"],"introduced":["Nan Dou City","Refining Pavilion","Hundred Beast Spirit Furnace","Qingxuan Pill Furnace","ice flame","weapon core"],"cultivation":"After three years Wang Lin's core embryo is complete and only the final push to Core Formation is left. The Refining Pavilion clerk reads him as Foundation Establishment great perfection.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":21,"title":"Core Formation","summary":"Elders of the Fighting Evil Sect, including Kun Sang, chase Wang Lin for a day and a night, and when their Great Elder arrives with more Core Formation cultivators he flees back to the cave. Li Muwan has waited three years for him, and she uses the Hundred Beast Spirit Furnace to refine a Tianli Pill from demonic blood vine while he tries to form his core. The Nine Li Corpse Bone Formation holds for three days before the elders break it. The Great Elder grabs Li Muwan to keep as a cultivation cauldron and tries to take the furnace, and she is ready to die rather than give him up. Wang Lin breaks through to Core Formation, kills a Core Formation elder in an instant and declares himself the strongest below Nascent Soul. The terrified Great Elder flees, and Wang Lin takes Li Muwan with him to hunt down the rest.","events":["Wang Lin fights Fighting Evil Sect elders for a day and a night, then more arrive with their Great Elder","A mid Core Formation elder wounds him with a Great Extinction Talisman; his jiao armour saves him","Li Muwan refines a Tianli Pill from demonic blood vine in the Hundred Beast Spirit Furnace","The elders break the Nine Li Corpse Bone Formation after three days","The Great Elder seizes Li Muwan and the furnace; she resolves to repay Wang Lin with her life","Wang Lin forms his core and kills a Core Formation elder instantly","The Great Elder flees; Wang Lin takes Li Muwan with him to hunt the elders"],"introduced":["Kun Sang","Great Extinction Talisman","demonic blood vine","Immortal-Trapping Net"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin breaks through to Core Formation and calls himself the strongest cultivator below Nascent Soul. One of the pursuing elders is at mid Core Formation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":22,"title":"The Hundred-Day Kill Order","summary":"Wang Lin hunts down the Fighting Evil Sect elders one after another. Their Great Elder, Qian Kun, runs to a branch held by Mu Nan and Mu Bei and, before he dies, opens the Ten Thousand Devils Hundred-Day Kill Order. It is one of only ten such orders left in the Sea of Devils: whoever kills the marked person takes their whole cultivation, and if the marked person survives a hundred days, they gain the opener's cultivation instead. Wang Lin makes Mu Nan and Mu Bei guide him to the sect's headquarters, and on the way he crushes Shangguan Mo, the so-called Black Devil, who begs to become his disciple and hands over his soul blood. Core Formation hunters drawn by the kill mark gather around him. One of them, Xue Ming, a former Great Elder of the Fighting Evil Sect, raises his allies to late Core Formation with the Ten Thousand Blood Demon Formation. Wang Lin realises the formation runs on death energy, finds its eye and breaks it, and lets Xu Liguo feast on the souls of the dead.","events":["Wang Lin kills the fleeing Fighting Evil Sect elders one by one","Qian Kun reaches Mu Nan and Mu Bei, opens the Hundred-Day Kill Order on Wang Lin and dies","Mu Nan and Mu Bei are made to guide Wang Lin to the sect headquarters, whose leader is at peak late Core Formation","Shangguan Mo, the 'Black Devil', is beaten, submits as a disciple and gives up his soul blood","Core Formation hunters gather; Wang Lin kills those who stay past three breaths","Xue Ming's Ten Thousand Blood Demon Formation lifts its users from mid to late Core Formation","Wang Lin breaks the formation and lets Xu Liguo devour the souls"],"introduced":["Qian Kun","Mu Nan","Mu Bei","Shangguan Mo","Xue Ming","Old Ouyang","Zhu Kun","Ten Thousand Devils Hundred-Day Kill Order","Ten Thousand Blood Demon Formation"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin is at early Core Formation. The Fighting Evil Sect leader is at late Core Formation, at its peak and close to breaking through. Xue Ming is at mid Core Formation; his blood formation raises its users to late Core Formation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":23,"title":"The Dragon Fighting Formation","summary":"Wang Lin reaches the headquarters of the Fighting Evil Sect with Li Muwan, Shangguan Mo, Mu Nan and Mu Bei, and Li Muwan admits to herself that she once mistook him for Sun Youcai. The sect leader, Jie Donglai, meets him with the Dragon Fighting Formation, powered by 13,562 disciples and said to be unbreakable by anyone below Nascent Soul. Drawing on the formation, Jie Donglai rises from late Core Formation to great perfection and then to the False Nascent Soul realm, which is between Core Formation and true Nascent Soul. He brushes off the death spell, since the formation pours ten thousand people's power into him. Wang Lin, fighting at Core Formation, is wounded, and Jie Donglai turns on Li Muwan. Xu Liguo urges a retreat, but Wang Lin refuses. In the end Li Muwan works out how to break the formation.","events":["Wang Lin's group arrives at the Fighting Evil Sect headquarters","Jie Donglai raises the Dragon Fighting Formation with 13,562 disciples","Mu Nan and Mu Bei offer to broker peace; Shangguan Mo calls it a trick","Jie Donglai climbs to Core Formation great perfection and then the False Nascent Soul realm","The death spell has no effect; Wang Lin is wounded and Jie Donglai goes after Li Muwan","Xu Liguo urges a retreat; Wang Lin refuses","Li Muwan finds the way to break the Dragon Fighting Formation"],"introduced":["Jie Donglai","Dragon Fighting Formation","False Nascent Soul realm"],"cultivation":"Jie Donglai is at late Core Formation and, through the Dragon Fighting Formation, rises to Core Formation great perfection and then the False Nascent Soul realm. Wang Lin fights at Core Formation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":24,"title":"Leader of the Fighting Evil Sect","summary":"Li Muwan has seen that the Dragon Fighting Formation's power fades with distance, so Wang Lin keeps pulling Jie Donglai away from it and destroys its true eye, the dragon-pattern sword. Jie Donglai is killed, and the Fighting Evil Sect takes Wang Lin as its new leader. While Wang Lin is in seclusion, Xu Liguo forms a core from the souls he swallowed, regains some memories and tries to fight him, but is forced to spit the souls out. Wang Lin takes Li Muwan on killing trips, remembers his parents hoping he would bring home a wife, and after four years in the Sea of Devils escorts her back to its edge. They part with gifts: he returns her soul blood with a protective trace of his consciousness, and she gives him her pills and a jade slip holding a formation she refined from the Dragon Fighting Formation. Wang Lin promises Situ Nan to free him once he reaches Soul Transformation, the kill order vanishes ten days into the succession ceremony, and he swears to bury every Teng in Zhao with Teng Huayuan once he forms his Nascent Soul. Meanwhile a stranger asks to be led to the man who uses the death spell.","events":["Wang Lin uses distance to weaken Jie Donglai and breaks the Dragon Fighting Formation's eye, the dragon-pattern sword","Jie Donglai falls and Wang Lin becomes leader of the Fighting Evil Sect","Xu Liguo forms a core, regains some memories, fights Wang Lin and loses","Wang Lin remembers his parents; after four years he sends Li Muwan back across the sea","Li Muwan gives him pills and a jade slip with her Dragon Fighting Formation; he returns her soul blood","Wang Lin promises Situ Nan to free him at Soul Transformation","The Hundred-Day Kill Order vanishes at his succession ceremony; he vows revenge on Teng Huayuan","A stranger asks to be led to the Fighting Evil Sect leader"],"introduced":["dragon-pattern sword","Dragon Fighting Formation jade slip"],"cultivation":"Xu Liguo recovers to late Foundation Establishment, then forms a core from the souls he swallowed. Wang Lin keeps Qian Kun's golden core to help when he forms his Nascent Soul, and names Soul Transformation as the stage at which he will free Situ Nan.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":25,"title":"Duanmu Ji's Hunt","summary":"A Soul Formation cultivator, Duanmu Ji, the Eighth Extreme Demon Lord and one of the city lords of Seven Plum City, comes to the Fighting Evil Sect looking for its leader, but Wang Lin has already gone. Wanting a secret technique to raise his chances of forming a Nascent Soul, Wang Lin returns to the Huo Chu Alliance in Xuan Wu as Ma Liang and asks the War God Temple to show him its Divine Path Art, but the ancestor refuses a loose cultivator. Duanmu Ji tracks him down, smashes the alliance's mountain-protecting formation and covers all of Xuan Wu with a divine-sense lock. Wang Lin hides inside the Heaven Defying Bead, and Situ Nan warns him he can only stay there for a limited time. After three years Duanmu Ji catches him. Duanmu Ji only wants to borrow his death spell for a raid on a dangerous secret place, and offers a Huadi Pill and a Liying Pill, with talk of Infant Transformation Pills inside. Wang Lin agrees, a strand of consciousness is planted in him, and with Duanmu Ji standing behind him the War God Temple ancestor lets him see the Divine Path Art on condition that he never involves the temple again.","events":["Duanmu Ji arrives at the Fighting Evil Sect and finds Wang Lin gone","Wang Lin, as Ma Liang, asks the War God Temple for the Divine Path Art and is refused","Duanmu Ji breaks the alliance's mountain-protecting formation and puts a divine-sense lock over Xuan Wu","Situ Nan explains the time limits of hiding in the Heaven Defying Bead","After three years Duanmu Ji catches Wang Lin and asks for his death spell for a treasure hunt","He offers a Huadi Pill and a Liying Pill and plants a strand of consciousness in Wang Lin","The War God Temple ancestor opens the stone chamber of the Divine Path Art"],"introduced":["Duanmu Ji","Seven Plum City","Divine Path Art","Divine Sense Realm Lock","Huadi Pill","Liying Pill","Infant Transformation Pill"],"cultivation":"Duanmu Ji is at Soul Formation. Wang Lin is at Core Formation and judges Ma Liang's body poor for forming a Nascent Soul. Duanmu Ji says the secret place can only be fully explored at late Nascent Soul or above, and that one Infant Transformation Pill gives a chance at Soul Transformation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":26,"title":"The Divine Path Art and the Chaotic Broken Stars","summary":"Inside the War God Temple's cave Wang Lin studies the Divine Path Art, which the ancestor Chen Chong carved onto a stone tablet from memory before dying soon after. Some law stops it being memorised; the art makes a clone that cultivates alongside the body and merges with it when the Nascent Soul forms. Meanwhile Xu Liguo secretly calls his old sect for help, and the Corpse Yin Sect, which owes his return to its upper sect in Tiangang Country, arrives with eight Nascent Soul cultivators to take Ma Liang away. They attack with the Nine Nether Black Ice Formation, but Duanmu Ji drives them off with ease. He also sees that Wang Lin lured them there on purpose, either to use him against his enemies or to escape in the confusion. Duanmu Ji then takes Wang Lin by an ancient teleportation array to the Chaotic Broken Stars, the way into the Land of the Ancient God, where they meet other great devils of the inner Sea of Devils, among them Gu Di and the Six Desire Devil Lord. Hunchback Meng is still missing, and each devil pays top-grade spirit stones to open the way.","events":["Wang Lin studies the Divine Path Art carved by Chen Chong and finds it cannot be memorised","He learns the art makes a clone that merges with the body at Nascent Soul, but decides he lacks the resources","Xu Liguo calls the Corpse Yin Sect for help; the sect sets out for the Huo Chu Alliance","Eight Corpse Yin Sect Nascent Soul cultivators demand Ma Liang and use the Nine Nether Black Ice Formation","Duanmu Ji drives them off and sees that Wang Lin lured them on purpose","Duanmu Ji and Wang Lin teleport to the Chaotic Broken Stars","They meet Gu Di and the Six Desire Devil Lord, and top-grade spirit stones are paid to open the way"],"introduced":["Chen Chong","Corpse Yin Sect","Tiangang Sect","Nine Nether Black Ice Formation","Chaotic Broken Stars","Land of the Ancient God","Gu Di","Six Desire Devil Lord","Hunchback Meng","Giant Demon Clan","top-grade spirit stones","Planet Suzaku"],"cultivation":"Duanmu Ji, at Soul Formation, routs eight early Nascent Soul cultivators of the Corpse Yin Sect. The Six Desire Devil Lord is one of the seven city lords of the inner Sea of Devils.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":27,"title":"Inside the Ancient God","summary":"Following the floating pumice of the Chaotic Broken Stars, the group reaches the entrance to the first trial, inside the body of an ancient god so huge that a single hair passage could dwarf a planet. Duanmu Ji explains that they have come for the Infant Transformation Pill. The ancient god's consciousness only sleeps, and whoever enters its body may take the techniques stored in its memory. When a desolate beast attacks and the devils scatter, Wang Lin realises it is only a parasite living inside a dead beast's corpse, so he slips into its belly, kills it and takes its marrow, which Li Muwan said was the real treasure. Crossing a few hundred feet of void filled with clever alien creatures takes him fifteen days and uses up all his magic treasures. At the last crack he survives with the formation from Li Muwan's jade slip. At the sealed entrance ordinary spirit stones do nothing, so he forces his way in.","events":["The devils follow the pumice to the first trial inside the ancient god's body","Duanmu Ji reveals the goals: the Infant Transformation Pill and the ancient god's memories","A desolate beast attacks and the devils scatter","Wang Lin sees the beast is a parasite in a corpse, kills it from inside and takes its marrow","Clever void creatures force him into a fifteen-day crossing that uses up his treasures","Li Muwan's jade-slip formation saves him at the last crack","Spirit stones fail at the entrance, so he breaks in"],"introduced":["ancient god","desolate beast","void creatures"],"cultivation":"Duanmu Ji is at mid Soul Formation; the desolate beast is at Soul Formation great perfection.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":28,"title":"The Hurricane Beasts","summary":"Past the entrance, Wang Lin finds the first trial is built on yin-yang and the five elements, and he picks the earth region, where his Earth Escape works like walking on flat ground. He sends Xu Liguo ahead to scout, paying him in souls. A living hurricane made of countless small wind beasts attacks them, but a black tower holds a restriction the beasts cannot pass. Xu Liguo, who can swallow the wind beasts that hit him, sweeps through the hurricane and devours them. Wang Lin realises the little beasts merge their souls well, so he has Xu Liguo spit out the souls he took and uses them to create a stronger demon of his own that can draw a whole hurricane after it. Ahead, an entire hurricane has been poisoned, which only Hunchback Meng could do, and Meng and his toad Li Tian are killing their way through.","events":["Wang Lin works out that the first trial follows yin-yang and the five elements, and chooses the earth path","Xu Liguo is forced to scout in return for souls","A living hurricane of wind beasts attacks; a black tower shelters Wang Lin","Xu Liguo devours the wind beasts","Wang Lin fuses the beast souls into a stronger demon that can command a hurricane","They find a hurricane poisoned by Hunchback Meng, who is fighting with his toad Li Tian"],"introduced":["hurricane beasts","black tower","Li Tian (Hunchback Meng's toad)"],"cultivation":"Hunchback Meng is a Soul Formation poison cultivator. He kills beasts at Core Formation and Nascent Soul level with ease.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":29,"title":"Hunchback Meng and the Beast King","summary":"Wang Lin's new demon kills a hurricane beast at the False Nascent Soul level, and the deeper he goes the stronger the beasts inside the hurricanes become. Hunchback Meng's killing draws out the Hurricane Beast King, which is at Soul Formation great perfection. To fight it, Meng takes the inner core of Li Tian, the toad he has raised for a thousand years, and reaches Soul Formation great perfection himself. He kills the Beast King with Nine Nether Poison and the leftover poison of his Poison King Cauldron, but loses his life-bound treasure and is left drained. Seeing that Meng is almost spent, Wang Lin decides he cannot kill him with strength alone but can still finish him, and he attacks. Meng sees him, and as the fight stirs up the hurricanes, Wang Lin finds there is no going back.","events":["Wang Lin's demon kills a hurricane beast at the False Nascent Soul level","Hunchback Meng draws out the Hurricane Beast King, at Soul Formation great perfection","Meng swallows his toad Li Tian's core and reaches Soul Formation great perfection","Meng kills the Beast King with Nine Nether Poison and the Poison King Cauldron's leftover poison","Wang Lin attacks the drained Meng","Meng spots them and the fighting stirs the hurricanes behind them"],"introduced":["Hurricane Beast King","Nine Nether Poison","Poison King Cauldron"],"cultivation":"The Hurricane Beast King is at Soul Formation great perfection. Hunchback Meng reaches Soul Formation great perfection by swallowing his toad's core. A beast at the False Nascent Soul level is the most Wang Lin's demon can handle.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":30,"title":"The Bridge of No Return","summary":"Wang Lin escapes the angry beasts with Xu Liguo and his demon, which now leads beasts of its own. Hunchback Meng's storage bag no longer holds his soul, so Meng is dead, and Wang Lin claims his treasures, the best of which is the Poison King Cauldron. Once the Medicine King Cauldron of a rank three cultivation country, it is what Meng killed his own master to get, and its green mist can wipe out divine sense. Next comes the Bridge of No Return, where whoever steps on can never turn back. Illusions of his parents cry for Tie Zhu to save them from the Teng clan and ask why he will not look back, but Wang Lin sees through them, since his real parents protected him to their deaths, and keeps walking. Beyond the bridge is the second trial, the Forbidden Mountain, covered in restrictions, where someone has already gone ahead. A thousand years earlier, a disciple called Yi'er was taught by a master that restrictions are a flexible kind of formation that can be broken by force or by study, and swore to fulfil the master's unfinished dream.","events":["Wang Lin escapes with Xu Liguo and the demon, which now leads its own beasts","He finds Meng dead and takes the Poison King Cauldron and other treasures","They reach the Bridge of No Return","Illusions of his parents beg him to turn back; he sees through them and goes on","They reach the second trial, the Forbidden Mountain","A flashback shows Yi'er learning restrictions from a master a thousand years ago","Someone has passed the restrictions ahead of them and changed them"],"introduced":["Poison King Cauldron (Medicine King Cauldron)","Bridge of No Return","Forbidden Mountain","Yi'er","restrictions"],"confidence":"medium"},{"ep":31,"title":"Forbidden Mountain","summary":"On the Forbidden Mountain Wang Lin follows quietly behind the Six Desire Devil Lord, the restriction master who has studied restrictions for a thousand years and is breaking a path up the mountain while leaving new traps behind. Breaking the restrictions by force would kill a Core Formation cultivator, so Wang Lin studies them slowly, using Xu Liguo to test each one. After seven years he finds that the formation eyes are made of divine sense, and learns to break restrictions with his divine sense instead of spirit energy. Months later he is sure he can do whatever the Six Desire Devil Lord can do. Duanmu Ji arrives and smashes upward by force, sure the mountain cannot stop him since he crossed it a thousand years ago, and finds a thunder restriction that someone has tampered with. As Duanmu Ji closes in, Wang Lin hides in a fog that no divine sense can see through, after making Xu Liguo cough up the souls he refined to shield against the Soul Formation cultivators' senses.","events":["Wang Lin trails the Six Desire Devil Lord up the Forbidden Mountain","Breaking restrictions by force is too dangerous at Core Formation, so he studies them","After seven years he learns to break restrictions with divine sense","Duanmu Ji arrives and breaks restrictions by force","Duanmu Ji finds a tampered thunder restriction and blames the Six Desire Devil Lord","Wang Lin hides in a fog that blocks divine sense, using Xu Liguo's refined souls as cover"],"introduced":["Divine Sense Circle (breaking restrictions with divine sense)"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin is still at Core Formation. Seven years after reaching the mountain he masters breaking restrictions with divine sense.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":32,"title":"Breaking the Restrictions","summary":"Hiding in the fog, Wang Lin breaks the Six Desire Devil Lord's last chains of restrictions with a single sword so that the two Soul Formation cultivators will fight each other. Near the summit, Duanmu Ji catches the Six Desire Devil Lord, who has slowed down to protect a disciple left behind by their own master. Duanmu Ji blames the Six Desire Devil Lord for the deadly chains of restrictions, which Wang Lin in fact set. While they argue, Wang Lin sets off the mountain's final restriction on both of them, and the two badly hurt devils retreat. Left alone, Wang Lin studies for three years and breaks every restriction on the Forbidden Mountain. Tu Si, an Ancient God of eight stars, then appears, names him the fourth Enlightened One, and gives him a jade slip on making restriction flags and a piece of the starry sky's Mojian Stone. With these he passes the main tower, where many earlier intruders took their rewards, and enters a whirlpool to the third trial, the Annihilation Realm.","events":["Wang Lin breaks restrictions with one sword so that Duanmu Ji will catch the Six Desire Devil Lord","The Six Desire Devil Lord is held back by protecting a disciple left by their master","Duanmu Ji blames the Six Desire Devil Lord for the chains of restrictions, which Wang Lin set","Wang Lin sets off the final restriction on both Soul Formation cultivators","Alone, he spends three years breaking every restriction on the mountain","Tu Si names him the fourth Enlightened One and gives him a restriction-flag jade slip and Mojian Stone","He enters the whirlpool to the third trial, the Annihilation Realm"],"introduced":["Tu Si","Enlightened Ones","restriction flag","Mojian Stone","Annihilation Realm","Residual Rainbow Jade Sword"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin, still at Core Formation, breaks every restriction on the Forbidden Mountain. Duanmu Ji and the Six Desire Devil Lord are both Soul Formation cultivators.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":33,"title":"Puppets of the Blood Sea","summary":"In the third trial of the Land of the Ancient God, the Dead Space, Wang Lin finds that although he has a body again he is still a Soul Devourer here, so the wandering souls fear him as an evil star and obey him. Duanmu Ji, whose cultivation has dropped, corners him and demands the inheritance; Wang Lin offers him a hand seal for passing the vortex at the end of the trial in exchange for leaving together. Hunchback Meng, thought dead, returns as a mindless puppet and kills Duanmu Ji, so Wang Lin leads him toward Xu Liqing, the Six Desire Devil Lord, and sets the wandering souls on him. Meng, now at late Soul Formation, overpowers Xu Liqing until Xu Liqing's long-dead master, the Sky Devil Magician of the Xuan Tian Sect, appears and destroys him. The hand seal fails at the vortex, and puppets sent by their master begin hunting for the Soul Devourer, while the Sky Devil Magician reveals the truth: the land is Tuo Sen's trap, and everyone who dies here is revived in the Blood Sea as his puppet.","events":["Wandering souls in the Dead Space flee from Wang Lin, the 'evil star', who can devour and command them","Duanmu Ji demands the inheritance; Wang Lin trades him a hand seal for the final vortex","Hunchback Meng returns from the dead as a puppet and kills Duanmu Ji","Wang Lin diverts Meng onto Xu Liqing, the Six Desire Devil Lord, and attacks him with wandering souls","The Sky Devil Magician, Xu Liqing's master, appears and destroys Meng","The hand seal fails at the vortex; puppets search for the Soul Devourer","The Sky Devil Magician explains Tuo Sen's trap and the Blood Sea, and leads Xu Liqing on"],"introduced":["Sky Devil Magician","Xuan Tian Sect","Dead Space (third trial)","Blood Sea","Soul Devourer","Tuo Sen (named)"],"cultivation":"Hunchback Meng, as Tuo Sen's puppet: late Soul Formation. The Sky Devil Magician: late Soul Formation, ancestor of the Xuan Tian Sect.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":34,"title":"The Memory of Tu Si","summary":"The Sky Devil Magician leads Xu Liqing into the sea made from the Ancient God's consciousness: the red Blood Sea that seals Tuo Sen and the blue Dead Sea that holds the Ancient God's memories. He has Xu Liqing absorb the Ancient God's six desires with an Ancient God hand bone, then reveals that he raised his disciple for four thousand years only as a vessel, and sacrifices him to refine a memory crystal. Duomu, a powerful envoy of Tuo Sen, arrives, shatters the crystal and drags the Sky Devil Magician off to keep searching for the Soul Devourer, while Wang Lin, hiding, picks up the crystal as it re-forms. Inside it the Ancient God Tu Si tells him that Tuo Sen is an evil thought split from his own mind, that he sealed Tuo Sen in the Blood Sea and his memory inheritance in the Dead Sea, and begs Wang Lin not to let Tuo Sen get it. Wang Lin gains part of the memory inheritance, but Duomu catches him at the end.","events":["The sea of the Ancient God's consciousness is split into the Blood Sea and the Dead Sea","Xu Liqing absorbs the six desires with the Ancient God hand bone","The Sky Devil Magician sacrifices Xu Liqing to refine a memory crystal","Duomu crushes the crystal and takes the Sky Devil Magician away","Wang Lin takes the re-formed crystal and meets the memory of Tu Si","Tu Si explains Tuo Sen's origin and asks Wang Lin to keep the inheritance from him","Wang Lin gains part of the memory inheritance; Duomu captures him"],"introduced":["Duomu","Dead Sea","Xuan Tian Demon Desire technique","memory inheritance","Ancient God hand bone","Ancient Gods (clan born from the stars)"],"confidence":"medium"},{"ep":35,"title":"The Eleven Prisoners","summary":"Wang Lin flees through the Ancient God's meridians, drinks raw dragon marrow fluid and uses the first level of the Ancient God art, Spirit Snatch, to take its power as his own. Duomu catches him and brings him before their master Tuo Sen, who sees he is a young Soul Devourer and makes him swallow a soul core so he can break the seal on Tuo Sen within ten years. Duomu then reveals that he and ten others are outside cultivators trapped by Tuo Sen for a thousand years, and asks Wang Lin to turn the Ancient God's consciousness against Tuo Sen once he enters the Dead Sea. They promise him a hundred top-grade spirit stones and the Hunyuan Beast-Driving Ring, and Wang Lin also demands their own life-bound treasures as a guarantee. Wang Lin breaks the seal, Tuo Sen claims the God Slaying Spear and opens the passage to the memory inheritance, and the eleven quietly surround him.","events":["Wang Lin drinks dragon marrow fluid in the Ancient God's meridians and uses Spirit Snatch","Duomu brings Wang Lin to Tuo Sen","Tuo Sen makes Wang Lin swallow a soul core to break his seal","Duomu's eleven trapped cultivators plot with Wang Lin against Tuo Sen","Wang Lin takes their life-bound treasures as a guarantee","Tuo Sen is freed, takes the God Slaying Spear and opens the passage to the memory inheritance"],"introduced":["Spirit Snatch (Ancient God art, level 1)","dragon marrow fluid","God Slaying Spear","Hunyuan Beast-Driving Ring","soul core"],"confidence":"medium"},{"ep":36,"title":"Inheritance","summary":"Li Peng, the divine beast that guards the Dead Sea, bars Tuo Sen from the memory inheritance, and Duomu's group springs a God-locking formation; it turns out one of the eleven has taken over the beast's body. Wang Lin refuses to strike at the agreed moment, and when they turn on him their treasures will not respond, because he had placed Ancient God restrictions on them. Tuo Sen crushes them all with the Ancient God's power, but Wang Lin works out that the memory inheritance is hidden inside Tuo Sen himself and can only be entered by divine sense, and he sacrifices a clone to seize it. Tu Si's final message explains that Ancient Gods grow stronger by reshaping their bodies, that Wang Lin has gone through one reshaping, and where the Ink Stone chamber lies. Wang Lin returns to his own original body, reshaped by the Ancient God's power, gathers treasures and leaves the Land of the Ancient God, while Tuo Sen learns the inheritance reappears every thousand years and vows to kill him.","events":["Li Peng, guardian beast of the Dead Sea, fights Tuo Sen; the God-locking formation is sprung","Wang Lin stays out of the fight; the plotters' treasures fail because of his Ancient God restrictions","Tuo Sen kills the plotters with Ancient God power","Wang Lin finds the memory inheritance inside Tuo Sen and sacrifices a clone to take it","Tu Si explains body reshaping and the Ink Stone chamber","Wang Lin returns to his reshaped original body and leaves the Land of the Ancient God","Tuo Sen tortures a captive and swears revenge on Wang Lin"],"introduced":["Li Peng","Ink Stone chamber","body reshaping (Ancient God)","God-locking formation"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's body is reshaped once by the Ancient God's memory; Tu Si says he went through eight reshapings.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":37,"title":"Concubine Yun","summary":"Leaving through the Chaotic Broken Stars, Wang Lin, at late Core Formation, fights stone copies of himself and finds that they can copy his treasures but not the body rebuilt by the Ancient God's power. He comes out beside Mo Yun, last disciple of the Qihuang Sect, who is fleeing Qian Kun of the Poison Demon Palace for stealing her sect's ancestral furnace. Both take him for a Soul Formation expert, and Mo Yun tells him that Hunchback Meng, Duanmu Ji, the Six Desire Devil Lord and the old Ancient Emperor of the Heavenly Devil Cave vanished in the Broken Stars 200 years ago. Because Qian Kun belongs to Meng's line and could spread word of his escape, Wang Lin has Xu Liguo devour him, absorbs most of his golden core, and puts an ancient restriction on Mo Yun that flares every three days. In Qilin City, one of the ten great cities of the Sea of Devils, he unseals relic treasures and buys materials for restriction flags, wondering where Li Muwan is after 200 years, then lets Mo Yun look for anyone who can break his restriction.","events":["Wang Lin fights stone copies of himself in the Chaotic Broken Stars","He meets Mo Yun fleeing Qian Kun of the Poison Demon Palace","Mo Yun tells him four Soul Formation masters vanished there 200 years ago","Xu Liguo devours Qian Kun; Wang Lin absorbs his golden core","Wang Lin puts a three-day ancient restriction on Mo Yun","In Qilin City he unseals relic treasures and buys restriction-flag materials","Mo Yun goes looking for someone who can lift the restriction"],"introduced":["Mo Yun","Qian Kun","Qihuang Sect","Poison Demon Palace","Qilin City","Chaotic Broken Stars","Heavenly Devil Cave","Ten Thousand Devils Hundred Days Kill Order (mentioned)"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin: late Core Formation. Mo Yun: early Core Formation. Qian Kun: mid Core Formation.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":38,"title":"Heavenly Tribulation","summary":"Mo Yun brings Qiu Siping, a late Core Formation cultivator who recognises the ancient restriction, and he uses a monster to lure out the man who set it. Qiu Siping offers Wang Lin a deal: his master and senior brother, both newly at Nascent Soul, lie helpless in an ancient cave full of restrictions, and devouring a Nascent Soul greatly helps one break through. Wang Lin sees through the cave's giant python, whose own spirit power holds the formation up, opens it, and each of them takes a Nascent Soul. Refining his first restriction flag calls down a Heavenly Tribulation that nearly shatters his golden core, and cultivators who rush in for the 'ancient treasure', led by a Nascent Soul expert, are wiped out by his divine sense. He ends at Core Formation great perfection with a false Nascent Soul, but learns that the Ji Realm will stop him from ever going past Nascent Soul, and refuses to accept it.","events":["Qiu Siping tries to lift Mo Yun's restriction and lures Wang Lin out","He proposes they steal the Nascent Souls of his master and senior brother","Wang Lin breaks the ancient cave's python-guarded restriction","Wang Lin refines a restriction flag and triggers a Heavenly Tribulation","Treasure-hunters and a Nascent Soul cultivator attack; Wang Lin kills hundreds","Wang Lin reaches Core Formation great perfection; the Ji Realm caps him at Nascent Soul"],"introduced":["Qiu Siping","restriction flag","Heavenly Tribulation","Ji Realm (named as the cap on his cultivation)","false Nascent Soul"],"cultivation":"Qiu Siping: late Core Formation; his master early Nascent Soul, his senior brother just reached Nascent Soul. Wang Lin: Core Formation great perfection with a false Nascent Soul; because of the Ji Realm he can go no higher than Nascent Soul.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":39,"title":"Cloud Sky Sect","summary":"In the ancient cave Wang Lin learns that escaping the Ji Realm means giving up everything it built, so he instead uses a divine technique to make a clone that will form a Nascent Soul and later merge with his body, even though the clone lives only thirty years. The clone, at level 3 Qi Condensation, travels to the Country of Chu, a rank 3 cultivation country, for the once-every-thirty-years entrance test of the Cloud Sky Sect, alongside Cheng Fei of the Sword Qi Sect and his sister Cheng Ling. In the test pillars he draws a water-attribute pill, and Zhou Lin, a ninth-generation disciple, takes him as his first apprentice. Sun Zhenwei takes Cheng Ling as his disciple, and Zhou Lin turns out to be the only student of an Elder Li. Zhou Lin gives Wang Lin a pill furnace and his alchemy notes before going into seclusion, telling him to ask his grandmaster, who is gentle, for help.","events":["Wang Lin finds that only giving up his Ji Realm cultivation would free him","He makes a clone to form a Nascent Soul instead","The clone enters the Cloud Sky Sect test in the Country of Chu with Cheng Fei and Cheng Ling","The clone draws a water-attribute pill from the test pillar","Zhou Lin takes Wang Lin as his apprentice; Sun Zhenwei takes Cheng Ling","Zhou Lin gives Wang Lin a furnace and notes and goes into seclusion"],"introduced":["Cloud Sky Sect","Country of Chu","Cheng Fei","Cheng Ling","Zhou Lin","Song Qing","Sun Zhenwei","Sword Qi Sect","Wang Lin's clone"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's clone: level 3 Qi Condensation. Cheng Fei: late Foundation Establishment. Cheng Ling: early Foundation Establishment. Zhou Lin: Core Formation. Song Qing, Inner Sect master: mid Nascent Soul. Sun Zhenwei: late Core Formation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":40,"title":"Reunion with Li Muwan","summary":"Two months on, Wang Lin's clone has blown up five pill furnaces while learning alchemy, and on his way to the South Garden he meets Cheng Xian, a cheerful outer disciple who begs for an introduction to Cheng Ling. He learns that Zhou Lin's master, Elder Li of the South Garden, is one of the Cloud Sky Sect's three rank 5 alchemists and was once of the Luohe Sect, and she is Li Muwan, now at early Core Formation. After 200 years and without Ma Liang's face she does not recognise him, though his voice stirs her and she gives him a sturdier furnace; Sun Zhenwei presses her to accept a marriage the founding ancestor has arranged. Cheng Ling humiliates Cheng Xian and nearly kills him, and Wang Lin's clone reaches Foundation Establishment, then late Foundation, with a Foundation pill recipe from Cheng Xian. When Cheng Xian's spirit ape staggers back dead, its core ripped out, Wang Lin decides to save him and calls his main body to merge.","events":["The clone keeps blowing up pill furnaces","Cheng Xian befriends him and asks for help with Cheng Ling","Wang Lin meets Elder Li of the South Garden: Li Muwan","Li Muwan half recognises his voice; her soul blood does not react","Sun Zhenwei presses Li Muwan about their arranged marriage","Cheng Ling nearly kills Cheng Xian","The clone reaches late Foundation Establishment","Cheng Xian's spirit ape returns dead; Wang Lin goes to save him"],"introduced":["Cheng Xian","South Garden","Big Ape and Second Ape (Cheng Xian's spirit apes)","Luohe Sect (mentioned)","Foundation Establishment pill"],"cultivation":"Clone: level 8 Qi Condensation, then Foundation Establishment, then late Foundation Establishment. Cheng Xian: early Foundation Establishment. Li Muwan: early Core Formation, rank 5 alchemist.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":41,"title":"Forced Marriage","summary":"Wang Lin merges with his clone and saves the dying soul of Cheng Xian's Big Ape, making it his third devil. His main body finds Cheng Xian held by his master Sun Hai and learns that Cheng Ling courted him only to get the apes' essence. Li Muwan senses Wang Lin and threatens to end her life unless he shows himself; he appears, tells her he threw away the jade slip she gave him 200 years ago, and she answers that by the founding ancestor's order she will wed Sun Zhenwei in three months, crying that she hates him. Sun Lingwu, the mid Nascent Soul outer master and Sun Zhenwei's father, attacks him for slighting the sect, and Wang Lin smashes a garden's formation to escape. Xu Liguo, sent after Cheng Ling, overhears Sun Zhenwei boast that he will take Li Muwan's 200-year Primordial Yin to form his Nascent Soul, but his attack is blocked by a protective treasure. In the end Wang Lin, as the clone, reveals himself to Li Muwan and asks for pills to reach Nascent Soul in two months so he can kill Sun Zhenwei and carry her across Chu.","events":["The clone merges with the main body; the Big Ape's soul becomes Wang Lin's third devil","Cheng Xian explains Cheng Ling used him for the spirit apes","Li Muwan forces Wang Lin to appear; he says he threw away her jade slip","Li Muwan announces her marriage to Sun Zhenwei","Sun Lingwu attacks Wang Lin, who breaks a garden formation and escapes","Xu Liguo learns Sun Zhenwei wants Li Muwan's Primordial Yin","Wang Lin reveals himself to Li Muwan and asks for pills to reach Nascent Soul"],"introduced":["Sun Hai","Sun Lingwu","Primordial Yin","the third devil (Big Ape)"],"cultivation":"Sun Hai: early Core Formation. Sun Lingwu: mid Nascent Soul. Sun Zhenwei: late Core Formation. Wang Lin's main body shows only late Core Formation but gives off Nascent Soul pressure.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":42,"title":"Stealing the Furnace Talisman","summary":"Wang Lin shows Li Muwan his true face, explaining that his old one belonged to Ma Liang's body, and she feeds his clone a long run of pills so it can form its core. Among his belongings she finds a pill sealed with yellow paper, at least rank 6, whose spirit power could form his Nascent Soul, but the way to open such seals has been lost. Sun Zhenwei, nearly killed by Xu Liguo, demands revenge from his father, presses Li Muwan about the stranger, and has the sect master confine her to the South Garden until the wedding. In a month the clone reaches Core Formation, and Zhou Lin, now out of seclusion, brings word from Li Muwan: a furnace talisman on the top floor of the Scripture Pavilion could tap the Seven Heaven-Seizing Furnaces' power to break the seal. Wang Lin takes it with his restriction flag, holding off the guardian elder Lu Fei, and vanishes, and even the elders' divine-sense questioning finds nothing. Ouyang Zi, the sect's master alchemist, then orders the furnaces opened.","events":["Wang Lin shows Li Muwan his real face","Li Muwan gives the clone pills to form a core","She finds a sealed rank 6 pill among his treasures","Sun Zhenwei has Li Muwan confined to the South Garden until the wedding","The clone reaches early Core Formation; Zhou Lin brings Li Muwan's plan","Wang Lin steals the furnace talisman from the Scripture Pavilion, holding off Lu Fei with a restriction flag","Ouyang Zi orders the furnaces opened"],"introduced":["Lu Fei","Ouyang Zi","Scripture Pavilion","furnace talisman","Seven Heaven-Seizing Furnaces","sealed pill (yellow paper seal)"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's clone: early Core Formation. Lu Fei: early Nascent Soul. Ouyang Zi: early Nascent Soul.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":43,"title":"Nascent Soul Embryo","summary":"Zhou Lin, who owes Li Muwan his life, guards the secret room she made, where Wang Lin's clone and Li Muwan plan to use the furnace talisman to tap the Seven Heaven-Seizing Furnaces, built by the Cloud Sky Sect's founding ancestor, while the sect refines pills. Ouyang Zi leads the furnace opening with his pill-sacrifice technique, burning rank 4 pills to raise a rank 5 one, and Wang Lin's sealed pill turns out to be a rank 7 Green Cloud Pill. Li Muwan steps in to steady the furnaces for Ouyang Zi, and his rank 5 pill succeeds while the huge vortex hides the power flowing to Wang Lin. Sun Zhenwei then reveals he has killed Zhou Lin for acting secretly and threatens Li Muwan into her wedding dress. The clone forms a Nascent Soul embryo, but his Ji Realm divine sense fights the formation. Guests such as Tian Yi of the Luoye Sect arrive and the double cultivation ceremony begins.","events":["Zhou Lin guards the secret room for Li Muwan","Li Muwan explains the Seven Heaven-Seizing Furnaces and her own hidden furnace","Ouyang Zi sacrifices rank 4 pills to refine a rank 5 pill","Wang Lin's sealed pill is a rank 7 Green Cloud Pill","Li Muwan helps Ouyang Zi and covers the flow of spirit power","Sun Zhenwei kills Zhou Lin and threatens Li Muwan","Wang Lin's Nascent Soul embryo forms but the Ji Realm resists","Guests arrive and the wedding ceremony begins"],"introduced":["Tian Yi","Liu Fei","Luoye Sect","pill sacrifice technique","Green Cloud Pill","Nascent Soul embryo"],"cultivation":"Tian Yi, Luoye Sect master: mid Nascent Soul. Liu Fei, Cloud Sky outer master: mid Nascent Soul. Wang Lin's clone forms a Nascent Soul embryo.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":44,"title":"Taking the Cloud Sky Sect","summary":"As the ceremony ends, someone breaking through to Nascent Soul on the sect's spirit veins draws out every elder, and Wang Lin appears at early Nascent Soul. Sun Zhenwei turns on Li Muwan, and Wang Lin kills him, then tells the sect that Sun Zhenwei killed a disciple and forced Wan'er to marry while the elders looked away. The founding ancestors, including Chen Bailiang and Yun Tianzi, trap him in the Cloud Sky Great Formation, but Wang Lin's Ancient God restriction breaks it and the ancestors fall, and he calls down a Heavenly Tribulation to force the sect to hand over the soul blood of everyone above Foundation Establishment. Privately he tells Li Muwan he failed to form his own Nascent Soul and only condensed his clone into one, borrowing its power, and that he is not from Hou Fen but must return to the Country of Zhao for revenge. Li Muwan stays to lead the Cloud Sky Sect on behalf of her husband and to refine higher pills for him, holding the four surviving ancestors' soul blood for 500 years and winning them over with longevity pills. Wang Lin then leaves, vowing that Teng Huayuan will see him return.","events":["A Nascent Soul breakthrough at the ceremony draws out the sect's elders","Wang Lin appears at early Nascent Soul; Sun Zhenwei turns on Li Muwan and Wang Lin kills him","Chen Bailiang and Yun Tianzi trap him in the Cloud Sky Great Formation","Wang Lin breaks it with an Ancient God restriction and defeats the ancestors","He makes the sect hand over its soul blood under threat of a Heavenly Tribulation","He tells Li Muwan the truth about his clone Nascent Soul and his past in Zhao","Li Muwan takes over the Cloud Sky Sect; Wang Lin heads for Zhao"],"introduced":["Chen Bailiang","Yun Tianzi","Cloud Sky Great Formation","soul blood (as a hostage)"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin: early Nascent Soul, through his clone condensed into a Nascent Soul (his own failed). Chen Bailiang and Yun Tianzi: late Nascent Soul; the five ancestors are said to be at the peak of late Nascent Soul.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":45,"title":"Across the Sea of Devils","summary":"Since the Heavenly Tribulation the fog over the Sea of Devils has lifted and a strange black rain sickens cultivators while making demonic beasts stronger, and Wang Lin, told that a map of the ancient teleportation arrays has surfaced in Lianmo City's black market, sets out to cross the sea toward the Country of Zhao. He runs into Qiu Siping, now at Nascent Soul after devouring his master's soul, hunting an eight-clawed beast with Shangguan Cai and Ma Jinrong of the Poison Demon Palace. Wang Lin lets the two escape, which forces Qiu Siping to chase them, and takes his jade slip of teleportation-array maps for comparison. On the way he subdues a coral-born mosquito beast with illusions, testing it first with his third devil, the Big Ape. At Lianmo City's black market he offers a special-grade spirit stone for a map, and a seller who wants help killing a half-step Soul Formation cultivator turns out to be setting a trap. Wang Lin kills the ambushers with the killing intent sealed in a sword sheath like the one he once owned, finds the route to Zhao, and remembers Teng Huayuan's massacre of his family 400 years ago.","events":["Black rain spreads over the Sea of Devils after the fog lifts","Wang Lin seeks an ancient teleportation map to reach Zhao","He meets Qiu Siping, now at Nascent Soul, with two Poison Demon Palace disciples","Qiu Siping gives him a jade slip of teleportation maps","Wang Lin subdues a mosquito beast","At Lianmo City's black market he is lured into an ambush","He kills the ambushers with the sword sheath's killing intent and finds the way to Zhao","He remembers Teng Huayuan killing his family 400 years ago"],"introduced":["Shangguan Cai","Ma Jinrong","Lianmo City","mosquito beast","ancient teleportation array map","special-grade spirit stone","black rain"],"cultivation":"Qiu Siping: Nascent Soul, formed after devouring a Nascent Soul. Shangguan Cai and Ma Jinrong: late Core Formation. The bait target is described as late Nascent Soul great perfection, half-step Soul Formation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":46,"title":"Return to Zhao","summary":"Wang Lin returns to the Heng Yue mountains and the Country of Zhao after 400 years, kneels before his parents' memorial as Tie Zhu and swears the Teng family will pay in blood. At the Wang ancestral home he meets Wang Liaoyi, descended from his fourth uncle Wang Tiantu, and finds that she, like everyone in the capital, has lost her spiritual root. He keeps his old promise to his uncle: he heals her and her dying grandfather, the patriarch Wang Zefu, and sets a Spirit Gathering Formation over the Wang residence. Zhang Kuang of the old Heng Yue Sect recognises him and explains that the Tian Dao Sect captured him and drained his cultivation to make pills, and that the sect is stripping the capital's spiritual roots. Tian Dao elder Lu Shiming arrives to punish him and boasts that the Teng family stands behind the sect, and Wang Lin traps his men in a Six Soul formation, lets Xu Liguo feast, and sets out to destroy the Tian Dao Sect and more.","events":["Wang Lin returns to Zhao and swears revenge at his parents' memorial","He meets Wang Liaoyi, descendant of his fourth uncle","The capital's people have all lost their spiritual roots","He heals Wang Zefu and sets a Spirit Gathering Formation over the Wang home","Zhang Kuang tells him the Tian Dao Sect is behind it","Lu Shiming threatens him in the Teng family's name; Xu Liguo devours his men","Wang Lin heads for the Tian Dao Sect"],"introduced":["Wang Liaoyi","Wang Zefu","Wang Tiantu (mentioned)","Tian Dao Sect","Lu Shiming","Piaomiao Sect (mentioned)","Spirit Gathering Formation","Six Soul formation","spiritual root"],"cultivation":"Zhang Kuang: Qi Condensation, down from Core Formation after the Tian Dao Sect used him for pills. Lu Shiming: late Core Formation.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":47,"title":"Old Grudges","summary":"Tian Dao Sect master Wu Cunsu has to bow to Teng Xuan, a nineteenth-generation branch member of the Teng family, who warns him that the sect exists only to guard what lies under the capital. Wang Lin smashes the sect's protective formation and kills Wu Cunsu with one move, and the terrified Teng Xuan hands over a map of nine spiritual veins Teng Huayuan built under Zhao to strip mortals of their spiritual roots and feed them to the Teng family. Ji Mo, a mid Nascent Soul guest elder of the Teng family, comes to rescue Teng Xuan and explains that the veins feed nine core Nascent Soul cultivators who keep the Teng family the strongest in Zhao. Wang Lin reminds him of his disciple Bai Zhan, who died 400 years ago, and of the killers Ji Mo hired that set off the massacre in the Teng family city, and Ji Mo realises he is the Qi Condensation boy from back then. Wang Lin kills him and vows to kill the nine Nascent Souls one by one and destroy their veins so Teng Huayuan watches his family fall.","events":["Teng Xuan lords it over the Tian Dao Sect master Wu Cunsu","Wang Lin breaks the sect's formation and kills Wu Cunsu","Teng Xuan reveals the nine spiritual veins draining mortals' spiritual roots","Xu Liguo frightens a captive into talking","Ji Mo arrives and explains the nine core Nascent Souls","Wang Lin reveals himself as the boy from Bai Zhan's death 400 years ago","Wang Lin kills Ji Mo and vows to wipe out the Teng family"],"introduced":["Wu Cunsu","Teng Xuan","Ji Mo","nine spiritual veins","nine core members of the Teng family","Bai Zhan (mentioned)"],"cultivation":"Wu Cunsu: early Nascent Soul. Teng Xuan: early Core Formation. Ji Mo: mid Nascent Soul. Wang Lin is taken for an early Nascent Soul cultivator.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":48,"title":"Slaying Teng Jiu","summary":"In the Teng family a challenger, Teng Yun, fights for the core seat of Teng Jiu and is killed by the young Teng Jiu, the weakest of the nine core members at mid Nascent Soul. Teng Huayuan, at late Nascent Soul great perfection, tells Lin Yi, an envoy of the Tongtian Tower at early Soul Formation, that the nine could all reach Soul Formation, and Lin Yi gives the family a hundred years to produce one or lose everything. Meanwhile in Wufeng Valley, once the strongest sect in Zhao, the Teng family uses borrowed Nascent Soul treasures to win elder seats, and Teng Shan takes one over Wu Hongming. Wang Lin breaks the valley's Five Sword Light Formation with his Ten Thousand Swords restriction, kills Teng Shan, and shames the sect master Wu Qingfeng for guarding the Teng family's veins. Teng Jiu arrives to stop him and is overpowered, and Xu Liguo devours his Nascent Soul. Wufeng Valley breaks with the Teng family and kills every Teng in the valley, and Teng Huayuan sends Teng Two, Teng Three and Teng Four to wipe out the killer's clan.","events":["Teng Nine kills the challenger Teng Yun in a core-seat duel","Lin Yi of the Tongtian Tower gives the Teng family 100 years to produce a Soul Formation cultivator","Teng Shan beats Wu Hongming for a Wufeng Valley elder seat","Wang Lin breaks the Five Sword Light Formation with his Ten Thousand Swords restriction","Wang Lin kills Teng Shan and defeats Teng Nine; Xu Liguo devours Teng Nine's soul","Wufeng Valley breaks with the Teng family","Teng Huayuan sends Teng Two, Three and Four after Wang Lin"],"introduced":["Teng Nine","Teng Yun","Lin Yi","Tongtian Tower","Wufeng Valley elder contest","Teng Shan","Wu Hongming","Five Sword Light Formation","Ten Thousand Swords restriction","Teng Two","Teng Three","Teng Four"],"cultivation":"Teng Huayuan: late Nascent Soul great perfection. Teng Jiu and Teng Yun: mid Nascent Soul. Lin Yi: early Soul Formation. The Wufeng Valley killing formation is at peak Nascent Soul strength.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":49,"title":"Wang Zhuo and Teng Xiu Xiu","summary":"Teng San orders every cultivator in Tianyin City to gather and hunt down the killer of Teng Jiu, while the core members Teng Er, Teng San and Teng Si wait for him there. Wang Lin walks in alone, survives their Devouring technique, Meteor Sword and Xuanming Hammer, and turns the three core members into demons for his own use, refusing one who begs to serve him. In the same city Wang Zhuo, Wang Lin's cousin, has lived for 200 years as the husband of Teng Xiu Xiu, a marriage the Teng ancestor forced on him; her badly weakened father sends the couple away and is then killed. When Wang Lin shows himself and says her father deserved to die, Wang Zhuo decides the feud can only end with them, kills Xiu Xiu and dies beside her. Wang Lin guides Wang Zhuo's soul into a new birth in a Wang household, while Teng Huayuan finds Teng City sealed by a barrier no one can leave and orders Teng Yi woken.","events":["Teng San summons all of Tianyin City's cultivators to hunt the man who killed Teng Jiu","Teng Xiu Xiu asks her husband Wang Zhuo whether they should help; he says he wants the Teng family wiped out","Wang Lin defeats Teng Er, Teng San and Teng Si and makes demons of them","Xiu Xiu's father, drained of blood essence, sends Wang Zhuo and Xiu Xiu away and is killed","Wang Lin reveals himself to Wang Zhuo; Wang Zhuo kills Xiu Xiu and then himself so the hatred ends","Wang Lin sends Wang Zhuo's soul into reincarnation in a Wang household","Teng Huayuan learns Teng City is sealed and orders Teng Yi woken"],"introduced":["Teng Er","Teng San","Teng Si","Teng Xiu Xiu","Wang Zhuo","Tianyin City","Teng City"],"cultivation":"Teng Xiu Xiu: early Core Formation. Teng Er and Teng San: late Nascent Soul. Teng Si: mid Nascent Soul.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":50,"title":"Teng Yi of the Black Mire","summary":"Wang Lin travels to the Black Mire, a bottomless swamp that is the first spiritual vein of the Country of Zhao and the cultivation ground of Teng Yi, the one core member whose title has not changed hands in 400 years. Teng Yi, a late Nascent Soul great perfection cultivator whom the envoy chose as his test subject, shrugs off Wang Lin's Extreme Realm divine sense and keeps reforming after his body is destroyed. Wang Lin realises the whole swamp is made of spiritual roots stolen from mortals, and that Teng Yi's own body is built from them, so he freezes the mire with a restriction he had laid in advance. Teng Yi then burns a drop of Ancient God blood to summon a giant guardian of an Ancient God, but Wang Lin breaks it and kills him. Teng Huayuan, told the city barrier still cannot be broken and that Teng Yi is dead, recalls every Teng disciple to Teng City and opens the sect-protecting formation.","events":["Wang Lin asks the way to Zhao and is warned off the Black Mire","At the swamp he learns it is the first spiritual vein and Teng Yi's cultivation ground","Teng Yi survives the Black Dragon and Ten Thousand Swords restrictions and keeps reforming","Wang Lin works out that the swamp and Teng Yi's body are made of mortals' spiritual roots","He freezes the mire with a hidden Nether Sealing Demon restriction","Teng Yi summons an Ancient God guardian with a drop of Ancient God blood; Wang Lin kills him","Teng Huayuan recalls all Teng disciples and opens the sect-protecting formation"],"introduced":["Teng Yi","Black Mire","first spiritual vein","Nether Sealing Demon Restriction","Ancient God blood"],"cultivation":"Teng Yi: late Nascent Soul great perfection, one step from Soul Formation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":51,"title":"The Fall of Teng City","summary":"Teng Huayuan sends the four remaining core members, including Teng Ba with his Blazing Sky Nine Feathers, to hold Wang Lin off for the time it takes an incense stick to burn, and Wang Lin kills them all. Teng Bo, a ninth-generation disciple, rallies the Teng cultivators into a bloodline formation, but Wang Lin shatters it with the divine sense of the dead core members, then breaks the God-Piercing Sword, a Soul Formation-grade weapon the envoy gave Teng Huayuan. Face to face, Teng Huayuan says he wiped out the Wang family because Wang Lin killed his descendant Teng Li, and Wang Lin swears to destroy the Teng clan's foundation before his eyes. Teng Huayuan then reveals that the incense was for a Reversal Formation that sacrifices the city and the Teng bloodline, Teng Bo included, gathering the whole clan's divine sense into a force equal to Soul Formation that cancels Wang Lin's lightning. Wang Lin counters with leftover Soul Formation poison that destroys the souls of the weaker cultivators, and closes in on Teng Huayuan as a voice orders him to stop.","events":["Four remaining core members, Teng Ba among them, attack and are killed","Teng Bo rallies the Teng cultivators into a bloodline formation","Wang Lin breaks the God-Piercing Sword, the envoy's gift to Teng Huayuan","Teng Huayuan and Wang Lin face each other over the massacre of the Wang family","Teng Huayuan's Reversal Formation sacrifices the city and the Teng bloodline, including Teng Bo","The gathered divine sense cancels Wang Lin's lightning; he answers with Soul Formation poison","Wang Lin moves in for the kill; someone shouts for him to stop"],"introduced":["Teng Ba","Teng Bo","Blazing Sky Nine Feathers","bloodline formation","God-Piercing Sword","Reversal Formation","Teng Li (named)"],"cultivation":"Teng Bo: late Core Formation. The Teng clan's gathered divine sense is said to equal a Soul Formation cultivator.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":52,"title":"Revenge Complete","summary":"A flashback shows Lin Yi, the Heavenly Tower envoy, gathering Zhao's Nascent Soul masters to launch a god-making plan: rip out the spiritual roots of every mortal in Zhao to feed one talent to Soul Formation and lift Zhao from a level-3 to a level-4 cultivation country, with the Teng family running it and Pu Nanzi's Xuan Dao Sect ordered to help. In the present Pu Nanzi steps in to protect Teng Huayuan and survives one blow, then Lin Yi arrives and offers to spare Wang Lin for the Heaven Defying Bead. Wang Lin refuses and calls down a heavenly tribulation; Lin Yi tries to have someone die in his place, and Pu Nanzi, burning his own lifespan for the mortals of Zhao, holds him back. Wang Lin forces Teng Huayuan to name the man who found his home village, Gao Qiming of the Piao Miao Sect, and kills him; Gao Qiming then takes his own life to atone, saying he also kept one Wang bloodline safe. At his parents' grave Wang Lin declares his revenge complete, promises Situ Nan his freedom once he reaches Soul Transformation, and resolves to keep walking the path of cultivation.","events":["Flashback: Lin Yi lays out the god-making plan; the Teng family volunteers and Xuan Dao Sect is ordered to help","Pu Nanzi shields Teng Huayuan and survives one strike from Wang Lin","Lin Yi demands the Heaven Defying Bead; Wang Lin refuses and summons a heavenly tribulation","Pu Nanzi burns his lifespan to hold the envoy back","Teng Huayuan names Gao Qiming of the Piao Miao Sect as the man who located the Wang village, and dies","Gao Qiming kills himself to atone and asks that the Piao Miao Sect be spared","Wang Lin mourns his parents and promises Situ Nan freedom at Soul Transformation"],"introduced":["Lin Yi (in person)","Pu Nanzi","Xuan Dao Sect","god-making plan","Heavenly Tower","Gao Qiming (named)","Piao Miao Sect"],"cultivation":"Lin Yi says Zhao is a level-3 cultivation country; a Soul Formation cultivator would lift it to level 4. Pu Nanzi is called the strongest master in Zhao.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":53,"title":"Entering the Mortal World","summary":"A cultivator chases Wang Lin out of the Country of Zhao and crushes his Nascent Soul with divine sense alone; he is Na Duo, an early Soul Transformation cultivator from Planet Five Elements, and he only wants back the storage bag he hid in the Land of the Ancient God. Impressed by Wang Lin's Extreme Realm and his half-finished restriction flag, Na Duo explains that a Cultivation Star Crystal, the national treasure of a level-6 cultivation country, can break the Extreme Realm bottleneck, and invites Wang Lin to find him one day. To reach Soul Formation Wang Lin decides he must live as a mortal, and travels with a medicine basket into a prosperous level-4 cultivation country, where he cures a poisoned noble girl with a willow leaf for her steward Lu Xing. Lu Xing explains the Four Faction Alliance of Baiyun Sect, Shuimo Sect, Qingmu Cliff and Heihun Sect that protects the capital of Nan. Wang Lin finds his killing energy has condensed to its limit, breaks through to mid Nascent Soul, meets a lecherous old man who sees through his hidden cultivation and tells him he needs an Intent Realm, and rents an empty shop on an old street.","events":["Na Duo chases Wang Lin and takes back his storage bag from the Land of the Ancient God","Na Duo explains the Extreme Realm and the Cultivation Star Crystal, and gives his name","Wang Lin decides to live as a mortal to reach Soul Formation","He cures a poisoned girl in Lu Xing's party with a hundred-year willow leaf","Lu Xing describes the Four Faction Alliance protecting the capital of Nan","Wang Lin breaks through to mid Nascent Soul","A strange old man tells him he needs an Intent Realm; Wang Lin rents a shop"],"introduced":["Na Duo","Planet Five Elements","Cultivation Star Crystal","Cultivation Alliance","Lu Xing","Four Faction Alliance","Baiyun Sect","Shuimo Sect","Qingmu Cliff","Heihun Sect","Intent Realm","the old man"],"cultivation":"Na Duo: early Soul Transformation. Wang Lin (his mortal clone) breaks through to mid Nascent Soul.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":54,"title":"Uncle Wang the Woodcarver","summary":"Wang Lin settles on an old street in Nan's capital, where he dreams of his parents and finds his killing energy condensing into pearls. The boy Zeng Daniu from the blacksmith's across the road befriends him, and Daniu's parents welcome the new neighbour with home-made wine. Over a year Wang Lin carves the villagers of his home and the beasts he has fought, and when Xu Tao buys a dragon carving for ten taels of gold, Baiyun Sect cultivators at the Southern King's residence see that it is a real treasure. Two of them come to the shop to steal more, flee from a Nascent Soul cultivator, and are made to pay 4,500 taels of gold. At New Year the crown prince sends gifts and offers the residence's help, and Wang Lin tells Daniu that he already has a wife waiting for him far away.","events":["Wang Lin dreams of his parents; his killing energy forms pearls","Zeng Daniu and his parents befriend their new neighbour","A year of woodcarving: home villagers and beasts like the Zhong Gu and Fire Spider","Xu Tao buys a dragon carving; the Southern King's cultivators recognise it as a treasure","Two Baiyun Sect cultivators try to loot the shop and are made to pay in gold","At New Year the crown prince sends gifts; Wang Lin speaks of a wife far away"],"introduced":["Zeng Daniu","Xu Tao","the Southern King","Zhou Qiao","Weng Qi","killing-energy pearls"],"cultivation":"Nan's crown prince: Qi Condensation level 8. Zhou Qiao: late Foundation Establishment; Weng Qi: early Core Formation (both Baiyun Sect).","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":55,"title":"The Old Man's Intent Realm","summary":"Wang Lin lends Zeng Daniu's family money for a bigger shop, calling it payment for a daily pot of wine, and after six years of mortal life his old killing energy has fully condensed into pearls. The old man from the capital reappears at the theatre, praises how completely Wang Lin has become a mortal, and studies his carvings of beasts from the Sea of Devils. When Wang Lin gives his name, the old man shows him an Intent Realm, a domain that flattens every lower cultivator under its owner's control, and explains that Soul Formation cultivators hide theirs inside their killing moves. Wanting a flattering carving of himself in return, he offers to help Wang Lin reach Soul Formation. He teleports Wang Lin a hundred thousand miles, lends him a straw hat that hides his face from anyone less than two levels above him, and smashes the protective formation of the Baiyun Sect in one blow so its Soul Formation elders will show their Intent Realms.","events":["Wang Lin lends the Zengs money for a bigger shop","Six years pass; his killing energy has fully become pearls","The old man returns and recognises Wang Lin's carvings of beasts from the Sea of Devils","He shows Wang Lin his own Intent Realm and explains what it is","He offers to help Wang Lin reach Soul Formation in exchange for carvings of himself","He lends Wang Lin a straw hat and breaks the Baiyun Sect's great formation"],"introduced":["Wen Baoxin","straw hat","Sea of Devils (named)"],"cultivation":"The old man's cultivation is beyond Soul Formation, Wang Lin judges. Baiyun Sect has over 30 Nascent Soul cultivators; Wen Baoxin is a Soul Formation elder.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":56,"title":"Three Intent Realms","summary":"At the Baiyun Sect the old man pins a mid Nascent Soul Wang Lin in place so he can feel the Soul Formation elders' Intent Realms as they attack. Wen Baoxin's realm is detachment, cutting off joy, anger, love and hatred; Shi Qi's is a lazy, drowsy realm that almost traps Wang Lin until his killing-energy pearl wakes him; and Qing Song's is age, which drains spiritual power and ages the body. The old man pays the sect with an Ancestral Spirit Token, one of many tokens he carries from other sects, and takes Wang Lin home. Seventeen years later Wang Lin is an old shopkeeper who owns much of the old street, Daniu has a son, Zeng Xiaoniu, and Wang Lin still cannot find his own Intent Realm. One night Baiyun disciple Yi Fu chases Xu Tao into the street, and when he tries to kill Wang Lin as well, Wang Lin destroys his natal Rakshasa; Yi Fu flees, badly hurt, to his master Zhou Wutai.","events":["The old man makes the Baiyun Sect's Soul Formation elders show their Intent Realms","Wang Lin feels the realms of detachment, laziness and age","The old man pays with an Ancestral Spirit Token","Seventeen years pass; Wang Lin grows old as a shopkeeper and meets Zeng Xiaoniu","Yi Fu hunts Xu Tao, who runs to Wang Lin for help","Wang Lin destroys Yi Fu's natal Rakshasa","Yi Fu returns wounded to his master Zhou Wutai"],"introduced":["Shi Qi","Qing Song","Yi Fu","Zhou Wutai","Zeng Xiaoniu","Ancestral Spirit Token","Detachment Intent Realm","Age Intent Realm","natal Rakshasa"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin: mid Nascent Soul. Shi Qi and Qing Song: Soul Formation. Yi Fu: Foundation Establishment. Zhou Wutai: late Nascent Soul.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":57,"title":"The Rain Cauldron","summary":"Zhou Wutai, the late Nascent Soul Baiyun elder who dotes on his disciple Yi Fu, walks with him to find the 'mortal' who hurt him, while Xu Tao explains that Nan's heir hid a relic called the Rain Cauldron, and Zhou Wutai ordered his death for it. Wang Lin saves Xu Tao and declares the karma of his sixteen years of service settled. Over shared wine Zhou Wutai proposes a race to Soul Formation, and Wang Lin warns that Yi Fu will die within a hundred years, having seen that Zhou Wutai's Intent Realm is to raise the disciple with love and then kill him to reach Soul Formation through grief. Zhou Wutai leaves, demanding only the Rain Cauldron within three days. Five years later Daniu's father dies; Wang Lin gives his soul a flower for a good rebirth, is nearly lost following the cycle of reincarnation, and is pulled back by Tian Yunzi, who invites him to Planet Tianyun. Wang Lin reaches the peak of late Nascent Soul, an immortal takes Zeng Xiaoniu as a disciple, and the first snow falls carrying killing intent.","events":["Xu Tao explains the Rain Cauldron and the heir's death sentence","Wang Lin saves Xu Tao and ends their karma","Zhou Wutai proposes a race to Soul Formation; Wang Lin predicts Yi Fu's death","Zhou Wutai demands the Rain Cauldron within three days and leaves","Daniu's father dies; Wang Lin sends his soul toward a good rebirth","Tian Yunzi pulls Wang Lin out of the cycle of reincarnation and invites him to Planet Tianyun","Wang Lin reaches peak late Nascent Soul; Zeng Xiaoniu leaves to cultivate; snow with killing intent falls"],"introduced":["Rain Cauldron","All-Seer (Tian Yunzi)","Planet Tianyun"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's clone reaches peak late Nascent Soul.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":58,"title":"The Snow and the End of Mortal Life","summary":"Endless snow falls on the Four Faction Alliance, turning the mortal world to ice, and Zhou Wutai visits Wang Lin after more than ten years to admire his carving of Qing Song's Age Intent Realm, refuse it, and give him a jade slip holding a Soul Formation technique. He explains that the snow is an attack by the Snow Region, a level-4 cultivation country in the far north, and invites Wang Lin to join the Alliance; Wang Lin declines. Three Heihun Sect elders, You Kong, You Huan and You Mei, try to kill him with the Ink Bone Sword Formation, and he breaks it alone. The old man tells him the war is over the Rain Cauldron, which opens the gates of the shattered Ancient Immortal Realm, whose remaining immortal energy is the only path from Soul Formation to Soul Transformation without a Soul Transformation Pill. Thinking over his life of killing and his thirty years as a mortal, Wang Lin grasps that death is himself and life is also himself, saves the freezing Zeng family by carrying them to a neighbouring country, and ends his time as a mortal.","events":["Zhou Wutai visits and gives Wang Lin a Soul Formation technique on a jade slip","Zhou Wutai explains the Snow Region's snow attack and invites Wang Lin to the Alliance","You Kong, You Huan and You Mei attack with the Ink Bone Sword Formation; Wang Lin breaks it","The old man explains the Rain Cauldron, the four immortal gates and immortal energy","Wang Lin carves the old man's likeness and keeps the straw hat for now","Wang Lin reflects on life and death","He carries the Zeng family to a neighbouring country and ends his mortal life"],"introduced":["Snow Region","You Kong","You Huan","You Mei","Ink Bone Sword Formation","Ancient Immortal Realm","four immortal gates (wind, rain, thunder, lightning)","Soul Transformation Pill"],"cultivation":"You Kong, You Huan and You Mei: late Nascent Soul. Wang Lin says ten years of seclusion will bring him to Soul Formation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":59,"title":"Hongdie","summary":"Zhou Wutai tells Wang Lin the Alliance's pleas for help were refused by every neighbouring level-4 country, because the war is really about Hongdie, a Snow Region woman with a never-before-seen Five Spirits Body who reached peak Soul Formation in a hundred years without pills. The Vermilion Bird Country invited her to join, and her one condition was that the Snow Region become a level-5 cultivation country on new land, which she chose to be the Four Faction Alliance's; the Rain Cauldron then turned up in Alliance territory as the pretext. A year later the Snow Region arrives and refuses a truce, and Qing Fu, Zhou Yun and the other Alliance elders burn their lifespans in the Nine Sons Killing Formation, destroy Hongdie's body and call up the Country-Protecting Sky Dragon. Wang Lin goes after the wounded earth spirit of her five spirits to complete the five elements of the Heaven Defying Bead, but a disciple of Qing Song arrives to claim it too. He then finds hidden ice statues that form an Ice and Snow Formation over the whole Alliance, and Hongdie, still alive, asks the Vermilion Bird Country's envoy to kill the Sky Dragon.","events":["Zhou Wutai explains why no country will help the Alliance","Hongdie's Five Spirits Body and her bargain with the Vermilion Bird Country are revealed","A year later the Snow Region attacks and refuses a truce","The Alliance's elders use the Nine Sons Killing Formation and destroy Hongdie's body","The Country-Protecting Sky Dragon rises to defend the Alliance","Wang Lin hunts the earth spirit; a Baiyun disciple of Qing Song competes for it","Hidden ice statues form an Ice and Snow Formation; Hongdie calls on the Vermilion Bird envoy"],"introduced":["Hongdie","Five Spirits Body","Vermilion Bird Country","Qing Fu","Zhou Yun","Mo Shan","Wu Huichu","Nine Sons Killing Formation","Country-Protecting Sky Dragon","Ice and Snow Formation","Green Jade Bell","Sky Locking Nail"],"cultivation":"Hongdie: Soul Formation great perfection. Qing Fu and Mo Shan: mid Soul Formation. Zhou Yun and Wu Huichu: late Soul Formation. The Snow Region brings 36 Soul Formation cultivators, four of them late stage.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":60,"title":"The Fall of the Four Factions","summary":"A flashback shows Hongdie's master Chong Ying divining her death calamity and spending the rest of his life on a hexagram that sends his first disciple Qing He to die protecting her in the war. Back on the battlefield, Ou Zhi, the Vermilion Bird Country's early Soul Transformation guardian, strips the Country-Protecting Sky Dragon of its bloodline, and the Four Faction Alliance collapses. Wang Lin survives because the Heaven Defying Bead has absorbed the earth spirit, and the fleeing Zhou Wutai hands him the Rain Cauldron with healing pills. The Snow Region elder Lian Ning chases him down, and Wang Lin kills the elder with a heavenly tribulation called through his restriction flag, then turns down Ou Zhi's request that he summon another. Five years later the bead's earth element is complete, its time reversal has ended since Wang Lin grasped his Life and Death intent, and he travels through the new Snow Region country, finding death intent where mortals should be living.","events":["Flashback: Chong Ying divines Hongdie's calamity and sends Qing He to shield her","Ou Zhi strips the Country-Protecting Sky Dragon's bloodline; the Alliance falls","Wang Lin survives thanks to the earth spirit in the Heaven Defying Bead","Zhou Wutai gives Wang Lin the Rain Cauldron","Lian Ning hunts Wang Lin; he kills Lian Ning with a heavenly tribulation","Ou Zhi asks him to call another tribulation; he declines","Five years later the bead's earth element is complete and the time difference inside it ends"],"introduced":["Chong Ying","Qing He","Ou Zhi","Lian Ning","New Snow Region","Life and Death intent","death intent"],"cultivation":"Chong Ying and Qing He: late Soul Formation. Ou Zhi: early Soul Transformation. Lian Ning: early Soul Formation. Wang Lin needs four more years to reach Soul Formation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":61,"title":"Death Intent in the Snow Region","summary":"Wang Lin spends a year in the New Snow Region, where powerful cultivators rule every city and mortals are slaves who carve ice statues that the cultivators bring to life, and he finds it a fitting place to refine his Life and Death intent. He takes over the identity of Sun Shuoyi, lord of the 72nd city, and learns the Pure Ice technique from his memories. When a disciple reports a hideout of Four Faction survivors, Wang Lin goes alone and finds Chen Huan, young master of the Heihun Sect, guarding his dying master. Wang Lin offers pills, but the old man, who could have fled long ago, chooses to die in his homeland as a protector of the Four Factions, gives Wang Lin a treasure, and goes out to fight the Snow Region one last time. After three more years Wang Lin adapts the ice-statue method by turning snow meridians into blood meridians controlled by his Life and Death intent, and with a year left before Soul Formation he decides to return to the Country of Zhao.","events":["Wang Lin studies how the Snow Region's ice statues are made and animated","He takes the identity of city lord Sun Shuoyi","He learns the Pure Ice technique from Sun Shuoyi's memories","He finds Chen Huan and his dying master, a Heihun Sect senior","The old master gives Wang Lin a treasure and dies fighting the Snow Region","Three years later Wang Lin turns the ice-statue method into blood-meridian puppets","He sets out for the Country of Zhao"],"introduced":["Sun Shuoyi","Chen Huan","Pure Ice Technique","ice statues","Ice and Snow Temple"],"cultivation":"Sun Shuoyi: late Core Formation. Snow Region elders say a forced technique can lift a cultivator to early Soul Transformation but leaves only a hundred years of life. Wang Lin is one year from Soul Formation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":62,"title":"Soul Formation in Zhao","summary":"Sheltering from rain in an empty temple on the way to Zhao, Wang Lin, calling himself Zeng Niu, meets Mo Zhi, a cultivator he cannot read, who explains that copying another's Intent Realm gives a far weaker Soul Formation than finding one's own, and shows his Forgetting intent by watching the life in the falling rain. Wang Lin finally grasps his own Life and Death Intent Realm: rain is born in the sky and dies on the earth, and the fall between is a life. In the Country of Zhao he separates his two bodies: the original body sheds its Extreme Realm, refined into a treasure, drops to Foundation Establishment, becomes a Two-Star Ancient God and sinks into the planet's core to cultivate in secret. The clone, already at Nascent Soul great perfection, breaks through to Soul Formation, and the spiritual power it releases helps cultivators and mortals across Zhao, including Wang Zhuo's reincarnation, now at late Foundation Establishment. Wang Lin plants ten seeds of spiritual energy in Zhao's cultivators, leaves an object that can shield Zhao from three attacks, recovers a sword sheath, and tells his parents' grave that at Soul Transformation he will wake Situ Nan and perhaps find a way to revive them, which needs immortal energy from the Immortal Realm.","events":["Wang Lin, as Zeng Niu, meets Mo Zhi in a rainy temple and discusses Intent Realms","He comprehends his own Life and Death Intent Realm","His original body sheds the Extreme Realm and becomes a Two-Star Ancient God, then sinks into the planet's core","His clone breaks through to Soul Formation in Zhao","Wang Zhuo's reincarnation benefits from the breakthrough","Wang Lin plants ten spiritual seeds and leaves a protective object for Zhao","At his parents' grave he aims for Soul Transformation and the Immortal Realm"],"introduced":["Mo Zhi","Forgetting Intent Realm","Life and Death Intent Realm","Two-Star Ancient God"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's clone: Nascent Soul great perfection, then early Soul Formation. Original body: was stuck at late Core Formation by the Extreme Realm, falls to Foundation Establishment, then becomes a Two-Star Ancient God. Wang Zhuo's reincarnation: late Foundation Establishment.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":63,"title":"The Thunder Toad","summary":"With the Immortal Realm gate about to open and the sects hunting for treasures, Wang Lin prepares, starting with refining his restriction flag again. He does it inside the Land of the Ancient God, inside Tuo Sen's body, betting that heavenly tribulation cannot reach there; the bet pays off and the flag ends one step short of medium success. Using the Hunyuan Beast Control Ring, he subdues a Thunder Toad, a top-grade spirit beast that was fighting a wild beast, though the ring keeps drawing on his spiritual power. He then passes through Wuwen, a level-3 cultivation country, into the collapsed Outer Region Battlefield full of wandering souls, where the envoy Sun Wen bows to him in fear. A year later his three sword sheaths are refined with his primordial soul, and as the gate opens the old man reminds him to use the straw hat while telling children how the Ancient Gods died and the Immortal Realm shattered.","events":["Wang Lin begins preparing for the Immortal Realm","He refines the restriction flag inside the Land of the Ancient God, safe from tribulation","He subdues the Thunder Toad with the Hunyuan Beast Control Ring","He enters the collapsed Outer Region Battlefield through Wuwen country","Sun Wen greets him with fear","A year later his three sword sheaths are refined","The Immortal Realm gate opens; the old man tells its history to children"],"introduced":["Thunder Toad","Hunyuan Beast Control Ring","Wuwen country","Sun Wen","Outer Region Battlefield","three sword sheaths"],"cultivation":"Sun Wen: late Nascent Soul, envoy of a level-3 cultivation country.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":64,"title":"The Rain Immortal Realm","summary":"At the shattered gate platforms of the Immortal Realm, Wang Lin sets a restriction and a recovery formation on one platform as other cultivators gather, among them Chi Hu of the Giant Demon Clan, Sun Tai of the Corpse Yin Sect and Zhou Yi, and he scares off a challenger with his Thunder Toad. The Rain Cauldron carries him into the Rain Immortal Realm, a ruin of spirit-stone palaces whose immortal energy has almost gone, and a monument names the palace of the Rain Immortal King given to Immortal Tianhua. Hong Wen of the Daluo Sword Sect claims a hidden store of immortal energy his sect has milked for 3,000 years, but the Thunder Toad, at peak mid Soul Formation, outmatches him and Wang Lin seals him in the Red Gold Bell to refine his soul. Taking his teleportation slip to the sect's 37 fragments, Wang Lin collects immortal energy and high-grade spirit stones, then reaches a ruined fragment where an illusion shows immortals feasting until a giant palm smashes the Immortal Realm in one blow.","events":["Wang Lin claims and fortifies a gate platform; Chi Hu, Sun Tai, Zhou Yi and Zhan Bai gather","His Thunder Toad drives off a challenger","He enters the ruined Rain Immortal Realm","Hong Wen of the Daluo Sword Sect fights him over a store of immortal energy","Wang Lin seals Hong Wen in the Red Gold Bell and takes his teleport slip","He gathers immortal energy and spirit stones","An illusion shows the Immortal Realm destroyed by a single palm"],"introduced":["Chi Hu","Giant Demon Clan","Sun Tai","Zhou Yi","Zhan Bai","Rain Immortal Realm","Hong Wen","Daluo Sword Sect","Red Gold Bell","Daluo Spirit Sword","immortal energy"],"cultivation":"Chi Hu: Soul Formation. Sun Tai and Zhou Yi: mid Soul Transformation. Zhan Bai and Hong Wen: early Soul Formation. The Thunder Toad: peak mid Soul Formation. Wang Lin appears to be early Soul Formation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":65,"title":"Hongdie's Emotionless Domain","summary":"In the ruins of the Rain Celestial Realm, Wang Lin, travelling as an early Soul Formation cultivator, is cornered by Hongdie, the late Soul Formation prodigy of the Snow Region country Xue Yue, after he kills Hong Wen of the Da Lou Sword Sect. Her Emotionless domain starts to numb his memories, but he breaks her Dao heart by asking who buried the mortal parents she abandoned in her hundred years of cultivation. When she gives chase he bluffs her with the giant palm he glimpsed in the old Celestial vision and escapes through the Da Lou teleport formation to the third fragment. There he watches two Da Lou disciples, Zheng Hao and Sun Lei, enter the Immortal Beast Palace with a Spirit Washing Gourd to gather celestial energy. Swarms of immortal-beast food attack them, Sun Lei uses his junior as bait, and he turns out to be stronger than he let on: mid-stage Soul Formation.","events":["Hongdie confronts Wang Lin over the death of Hong Wen and traps him in her Emotionless domain","Wang Lin shakes her Dao heart by asking about the parents she left behind","He activates the Black Dragon restriction and flees; she pursues him","A bluffed Celestial palm scares Hongdie off and he teleports to the third fragment","Da Lou disciples Zheng Hao and Sun Lei enter the Immortal Beast Palace with a Spirit Washing Gourd","Immortal-beast food (devouring insects) swarm out of a skull; Wang Lin's mosquito beast feeds on them","Sun Lei sacrifices Zheng Hao to the swarm and reveals mid-stage Soul Formation"],"introduced":["Zheng Hao","Sun Lei","Immortal Beast Palace","Spirit Washing Gourd","Mixun Search Technique","Emotionless domain (Snow Region Clear Ice technique)","immortal-beast food"],"cultivation":"Hongdie is said to have gone from mortal to late Soul Formation in about 100 years. Zheng Hao is early Soul Formation; Sun Lei is mid-stage Soul Formation. Wang Lin is taken for an early Soul Formation cultivator.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":66,"title":"Sun Lei's Gamble","summary":"Sun Lei hides from the immortal-beast food and then meets Wang Lin in the collapsing Immortal Beast Palace, admitting he is not really a Da Lou disciple but an infiltrator who kills for treasure. He proposes they work together to take three Celestial treasures guarded in the cave: a piece of immortal jade, an immortal sword and a piece of golden iron. Wang Lin asks for the Da Lou Mixun Search Technique and the Spirit Washing Gourd, and settles for the technique plus a promised Spirit Washing Wood. Together they thin the swarms with Sun Lei's Nine Rainbow Smoke and Wang Lin's Thunder Toad, and Sun Lei freezes the great black beast for ten breaths with a sect treasure to grab the treasures behind an immortal restriction. The beast breaks free early because Wang Lin has planned for it, so Sun Lei, cornered, blows himself up, and the whole celestial fragment begins to collapse.","events":["Sun Lei confronts Wang Lin and admits he infiltrated the Da Lou Sword Sect","He lists three Celestial treasures: immortal jade, an immortal sword and golden iron","Wang Lin takes the Mixun Search Technique and a promised Spirit Washing Wood as his price","They lure and kill swarms of immortal-beast food; Wang Lin's Thunder Toad fights","Sun Lei freezes the black beast for ten breaths and runs for the treasures","The beast breaks loose after eight breaths; Sun Lei realises Wang Lin set him up","Sun Lei self-detonates and the fragment starts to collapse"],"introduced":["Immortal jade","Spirit Washing Wood","Nine Rainbow Smoke","immortal restriction"],"cultivation":"Sun Lei notes Wang Lin shows only early Soul Formation but must be hiding his real cultivation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":67,"title":"The God Slaying War Chariot","summary":"Wounded after the fragment's collapse, Wang Lin meets Chi Hu, young leader of the Giant Demon Clan, and gives his name as Zeng Niu of Tianhun Country. Chi Hu shows him a jade slip map to a hidden central fragment with a jade coffin and asks him to team up within a month. Recovering, Wang Lin learns his golden iron is a jade slip left by the Celestial Tian Bao, pointing to the God Slaying War Chariot sealed in a tenth chamber of Tian Bao's cave. He helps Sima Yun of the Kuishui Sect against a thief, trades teleport maps with him, and finds the hidden chamber on Tiger Mountain, where he tames the smallest beast soul of the chariot. Then he goes to Chi Hu's meeting at the Cold Stream and finds that the third partner is Hongdie.","events":["Chi Hu of the Giant Demon Clan meets the wounded Wang Lin, who calls himself Zeng Niu","Chi Hu invites him to raid a central fragment holding a jade coffin","Wang Lin learns celestial energy can only be used when he breaks through to Soul Transformation","The golden iron turns out to be Tian Bao's slip about the God Slaying War Chariot","Wang Lin helps Sima Yun and trades teleport maps with him","In Tian Bao's cave on Tiger Mountain he finds the chariot and tames its smallest beast soul","At the Cold Stream entrance Chi Hu's third partner turns out to be Hongdie"],"introduced":["Chi Hu","Zeng Niu (Wang Lin's alias)","Tian Bao","God Slaying War Chariot","Sima Yun","Kuishui Sect","Tiger Mountain fragment","Cold Stream"],"cultivation":"Sima Yun is early Soul Formation. Wang Lin notes the celestial energy he gathered can only be refined when he breaks from late Soul Formation into Soul Transformation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":68,"title":"Across the Void","summary":"Hongdie attacks Wang Lin on sight, and he answers with his Life and Death domain, calling her unfilial for abandoning her parents, cruel for wiping out four sects, and disloyal for selling Xue Yue to the Suzaku Country. Chi Hu stops the fight and makes them agree to share the spoils equally. Hongdie freezes the Cold Stream for three days so they can cross, and the trio rides Chi Hu's flawed Star Compass into the void of the Rain Celestial Realm. Wang Lin recognises a void beast called Xu and warns them to flee north; Chi Hu ignores him at first and the compass is badly damaged. On foot they reach a rare overlapping fragment marked by the Giant Demon ancestors, but the jade coffin and immortal sword on the second layer are gone, and Zhou Yi of the Five Elements Sect appears.","events":["Hongdie and Wang Lin fight; he shakes her with accusations about her parents and her sect","Chi Hu intervenes and sets equal shares","Flashback: Zhou Yi talks to the preserved corpse he calls his wife inside his Immortal Jade Pagoda","Hongdie freezes the Cold Stream so the group can cross","They ride Chi Hu's flawed Star Compass into the void","Wang Lin identifies the void beast Xu; ignoring him at first costs Chi Hu and Hongdie dearly","The second layer of the overlapping fragment is empty and Zhou Yi appears"],"introduced":["Star Compass (flawed copy)","Xu (void beast)","Immortal Jade Pagoda","overlapping fragments","Zhou Yi's corpse wife"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin reckons that if he reaches mid Soul Formation his Life and Death domain could break Hongdie's Dao heart.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":69,"title":"Zhou Yi's Obsession","summary":"Zhou Yi of the Five Elements Sect says he took the jade coffin and immortal sword a thousand years ago and tells the three young cultivators to go home, while Sun Tai, Great Elder of the Corpse Yin Sect, has also followed them in. In the third layer of the overlapping fragment, below a pool, Sun Tai demands the Celestial corpse Zhou Yi carries, the woman he calls Ting'er. Because a fight between two Soul Transformation experts would collapse all six stacked fragments, Sun Tai borrows Hongdie's body, Zhou Yi borrows Chi Hu's, and Wang Lin keeps them both in check by threatening to set off a heavenly tribulation with a restriction flag. Zhou Yi's Obsession domain, channelled through Chi Hu's axe, destroys one of Sun Tai's souls, but Sun Tai has more and keeps fighting for the corpse. A flashback shows Zhou Yi being condemned by his master Tang Xiong for stealing the sect's immortal jade for a corpse; Zhou Yi then burns his own primordial soul and drives Sun Tai off, and Wang Lin turns on the drained Hongdie.","events":["Zhou Yi warns the trio off; Sun Tai is revealed to have been following","The group enters the third layer through a pool; Hongdie and Chi Hu gather celestial energy","Sun Tai demands Zhou Yi's Celestial corpse, Ting'er","Hongdie shows her Suzaku Country core-disciple bracelet; Wang Lin threatens a tribulation with a restriction flag","Sun Tai fights through Hongdie's body, Zhou Yi through Chi Hu's, both suppressed to peak Soul Formation","Zhou Yi's Obsession domain destroys one of Sun Tai's souls","Flashback: Tang Xiong of the Five Elements Sect condemns Zhou Yi for stealing immortal jade","Zhou Yi burns his soul; Sun Tai flees; Wang Lin moves to kill Hongdie"],"introduced":["Sun Tai (Corpse Yin Sect Great Elder)","Ting'er","Tang Xiong","Five Elements Sect","Obsession domain","Yiyuan Kaitai bracelet","Black Horned Dragon soul clone"],"cultivation":"Zhou Yi is one of the few Soul Transformation experts on Planet Suzaku. Sun Tai says Zhou Yi has not reached Ascendant. Both suppress themselves to peak Soul Formation. Tang Xiong is late Soul Transformation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":70,"title":"Zhou Yi Becomes Ascendant","summary":"Wang Lin attacks the exhausted Hongdie, and when her bracelet starts to carry her back to the Suzaku Country he distracts her with the Seven Feather Fan of the Snow Region and cuts off one of her arms, planning to curse her through it. Trapped because the Return Furnace cannot work in overlapping fragments, he and Chi Hu go down to a fourth layer, a palace built of immortal jade. There Zhou Yi, burning his soul, wins against Sun Tai, reaches Ascendant in his last moments and remembers his past: the Celestial corpse had forced the obsession on him. He asks Wang Lin to care for his wife for a thousand years, a thousand immortal jades every thousand years, and pays him with three gifts: a pagoda holding his Ascendant domain, an Ascendant Crystal, and Sun Tai as Wang Lin's slave for a thousand years. Then Zhou Yi calls out the first Rain Celestial Sword, and the Celestial woman awakens and names him her sword spirit.","events":["Hongdie's bracelet starts carrying her home; Wang Lin uses the Seven Feather Fan to distract her","He severs her arm and plans to curse her through it","Wang Lin and Chi Hu descend to a fourth layer, a palace of immortal jade","Zhou Yi defeats Sun Tai while burning his soul and reaches Ascendant","Zhou Yi remembers his past and his debt to his master","He gives Wang Lin his pagoda, an Ascendant Crystal, and Sun Tai as a slave","The first Rain Celestial Sword appears and the Celestial makes Zhou Yi her sword spirit"],"introduced":["Seven Feather Fan","Return Furnace","Ascendant Crystal","Zhou Yi's pagoda","First Rain Celestial Sword","slave seal"],"cultivation":"Zhou Yi breaks through to Ascendant while burning his primordial soul. Hongdie notes Wang Lin's domain is only at mid Soul Formation level.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":71,"title":"The Four Rain Celestial Swords","summary":"The birth of the Rain Celestial Swords draws two powerful outsiders: Tian Mozi of Planet Tianmo and Ling Tianhou, the Sword Saint of the Da Lou Sword Sect. Sun Tai bluffs about a fourth soul hidden in Zhou Yi's coffin, but Wang Lin calls it a remnant soul and lets him live. Chi Hu's Star Compass is broken, so Wang Lin repairs it, and Chi Hu gives it to him in friendship. The awakened Celestial, who says her name is not really Ting'er, calls out the second and third swords and fights Ling Tianhou and his Scarlet Qilin, breaking his two swords with one finger even though her life force is fading. All-Seer appears, Tian Mozi takes one sword and leaves, and the Celestial's remnant soul thanks Zhou Yi, saying she was born from his obsession, before the fourth sword appears.","events":["Tian Mozi and Ling Tianhou sense the Rain Celestial Swords","Sun Tai's 'fourth soul' threat is exposed as a remnant soul","Wang Lin repairs the Star Compass and Chi Hu gives it to him","The Celestial summons the second and third swords","She overpowers Ling Tianhou and his Scarlet Qilin","All-Seer appears; Tian Mozi takes one sword","The Celestial's remnant soul says goodbye to Zhou Yi; the fourth sword appears"],"introduced":["Tian Mozi","Planet Tianmo","Ling Tianhou","Scarlet Qilin","All-Seer","Rain Celestial Swords"],"cultivation":"Tian Mozi is mid Nirvana Cleanser; Ling Tianhou is late Nirvana Cleanser.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":72,"title":"Zeng Niu's Name Spreads","summary":"As the Celestial dies, Wang Lin's Life and Death domain reaches its second level and brings him half a step from mid Soul Formation, and Zhou Yi's sword shadow drives Ling Tianhou back. Wang Lin is left holding two Rain Celestial Swords, and cultivators of the Hun Yuan Sect, the Sky Devil Sect and the Heaven and Earth Sect demand them. He kills Lu Tianrui with his domain, and Sun Tai comes out of hiding and slaughters the rest in exchange for a thousand years of freedom. Wang Lin and Chi Hu return to Planet Suzaku, where news of Hongdie's severed arm makes the name Zeng Niu famous. At the Suzaku Mountain altar, Feng Yushan reports that the real Zeng Niu of Tianhun Country is only a Foundation Establishment cultivator, and a kill order is issued, then withdrawn by Mount Suzaku.","events":["Wang Lin's Life and Death domain advances during the Celestial's death","Zhou Yi's sword shadow holds off Ling Tianhou","Hun Yuan, Sky Devil and Heaven and Earth Sect cultivators demand the two swords","Wang Lin kills Lu Tianrui in a battle of domains","Sun Tai kills the rest in exchange for a thousand years of freedom","Wang Lin and Chi Hu return to Planet Suzaku and part as friends","The Suzaku Country orders Zeng Niu killed, then Mount Suzaku cancels the order"],"introduced":["Zhuang Yi","Nie Ming","Lu Tianrui","Hun Yuan Sect","Sky Devil Sect","Heaven and Earth Sect","Feng Yushan","Mount Suzaku","Devotion domain"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's Life and Death domain reaches mid Soul Formation level (second level) while his cultivation stays early Soul Formation, half a step from mid. Zhuang Yi and Nie Ming are early Soul Formation; Lu Tianrui and Feng Yushan are mid Soul Formation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":73,"title":"Return to Chu","summary":"Back on Planet Suzaku, Wang Lin questions returning cultivators and finds out that the Suzaku Country has issued no wanted notice for Zeng Niu, and decides it is time to go home to Li Muwan. In the Country of Chu, Zhan Bai of an insect sect, one of the six Suzaku cultivators who entered the Rain Celestial Realm, is devouring sects; he kills the Qingtian Sect master Maiwu Yi and blames Zeng Niu for his own humiliation there. At the Cloud Sky Sect, Li Muwan, who has failed to form a Nascent Soul three times and lives on pills, remembers Wang Lin leaving her a refined demon, Xiao Ling, to guard her. Wang Lin buys grade-five pill recipes across the Sea of Devils, paying with special-grade spirit stones and killing a shop that tried to rob him. Zhan Bai breaks the Cloud Sky Sect's great formation, Li Muwan steps out to face him, and Wang Lin arrives to say she is his woman.","events":["Wang Lin hears that Zeng Niu is the talk of Planet Suzaku but no wanted notice is out","Zhan Bai devours sects across Chu and kills the Qingtian Sect master Maiwu Yi","Li Muwan, sect master of the Cloud Sky Sect, is failing in health","Flashback: Wang Lin gives Li Muwan the demon Xiao Ling as a guardian","Wang Lin buys grade-five pill recipes in the Sea of Devils","Zhan Bai breaks the Cloud Sky Sect's formation and attacks Li Muwan","Wang Lin arrives: 'she is my woman'"],"introduced":["Zhan Bai","Maiwu Yi","Qingtian Sect","Xiao Ling (refined demon)","Alchemy Pavilion of Moni City","grade-five pill recipes"],"cultivation":"Maiwu Yi is mid Nascent Soul. Zhan Bai is early Soul Formation. Li Muwan has failed three times in a hundred years to form a Nascent Soul.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":74,"title":"Wan'er's Fading Life","summary":"Revealed at the Cloud Sky Sect as Zeng Niu, Wang Lin kills Zhan Bai and his insect beast. He learns that Li Muwan's three failed Nascent Soul attempts and overuse of magic have used up her lifespan, and only forming a Nascent Soul can save her. He leaves the sect to Liu Fei and Song Qing, and has the disciples' memories of Zeng Niu wiped. He brings Wan'er to a cold, gloomy gorge on the Chu border and sets down Zhou Yi's pagoda to hold back the death energy in her body. He gives her the pill recipes and tells her about the Celestial Realm, and she hands him the sect's soul blood in case she dies. Learning that a grade-six Origin Recovery Pill recipe will be auctioned in the Sea of Devils, he takes her to their old cave at the Fighting Evil Sect, lifts the whole mountain to show it survived, feeds his Thunder Toad, and goes to the auction, where Gongsun Fan and Zi Xin are among the bidders.","events":["Wang Lin kills Zhan Bai","Liu Fei explains Li Muwan's lifespan is nearly gone","Wang Lin hands the Cloud Sky Sect to Liu Fei and Song Qing; Lu Fei and Tie Yan follow him","He sets Zhou Yi's pagoda in a cold gorge to suppress Wan'er's death energy","They visit their old cave at the Fighting Evil Sect in the Sea of Devils","Wang Lin feeds old pills to the wounded Thunder Toad","At the auction house he sees Gongsun Fan and Zi Xin"],"introduced":["Origin Recovery Pill (grade six)","Gongsun Fan","Zi Xin","death energy"],"cultivation":"Li Muwan has failed three times to form a Nascent Soul. Gongsun Fan is mid Soul Formation; Zi Xin is mid Nascent Soul.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":75,"title":"The Grade-Six Recipe","summary":"At the Weapon Refining Pavilion auction Wang Lin meets Sun Dian, the pavilion master, who is now weaker than him although Wang Lin was only Core Formation when they met two centuries ago, and an old acquaintance, Qiu. He bids a snow-meridian puppet carving for the grade-six Origin Recovery Pill recipe, but someone outbids him. The winner, Zi Xin of the Piaomiao Sect, lures him aside and asks him to find her father, lost in a celestial ruin; Wang Lin just copies the recipe and pays her twenty thousand spirit stones' worth. The recipe needs 137 ingredients, many extinct. He sets the Cloud Sky alchemists working on substitutes and takes the rest himself: a Tuoluo Lotus in Julu, treasures from several sects, and finally Ghost Soul Grass from the Yinyang Sect, guarded by a late Soul Formation elder. He returns just as Wan'er is about to fail.","events":["Sun Dian, master of the Weapon Refining Pavilion, recognises Wang Lin","Wang Lin offers a Snow Region puppet carving in the bidding for the grade-six recipe","Zi Xin asks him to find her lost father; he copies the recipe instead","Cloud Sky Sect alchemists search for substitutes for 137 ingredients","Wang Lin seizes a Tuoluo Lotus in Julu and raids several sects","He takes Ghost Soul Grass from the Yinyang Sect","He returns as Wan'er weakens and the pill refining begins"],"introduced":["Sun Dian","Yun Meng","Weapon Refining Pavilion","Piaomiao Sect","Tuoluo Lotus","Ghost Soul Grass","Yinyang Sect"],"cultivation":"Sun Dian is mid Soul Formation. A Tianfan Sect elder is early Soul Formation; a Yinyang Sect protector elder is late Soul Formation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":76,"title":"Defying Heaven's Law","summary":"Ouyang Zi, the Cloud Sky Sect's best alchemist, finally refines the grade-six Origin Recovery Pill, while Wang Lin spends three years building restrictions in the valley to face the tribulation that Heaven's Law will send. Li Muwan forms her Nascent Soul, but a hand of Heaven's Law comes down, her body dies, and her Nascent Soul is about to be erased. Wang Lin's clone and his Ancient God main body merge, and with the sun and moon in the sky together he fights a fist of Heaven's Law until it backs off. Wan'er's Nascent Soul survives and goes back to sleep, and Wang Lin expects Heaven's Law to return in nineteen years when it wakes. He swears that one day he will replace Heaven's Law and make it kneel.","events":["Wang Lin pours his Life and Death domain into Wan'er while the pill is refined","Ouyang Zi refines the grade-six Origin Recovery Pill","Wang Lin spends three years laying restrictions in the valley","Li Muwan forms her Nascent Soul and Heaven's Law strikes","Her body dies; Wang Lin's clone and Ancient God main body merge","He blocks Heaven's Law and saves her Nascent Soul","He vows to replace Heaven's Law"],"introduced":["Ouyang Zi","Heaven's Law","Xinghua Village","clone and main body merged form"],"cultivation":"Li Muwan forms her Nascent Soul. Wang Lin's clone merges with his Ancient God main body, and he is now a one-star Ancient God.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":77,"title":"Zhou Ru Is Born","summary":"Wang Lin places Li Muwan's Nascent Soul in a newborn girl, Zhou Ru, born to shopkeeper Zhou in Xinghua Village, knowing it will take about eighteen years for Wan'er to recover her memories, and that Heaven's Law will come again then. A year later a Suzaku Country envoy orders Zeng Niu to fight Hongdie within three months, and Wang Lin pushes it back to ten years. Sun Dian and Zi Xin invite him into the Land of the Forsaken Immortals to find the Reincarnation Tree, whose fruit raises the chance of breaking through from Soul Formation to Soul Transformation by thirty percent. From Tu Si's memories Wang Lin knows the fruit can also complete the Body Cleansing that would make him a true Ancient God. Meanwhile Hongdie refuses a limb-regrowing East Sea spirit and finds his curse on her arm. Wang Lin gives Tie Yan a technique, binds the demon Xu Liguo into the Rain Celestial Sword as its spirit, and enters the Forsaken land, where rune puppets and a three-leaf curse master attack.","events":["Li Muwan's Nascent Soul is reborn as Zhou Ru","A Suzaku Country envoy delivers Hongdie's challenge; Wang Lin delays it ten years","Sun Dian and Zi Xin invite him to look for the Reincarnation Tree","Hongdie vows revenge and discovers the curse in her arm","Wang Lin makes Xu Liguo the spirit of a Rain Celestial Sword","In the Land of the Forsaken Immortals the group meets rune puppets","A three-leaf Forsaken Immortal curse master attacks"],"introduced":["Zhou Ru","Land of the Forsaken Immortals","Forsaken Immortal Clan","Reincarnation Tree","Reincarnation Fruit","Body Cleansing","rune puppets","East Sea spirit"],"cultivation":"The Reincarnation Fruit raises the success rate of Soul Formation to Soul Transformation by 30%. A three-leaf curse master is said to equal Nascent Soul.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":78,"title":"The Forsaken Immortal Clan","summary":"In the Land of the Forsaken Immortals, Wang Lin learns that the 'savages' are the Forsaken Immortal Clan, divided into curse spell masters and war curse masters whose power grows with the number of leaves in their runes. He kills the five-leaf spell master Momo, then meets the six-leaf master Ka Mo, who tells him Planet Suzaku was once their home until the Suzaku Country rose to rank six and the Cultivation Alliance gave it the planet; the war that followed killed ninety percent of the clan. Ka Mo warns him that seven-leaf masters, equal to Soul Transformation, wait on the third level. Wang Lin rescues the wounded Sun Dian, who gives him an Ancient Bell to bring him along to the Reincarnation Tree. At the tree, three Reincarnation Fruits appear after Sun Dian sacrifices his two disciples' lifespans, and the six-leaf war curse master Chi Mu arrives.","events":["A three-leaf master is defeated; Wang Lin learns the clan's leaf ranks","Wang Lin kills the five-leaf spell master Momo","Ka Mo tells him the history of the Forsaken Immortal Clan and Planet Suzaku","Wang Lin frees Sun Dian from a rune puppet curse","Sun Dian gives him an Ancient Bell","Six-leaf masters Za Gu and Di Ya attack on the third level","Sun Dian sacrifices his disciples' lifespans to ripen three Reincarnation Fruits; Chi Mu appears"],"introduced":["Momo","Ka Mo","Tai Zhou","Za Gu","Di Ya","Chi Mu","Tao Shou","Ancient Bell","Cultivation Alliance","leaf ranks"],"cultivation":"Momo, a five-leaf master, matches Soul Formation; seven-leaf masters equal Soul Transformation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":79,"title":"Chased by a Seven-Leaf Master","summary":"Wang Lin fights the six-leaf war curse master Chi Mu with a Rain Celestial Sword and the God Slaying War Chariot, and kills him even though the chariot charges slowly and the sword's demon spirit, Xu Liguo, is close to breaking. The seven-leaf curse master Mu Ye then hunts him, corners him half a month later, and plants a rune seed in his forehead that would turn him into a rune puppet. Wang Lin escapes into a space rift, gets rid of the rune with the Heaven Defying Bead, which absorbs its wood-element essence, and masters the Star Compass's teleportation to flee for months. Mu Ye chases him for four months, then destroys the only exit and tries to open a way out with the clan's Ancestor Spirit Plant.","events":["Wang Lin kills Chi Mu with the Rain Celestial Sword and the God Slaying War Chariot","Seven-leaf master Mu Ye starts hunting him","Mu Ye corners him and plants a rune seed","Wang Lin flees into the void through a space rift","The Heaven Defying Bead absorbs the wood-element rune","He uses the Star Compass to escape for months","Mu Ye destroys the exit and turns to the Ancestor Spirit Plant"],"introduced":["Mu Ye","rune seed","Ancestor Spirit Plant","Rain Celestial Sword (with Xu Liguo as spirit)"],"cultivation":"Mu Ye says Wang Lin is only mid Soul Formation; Mu Ye is a seven-leaf master (Soul Transformation equivalent).","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":80,"title":"Situ Nan Wakes","summary":"Outside the Land of the Forsaken Immortals, Wang Lin's main body stops Zi Xin and Gongsun Fan as they come out. Zi Xin admits she used the Reincarnation Fruit as bait to find her father, after escaping being sold to the Suzaku Country as a cultivation furnace. She gives him the Reincarnation Fruit he needs, and his main body becomes a true Ancient God. Three years later, five-year-old Zhou Ru, born mute, is taken from Apricot Village by a Tianxing Sect daoist; Wang Lin saves her from mistreatment and raises her in his valley, where she speaks for the first time. Five years on, Liao Fan of the Snow Region attacks to take back the feather fan, and Situ Nan wakes and drives him off with the cold fire of the Underworld Ascension Method. Then the Suzaku envoy comes to take Zeng Niu to the ten-year duel with Hongdie, and the Snow Region sect master Li Yuanfeng lays a trap for him.","events":["Wang Lin's main body intercepts Zi Xin and Gongsun Fan","Zi Xin explains her past and gives up a Reincarnation Fruit","The main body completes Body Cleansing and becomes a true Ancient God","Wang Lin takes in five-year-old Zhou Ru after the Tianxing Sect mistreats her","Liao Fan of the Snow Region attacks; Situ Nan wakes and uses Underworld Ascension cold fire","Wang Lin leaves Zhou Ru, the pagoda and the Thunder Toad with Tie Yan","Li Yuanfeng plans to kill Zeng Niu after the duel with Hongdie"],"introduced":["Liao Fan","Li Yuanfeng","Tianxing Sect","Xiao Bai (tiger)","Wave Sound Spirit Armor","Underworld Ascension Method (Yellow Springs Ascension)"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's clone is mid Soul Formation; his main body becomes a true Ancient God. Liao Fan is late Soul Formation; Li Yuanfeng is early Soul Transformation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":81,"title":"The Duel with Hongdie","summary":"Wang Lin, living under the name Zeng Niu, arrives on the Suzaku Plain of Planet Suzaku, where Bai Xue of the Immortal's Path Sect explains the four cultivation countries and the three great sects of Suzaku Country, all under the 14th-generation Suzaku, Zhu Quezi. Sect master Li Yunlong slips into his residence unseen, and Wang Lin starts to feel the plain is less a home than a prison. Seven days later Zhu Quezi, his disciples Qian Feng and Liu Mei, and the Ascendant elders watch Wang Lin fight Hongdie at the Barren Mountain arena. Hongdie strikes with the Ice God sword and a Soul Lasher whip stolen from the Heavenly Jade Sect, and Wang Lin answers with heavenly lightning and the God Slaying War Chariot. Hongdie then uses Soul Separation and her Emotionless Intent Realm to show him visions of his parents, Li Muwan and Zhou Ru, and cuts them down with her Sword of Wisdom. Wang Lin realises that emotions cannot simply be cut away and that even someone who has cut off every feeling cannot escape the cycle of life and death.","events":["Bai Xue meets Wang Lin (as Zeng Niu) and guides him across the Suzaku Plain to the Immortal's Path Sect","Bai Xue explains the four countries of the Suzaku Plain and the Heavenly Jade, Earth Soul and Immortal's Path sects under Zhu Quezi","Sect master Li Yunlong enters Wang Lin's room unnoticed; Wang Lin maps the area in case he has to flee","Zhu Quezi arrives at the Barren Mountain arena with Qian Feng and Liu Mei; Chu Yunfei starts the duel","Hongdie uses the Ice God and the Soul Lasher, a Heavenly Jade Sect treasure given to her by Feng Yushan; Wang Lin calls heavenly lightning and the God Slaying War Chariot","Hongdie uses Soul Separation and the Emotionless Intent Realm to show Wang Lin his loved ones dying","Wang Lin sees through the illusion: the Sword of Wisdom cannot cut the cycle of reincarnation"],"introduced":["Bai Xue","Li Yunlong","Zhu Quezi","Qian Feng","Chu Yunfei","Suzaku Plain","Immortal's Path Sect","Heavenly Jade Sect","Earth Soul Sect","Barren Mountain duel arena","Soul Lasher","Emotionless Intent Realm","Sword of Wisdom"],"cultivation":"Bai Xue: late Soul Formation. Li Yunlong (Immortal's Path Sect master) and Chu Yunfei (Heavenly Jade Sect ancestor): early Ascendant. Zhu Quezi, 14th Suzaku: Ascendant great perfection, the only one on Planet Suzaku. Liu Mei and Qian Feng: mid Soul Transformation. Hongdie is at Soul Formation great perfection and cannot yet reach Soul Transformation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":82,"title":"Furnaces of the Suzaku","summary":"Wang Lin breaks Hongdie's Emotionless Intent Realm with his own Life and Death Intent, and she then tries to blow up her innate spirits to take him with her. Zhu Quezi stops the fight, declares Wang Lin the winner, accepts him into Suzaku Country and the Immortal's Path Sect, and grants him one wish. In the forbidden area Zhu Quezi reveals that he treats talented cultivators as furnaces: Qian Feng absorbs the broken Hongdie, who becomes his second furnace under the name Jue Qing, and Wang Lin is chosen as Liu Mei's future furnace. Liu Mei remembers Wang Lin from her avatar's days in the Xuan Dao Sect in the Country of Zhao. Zhu Quezi also warns that his junior brother Yun Quezi has been training four candidates of his own for the 15th Suzaku title. Badly hurt, Wang Lin leaves for Zhao, but in the far north Li Yuanfeng of the Snow Domain traps him in the Heaven and Earth Devil Sealing Formation, and a second Soul Transformation cultivator joins the ambush.","events":["Wang Lin's Life and Death Intent beats Hongdie's Emotionless Intent; she tries to blow up her Four Souls","Zhu Quezi ends the duel, names Zeng Niu the winner and grants him a wish","Qian Feng absorbs Hongdie, who becomes his furnace Jue Qing","Zhu Quezi tells Liu Mei that Zeng Niu is Wang Lin and that he is meant to be her furnace","Zhu Quezi confronts Yun Quezi over the four candidates he has picked","Wang Lin heads for the Country of Zhao to recover","Li Yuanfeng traps him in the Heaven and Earth Devil Sealing Formation in the far north"],"introduced":["Jue Qing (Hongdie as Qian Feng's furnace)","Yun Quezi's four candidates","Heaven and Earth Devil Sealing Formation","Thousand Illusions Emotionless Dao","Snow Domain"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin is so badly hurt that he drops to early Soul Formation. Li Yuanfeng reached Soul Transformation as the only survivor of seven Snow Domain Soul Formation elders who escorted Hongdie to Suzaku Country.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":83,"title":"Trapped Between Two Soul Transformations","summary":"Inside Li Yuanfeng's sealing formation, the Giant Demon Clan ancestor demands Wang Lin's flying sword, his lightning-calling flag and the Star Compass that his clan heir Chi Hu once gave Wang Lin in the Celestial Realm. Chi Hu refuses to help kill his friend and quietly shows Wang Lin the way out, and is sentenced to a hundred years of punishment. Li Yuanfeng presses him with his Tea Intent Realm. Sun Tai of the Corpse Yin Sect then breaks in to take Wang Lin's body for himself, while the ancestor wants the body to track down the Heaven Defying Bead and trade it to the Cultivation Alliance. Sun Tai carries Wang Lin off to the border of Pilu Country and seals him. With Li Yuanfeng's tea scar locked in by Sun Tai's seal, Wang Lin's cultivation drains away to level 3 Qi Condensation. The ancestor fights Sun Tai with his innate Demon Child and throws him to a distant star region, while Wang Lin is left almost mortal, eight years before Li Muwan must face the Heavenly Dao again.","events":["The Giant Demon Clan ancestor and Li Yuanfeng corner Wang Lin and claim his treasures","Chi Hu admits he gave Wang Lin the Star Compass and shows him the formation's exit to the southeast","Li Yuanfeng unleashes his Tea Intent Realm against Wang Lin's Life and Death Intent","Sun Tai of the Corpse Yin Sect arrives and claims Wang Lin's body","The ancestor reveals he learned that Zeng Niu is Wang Lin and wants the Heaven Defying Bead for the Cultivation Alliance","Sun Tai drags Wang Lin to the Pilu Country border and seals him; his cultivation collapses to level 3 Qi Condensation","The ancestor fights Sun Tai with the Demon Child and sends him to a far-off star region"],"introduced":["Giant Demon Clan ancestor","Giant Demon Clan","Tea Intent Realm","Thunder Intent Realm","Demon Child","Sky-Splitting Giant Axe","Pilu Country","Cultivation Alliance","Thousand-Year Slave Seal"],"cultivation":"The Giant Demon Clan ancestor is early Soul Transformation, Sun Tai mid Soul Transformation. Wang Lin's clone drops to level 3 Qi Condensation as the combined seals drain his spiritual power.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":84,"title":"A Mortal in the Water Prison","summary":"Stripped of his cultivation, Wang Lin is found by bandits of the Fire Cloud Fortress in Pilu Country. They break his limbs, use him as bait against the Tianwei escort bureau, and throw him into their water prison. Meanwhile Suzaku Country gossips that Zeng Niu has vanished; Zhu Quezi tells Liu Mei the disappearance is tied to the Snow Domain and the Giant Demon Clan and gives her a jade slip to track him. Wang Lin finds spiritual energy in the prison water, uses it to open his storage bag, and with the Mosquito Beast turns the bandit chief Zhai Yu and his fortress into his servants. Under the prison he finds a skeleton sealed with top-grade spirit stones beside a purple light. After six months he is only at level 6 Qi Condensation, so he swallows immortal jade to force the seal and reaches late Foundation Establishment. He then sets his sights on the Soul Refining Sect, one of the three great sects of Pilu Country.","events":["Fire Cloud Fortress bandits capture the powerless Wang Lin and break his limbs","Rumours spread that Zeng Niu vanished the day after the duel; Zhu Quezi gives Liu Mei a tracking jade slip","Qian Feng keeps Jue Qing from letting her last piece of soul escape","In the water prison Wang Lin absorbs hidden spiritual energy and frees his storage bag","The Mosquito Beast cows the bandits; Zhai Yu becomes his servant","Wang Lin studies the sealed skeleton, the purple light and his scroll","He swallows immortal jade, breaks part of the seal and reaches late Foundation Establishment","He decides to join the Soul Refining Sect"],"introduced":["Zhai Yu","Fire Cloud Fortress","Tianwei escort bureau","Soul Refining Sect","water-prison skeleton"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's clone recovers to level 6 Qi Condensation after six months, then to late Foundation Establishment. His real body lies dormant in Chu Country.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":85,"title":"Qing Mu of the Soul Refining Sect","summary":"The Giant Demon Clan ancestor, whose body was ruined by Sun Tai, takes over a clansman's body and binds Wang Lin's sword spirit Xu Liguo as his own. Wang Lin joins the Soul Refining Sect in Pilu Country as an outer disciple named Qing Mu, bribing the outer manager Hong Maozi with a sword. Under manager Chang Dawei, Wang Lin learns that the sect's power rests on its soul flags and that only the winner of the outer-disciple contest held every three years enters the inner sect. By breaking the barrier around the Kun Crystal that feeds his cave, he climbs back to late Foundation Establishment. When Chang Dawei grows suspicious and tries to rob him, Wang Lin turns the tables. He then uses the pressure of the sect's spirit vein mine to smash his seal, rising through Core Formation to the peak of mid Nascent Soul in one night.","events":["The Giant Demon Clan ancestor seizes a clansman's body and binds Xu Liguo as his sword spirit","Wang Lin bribes Hong Maozi with a sword and is admitted as outer disciple Qing Mu","Chang Dawei explains soul flags and the three-yearly outer-disciple contest","Wang Lin drains the Kun Crystal feeding his cave and moves to Cave 743 near the spirit eye","Chang Dawei tries to rob 'Qing Mu' of his secret and is defeated","In the spirit vein mine Wang Lin breaks through Core Formation into mid Nascent Soul"],"introduced":["Hong Maozi","Chang Dawei","Qing Mu (Wang Lin's alias)","soul flags","Kun Crystal","spirit vein mine","outer-disciple grand contest"],"cultivation":"Hong Maozi and Chang Dawei: early Core Formation. Wang Lin climbs from late Foundation Establishment through early, mid and late Core Formation to early Nascent Soul and the peak of mid Nascent Soul.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":86,"title":"Winning the Outer Contest","summary":"The Soul Refining Sect searches the outer sect for whoever wrecked the spirit vein, but inner disciple Wang Zhen's soul-search checks never notice Wang Lin. Wang Lin's body is back to the peak of late Nascent Soul, while his Intent is at the level of mid Soul Formation. Liu Mei finds him and warns him about a bracelet she once saw on Hongdie, but he suspects her motives and sends her away. At the bloody outer-disciple contest, which Wang Lin realises exists to harvest souls for the sect, he reaches the final and turns Sima's Death Curse back on him. Grand Elder Wu Daoqi lets him pass, and Wang Zhen leads him into the inner sect's Soul Refining Peak, explaining soul flags, the nine Soul Formation elders and the two Soul Transformation ancestors, including Dun Tian and his Billion Soul Flag. Wang Lin takes a Hundred Soul Flag and a jade slip by force, learns from Xu Yun that the full method is split across three peaks, and breaks into an Ancient Soul Restriction in the main spirit vein.","events":["Wang Zhen leads a soul-search sweep of the outer sect; Wang Lin passes unnoticed","Liu Mei visits Wang Lin and warns him about Hongdie's bracelet; he refuses her","Wang Lin realises the contest is a way to collect souls","He beats Sima's Death Curse in the final and is checked by Grand Elder Wu Daoqi","Wang Zhen explains soul flag ranks, the three peaks, and Ancestor Dun Tian's Billion Soul Flag","Wang Lin takes a Hundred Soul Flag and a jade slip from a senior in the scripture pavilion","Xu Yun explains that the soul flag method is split among three peaks","Wang Lin breaks an Ancient Soul Restriction in the main spirit vein"],"introduced":["Wang Zhen","Sima","Wu Daoqi","Xu Yun","Dun Tian (named)","Billion Soul Flag (named)","Hundred Soul Flag","Death Curse","Soul Refining, Soul Extraction and God Sealing peaks","Ancient Soul Restriction"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin: peak of late Nascent Soul, with his Intent at mid Soul Formation. Wang Zhen: early Nascent Soul. Sima: peak Core Formation. Wu Daoqi: late Nascent Soul great perfection. Xu Yun: mid Core Formation. The sect has nine Soul Formation elders and two Soul Transformation ancestors.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":87,"title":"The Hundred Thousand Soul Flag","summary":"Core disciple Guo Dongjian comes to take 'Qing Mu's' soul flag, but Wang Lin has already mastered the Soul Vortex and wins a Thousand Soul Flag from him. In a flashback to three months earlier, Wang Lin learns the three soul arts of the Soul Refining Peak inside the Ancient Soul Restriction: Condensation, Soul Vortex and Blood Sacrifice. Liu Mei comes again, tells him that her senior brother Qian Feng killed Hongdie and urges him to leave Planet Suzaku, but a slip of her mask shows Wang Lin she is still walking an emotionless path. Wang Lin's clone reaches early Soul Formation. Down in the spirit vein, he defeats a rival's Ten Thousand Soul Flag, keeps destroying helper spirits, and uses the God Slaying War Chariot to subdue the remnant soul of a Qilin as the main soul of a Hundred Thousand Soul Flag. He trades three hundred souls to Su Jinshi for the Soul Extraction jade slip. Because the God Sealing method is kept only for Soul Formation elders, he goes to the sect gate and calls the sect out.","events":["Guo Dongjian challenges Qing Mu and loses his Thousand Soul Flag to Wang Lin's Soul Vortex","Flashback: Wang Lin learns Condensation, Soul Vortex and Blood Sacrifice","Liu Mei tells him Qian Feng killed Hongdie and urges him to flee; he sees through her","Wang Lin's clone reaches early Soul Formation","A rival uses a Ten Thousand Soul Flag and Blood Sacrifice against him","Wang Lin subdues a Qilin remnant soul as the main soul of a Hundred Thousand Soul Flag","He trades 300 souls to Su Jinshi for the Soul Extraction jade slip","He challenges the Soul Refining Sect to draw out a Soul Transformation ancestor"],"introduced":["Guo Dongjian","Su Jinshi","Liu Wei","Soul Vortex","Blood Sacrifice","Thousand Soul Flag","Ten Thousand Soul Flag","Hundred Thousand Soul Flag","Purple Wood Flag Bell","Qilin remnant soul"],"cultivation":"Guo Dongjian: early Nascent Soul. Wang Lin's clone breaks into early Soul Formation, but his divine sense is still not fully restored. The Qilin remnant soul is as strong as late Soul Formation great perfection.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":88,"title":"Dun Tian's Three Gifts","summary":"Wang Lin's challenge pulls out the Soul Refining Sect's nine Soul Formation elders and then Ancestor Dun Tian, who already knows he is Zeng Niu and drives Liu Mei out of the sect with the Billion Soul Flag. Dun Tian gives Wang Lin three gifts: Soul Transformation pressure to restore his divine sense, souls from the flag that lift his clone to late Soul Formation, and a draw on the flag's power that his real Ancient God body also absorbs. Inside the Blood Ring, Dun Tian explains that Suzaku Country has crushed every level 5 country that came close to level 6, including the Soul Refining Sect, and that Yun Quezi named Wang Lin one of his four Suzaku heirs. Dun Tian makes Wang Lin the sect's only core disciple, gives him the Soul Sealing Technique and the method to control the Billion Soul Flag, and promises to protect him for ten years. Wang Lin's real body, now a three-star Ancient God, absorbs wood essence, so the Heaven Defying Bead lacks only metal. Wang Lin then swears revenge on Li Yuanfeng, the Giant Demon Clan ancestor and Sun Tai, and appears before Li Yuanfeng.","events":["The nine Soul Formation elders come down; Dun Tian comes out of seclusion","Dun Tian expels Liu Mei with the Billion Soul Flag","Dun Tian's pressure restores Wang Lin's divine sense to mid Soul Formation","Soul power from the flag lifts the clone to late Soul Formation; the real body absorbs too","Dun Tian tells the history of the Forsaken Immortal war and Suzaku Country's policy against level 6 rivals","He names Wang Lin the sect's sole core disciple and gives him the Soul Sealing Technique","Wang Lin's real body is a three-star Ancient God; the bead needs only metal","Wang Lin confronts Li Yuanfeng"],"introduced":["Dun Tian (on screen)","Blood Ring","Soul Sealing Technique","Suzaku Mountain","level 5/level 6 cultivation countries"],"cultivation":"Dun Tian: peak Soul Transformation; with the Billion Soul Flag he can face an Ascendant. Wang Lin's clone reaches late Soul Formation in spiritual power, while his insight stays at mid Soul Formation. His real body is a three-star Ancient God.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":89,"title":"The Fall of the Snow Domain","summary":"Wang Lin storms the Snow God Temple of the Snow Domain. With his real body and clone now fused, he faces Li Yuanfeng, who sends his people a thousand miles away and attacks with the Soul-Draining Drum and his Tea Intent Domain. Wang Lin learns from Li Yuanfeng's Intent and pours Ancient God power into his own, so that his Life and Death Intent rises to the Soul Transformation level. Li Yuanfeng threatens to blow himself up and then gives up his life to spare the Snow Domain. Wang Lin takes his Soul Transformation spirit, seals the cultivation of the survivors, and bans cultivators above Soul Formation and all sects from the land, so the country falls from level 5 to level 3. Yun Quezi and Zhou Wutai watch, and Yun Quezi sends Zhou Wutai to deal with Liu Mei. Back at the Soul Refining Sect, Dun Tian's messenger Ouyang Tian brings Wang Lin a jade slip that counters the Giant Demon Clan's teleportation and a sub-flag of the Billion Soul Flag that holds twelve purple-gold souls, and Wang Lin sets out for the Giant Demon Clan ancestor.","events":["Wang Lin breaks into the Snow God Temple and confronts Li Yuanfeng","Li Yuanfeng uses the Soul-Draining Drum and his Tea Intent Domain","Wang Lin adds Ancient God power to his Life and Death Intent, which reaches Soul Transformation level","Li Yuanfeng gives his life; Wang Lin takes his spirit and seals the Snow Domain","Yun Quezi and Zhou Wutai discuss Wang Lin, Qian Feng, Liu Mei and the Suzaku succession","Wang Lin asks the dormant Situ Nan about immortal power and decides to fight the Giant Demon ancestor","Ouyang Tian delivers Dun Tian's anti-teleport jade slip and a Billion Soul Flag sub-flag"],"introduced":["Snow God Temple","Soul-Draining Drum","Zhou Wutai (as Yun Quezi's candidate)","Ouyang Tian","Billion Soul Flag sub-flag","Zi Xin (named)"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's fused body is at late Soul Formation, and his Life and Death Intent reaches Soul Transformation level. Li Yuanfeng's cultivation falls to Nascent Soul before he dies. Zhou Wutai is at mid Soul Formation. The Snow Domain drops from a level 5 to a level 3 cultivation country.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":90,"title":"Breaking the Tongtian Formation","summary":"Wang Lin goes to the Giant Demon Clan, where Grand Elder Tian Mu and the other elders order the whole clan to kill him. Chi Hu begs him to spare the clan, and when Wang Lin says he only wants his immortal sword back, Chi Hu opens the Tongtian Great Formation, part of the ancestor's body, as his last debt to Wang Lin. Wang Lin takes all twelve waves of the formation, which no one in the clan has ever done, breaks it, and uses it to call the ancestor out. He forbids anyone in the clan to reach Nascent Soul without his permission, and Xu Liguo, the sword spirit the ancestor had bound, turns on his new master and returns to Wang Lin. Liu Mei tries to strike while the ancestor fights with the clan's sky-splitting axe, but Zhou Wutai holds her back, and Wang Lin unleashes the Billion Soul Flag sub-flag. When the ancestor tries a final teleportation curse, Dun Tian's locating formation finds him and Wang Lin kills him. With the eighteen-year deadline nearly over, Wang Lin vows to take Li Muwan back from the Heavenly Dao.","events":["The Giant Demon Clan elders order the clan to kill Zeng Niu","Chi Hu persuades Wang Lin to spare the clan and opens the Tongtian Great Formation","Wang Lin withstands all twelve waves and breaks the formation","He forbids the Giant Demon Clan from producing Nascent Soul cultivators","Xu Liguo betrays the ancestor and returns to Wang Lin","Zhou Wutai blocks Liu Mei; Wang Lin uses the Billion Soul Flag sub-flag","Dun Tian's locating formation defeats the ancestor's teleportation and the ancestor dies","Wang Lin turns to saving Li Muwan"],"introduced":["Tian Mu","Tongtian Great Formation","Dongji Mountain","Hellfire Beast"],"cultivation":"Tian Mu and the second and third Giant Demon elders are at Soul Formation great perfection. The ancestor's partly fused body is said to be almost as strong as a three-star Ancient God.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":91,"title":"Two Souls in One Body","summary":"Wang Lin examines a drop of Ancient God blood taken from the Giant Demon ancestor, and the soul fragment of a woman named Mei Ji begs him to let her go. He returns to Zhou Ru and Tie Yan and, to keep the trouble of his killings away from Li Muwan's revival, moves Zhou Ru to a stone house in the wastes of Planet Yue. Wang Lin knows the Heavenly Dao will strike again when Zhou Ru turns eighteen and Wan'er's Nascent Soul is complete. Four years later, the sixteen-year-old Zhou Ru dreams of an older sister waking inside her, and Wang Lin realises the body has two consciousnesses and that Wan'er's waking will swallow Zhou Ru. He tells Zhou Ru the truth about Li Muwan, and she agrees to have her soul sealed for a while, on his promise to find her a better body. The white tiger Xiao Bai brings her a Nascent fruit, and Zhou Ru tells Wang Lin to spare it. Two years later Wang Lin tells her the story of how he met Wan'er as the moment of her waking nears.","events":["Wang Lin finds Ancient God blood in the ancestor's treasure and meets the soul fragment Mei Ji","He reunites with Zhou Ru and Tie Yan and takes Zhou Ru and Xiao Bai to Planet Yue","He plans how to face the Heavenly Dao when Zhou Ru turns eighteen","At sixteen Zhou Ru feels another person inside her","Wang Lin tells her about Li Muwan and agrees to seal her soul until he finds her a new body","Xiao Bai brings a Nascent fruit; Zhou Ru asks Wang Lin to spare the tiger","Two years later Wang Lin tells Zhou Ru his story with Wan'er"],"introduced":["Mei Ji","Planet Yue","Ancient God blood drop","Nascent fruit"],"confidence":"medium"},{"ep":92,"title":"Life and Death","summary":"As Li Muwan begins to wake inside Zhou Ru, the Heavenly Dao comes down for her a third time. Wang Lin fights the Heavenly Dao in his Ancient God body and with the power of reincarnation, while the Heavenly Dao calls him an ant shaking a tree. Wan'er's soul begs him to stop before he dies, and says her lifespan has ended and that she cannot take the body of Zhou Ru, whom she has felt growing up for nineteen years. She tells him she is content to have loved him and asks him to take care of himself. In his grief Wang Lin brings his Life and Death Intent to great perfection, and he lets go of his wish to bring his parents back, leaving them free to stay or go. He sends Zhou Ru back to Chu Country with her memories of him erased. He vows to spend any number of years to wake Wan'er, and, half a step from Soul Transformation, returns to Planet Suzaku.","events":["The Heavenly Dao descends as Wan'er begins to wake","Wang Lin fights it with his Ancient God body and the power of reincarnation","Wan'er refuses to take Zhou Ru's body and bids Wang Lin farewell","Wang Lin's Life and Death Intent reaches great perfection","He releases his obsession with resurrecting his parents","Zhou Ru is sent back to Chu Country with her memories erased","Wang Lin vows to wake Wan'er and returns to Planet Suzaku to break through"],"introduced":["Heavenly Dao (avatar)","Broken Infant Fruit"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's Life and Death Intent reaches great perfection, and he is half a step from Soul Transformation.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":93,"title":"Ancestor of Zhao","summary":"Ancestor Xu, an eleven-leaf ancestor of the Forsaken Immortal Clan, gives up his life to break the five swords that the first Suzaku and nine Ascendant cultivators forged to seal his clan. The clan pours out to retake Planet Suzaku, and Zhu Quezi calls on every cultivation country to resist. Wang Lin, who needs far more immortal jade for Soul Transformation than he has, returns to the Country of Zhao, saves his cousin Wang Zhuo from the six-leaf shaman Pang You and helps him reach Nascent Soul. Wang Zhuo explains that a truce after Qian Feng's drawn duel with the Forsaken heir handed every level 3 country to the clan, and that Zhao is about to fall. When the six-leaf shaman Mo Luo breaks the Zhao royal family's last defences, Wang Lin crushes him in a moment. Hailed as the Ancestor of Zhao, he leaves a legacy to help Zhao's cultivators break through and a protective formation that only Soul Transformation can break. Wang Zhuo stays to guard their family's bloodline, and Wang Lin returns to the Soul Refining Sect, where Dun Tian is waiting.","events":["Ancestor Xu sacrifices himself to break the five-sword seal on the Forsaken Immortal Clan","The Forsaken Immortals march on Planet Suzaku; Zhu Quezi rallies the cultivation countries","Wang Lin saves Wang Zhuo from Pang You and helps him into Nascent Soul","Wang Zhuo tells of the truce that surrendered all level 3 countries","Mo Luo attacks the Zhao royal family at the ancestral home and the Heng Yue Sect","Wang Lin kills Mo Luo and is hailed as Ancestor of Zhao","He leaves breakthrough aids and a protective formation for Zhao","Wang Zhuo stays in Zhao; Wang Lin returns to Dun Tian"],"introduced":["Ancestor Xu","Pang You","Mo Luo","Wang Qi","Wang Yu","Zhen Fengxiao","Ancestor Spirit Tree","five-sword seal","leaf shamans","Reincarnation Tree"],"cultivation":"Ancestor Xu: peak Ascendant (eleven-leaf). Wang Zhuo goes from late Core Formation to early Nascent Soul. Pang You and Mo Luo are six-leaf shamans. Wang Lin is one step from Soul Transformation but short of immortal jade.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":94,"title":"Raiding for Immortal Jade","summary":"In the Soul Refining Sect's forbidden area, the dying Dun Tian passes the sect to Wang Lin in front of the spirit tablets of its Soul Transformation ancestors. In return Wang Lin must guard the Billion Soul Flag and one day raise the sect into a level 6 cultivation country. Since the sect has only a third of the immortal jade Wang Lin needs for Soul Transformation, Dun Tian takes him to rob other sects, starting with Yan Hong and Sha Zi of the Wild Demon Sect, and teaches him that immortal jade can only be taken by force. On the way back they meet the Forsaken Immortal Clan's Fifth Ancestor Cui Zhi, a nine-leaf shaman. Dun Tian shows Wang Lin the flag's true power, rising to mid Ascendant strength, and sends Cui Zhi away. He tells Wang Lin that the Fourth Main Soul in the flag, the sect's last Ascendant ancestor, fell beside the second Suzaku, whom Wang Lin suspects is Situ Nan. At Suzaku Country's great Suzaku Mystic Formation, Dun Tian forces Qian Feng to let them through, and Qian Feng challenges Wang Lin to a duel.","events":["Dun Tian hands Wang Lin the Soul Refining Sect and the duty to guard the Billion Soul Flag","Dun Tian and Wang Lin rob the Wild Demon Sect of half its immortal jade","Wang Lin remembers Tian Yunzi's invitation to Planet Tian Yun","Cui Zhi, a nine-leaf shaman, attacks them; Dun Tian shows the flag's full power and drives him off","Dun Tian tells of the Fourth Main Soul and the second Suzaku; Wang Lin suspects Situ Nan","Dun Tian finds Giant Demon blood in the Suzaku Mystic Formation and makes Qian Feng open it","Qian Feng challenges Wang Lin"],"introduced":["Wild Demon Sect","Yan Hong","Sha Zi","Cui Zhi","Tian Yunzi (memory)","Planet Tian Yun","Suzaku Mystic Formation","Fourth Main Soul","Thirteen Soul Formation"],"cultivation":"Yan Hong and Sha Zi: early Soul Transformation. Cui Zhi, a nine-leaf shaman, is equal to early Ascendant. Using the flag, Dun Tian reaches mid Ascendant power. Dun Tian says Wang Lin's immortal-energy fusion is at great perfection and his body has reached the Crystal Bone stage.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":95,"title":"Soul Transformation","summary":"Wang Lin cuts Qian Feng off mid-sentence and blows up a soul avatar against his Suzaku Awl, ending the bout. Qian Feng later vents his anger on Jue Qing and plans to take both Wang Lin's and Liu Mei's Intent Domains. Guarded by Dun Tian, Wang Lin goes through the three steps of Soul Transformation: cutting his mortal roots, reforging his body into an immortal one, and crystallising his origin soul. In the west, the Forsaken Immortal Clan's Fifth Ancestor and her people plant an Ancestor Soul Seed in a Giant Demon corpse traded from the Corpse Yin Sect, to grow Reincarnation Trees that will hatch ten-leaf warriors. Zhu Quezi comes to the Soul Refining Sect to claim the Billion Soul Flag under an old pact, and when Dun Tian refuses, he crushes the sect with the power the Cultivation Alliance gave him. Dun Tian offers up his whole lifespan to wake the Fourth Main Soul, and Zhu Quezi spends nine-tenths of his remaining lifespan on a Stopping Intent Domain to beat it. As Zhu Quezi reaches for the flag, Wang Lin emerges at early Soul Transformation, and Zhu Quezi realises the man before him is not Zeng Niu.","events":["Wang Lin beats Qian Feng by exploding a soul avatar against his Suzaku Awl","Qian Feng takes his anger out on Jue Qing","Dun Tian guards Wang Lin through the three steps of Soul Transformation","The Forsaken Immortal Clan plants the Ancestor Soul Seed to grow Reincarnation Trees","Zhu Quezi demands the Billion Soul Flag and attacks the Soul Refining Sect","Dun Tian gives his lifespan to awaken the Fourth Main Soul","Zhu Quezi uses a Stopping Intent Domain from the Cultivation Alliance","Wang Lin emerges at early Soul Transformation; Zhu Quezi senses someone else"],"introduced":["Suzaku Awl","Ancestor Soul Seed","Reincarnation Tree","Stopping Intent Domain","Suzaku Holy Fire","Three Golden Souls","three steps of Soul Transformation"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's clone breaks through to early Soul Transformation. The Fourth Main Soul was an Ascendant with three golden spirit roots and is strong enough to threaten late Ascendants.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":96,"title":"Situ Nan Returns","summary":"Situ Nan, awake again and speaking through Wang Lin, drives off Zhu Quezi, who recognises him as the second Suzaku when he names the first Suzaku, Ye Wuyou. For Ye Wuyou's sake Situ Nan lends Zhu Quezi the Fourth Main Soul for three years to fight the Forsaken Immortal Clan, but takes two of his fingers as the price. Dun Tian, at peace, pours his memories into a memory flag for Wang Lin and wipes his own mind to join the Billion Soul Flag beside his master Yun Yimo. In the north of the Suzaku Continent, Situ Nan devours the Ancestor Spirit of a Reincarnation Tree, wiping out an Ascendant shaman the clan was about to hatch. With Wang Lin's help, he lures a young Ascendant-level Forsaken pursuer into the Jiuli Qi barrier of the Little Northern Extreme Fire region and seizes his Demon Child body. Situ Nan lets Wang Lin keep the Heaven Defying Bead and warns him about the Cultivation Planet Crystal, the Cultivation Alliance's tool for draining the life souls of a planet's people, which Situ Nan himself sealed long ago. Wang Lin swears that no one will control his fate and that he will take back Wan'er's life soul, which the crystal also holds.","events":["Situ Nan drives off Zhu Quezi, who realises he is the second Suzaku","Situ Nan lends the Fourth Main Soul for three years and takes two of Zhu Quezi's fingers","Dun Tian leaves his memories in a memory flag and joins the Billion Soul Flag","Situ Nan devours the Ancestor Spirit of a Reincarnation Tree","Situ Nan and Wang Lin trap a young Forsaken Ascendant in the Little Northern Extreme Fire region (Jiuli Qi barrier); Situ Nan takes his body","Situ Nan gives up the Heaven Defying Bead to Wang Lin","Situ Nan explains the Cultivation Planet Crystal that he sealed on Planet Suzaku"],"introduced":["Ye Wuyou (named)","Yun Yimo","memory flag","Little Northern Extreme Fire region","Jiuli Qi","Extreme Flame Moonlight","Cultivation Planet Crystal","Heart of the Cultivation Star"],"cultivation":"Yun Yimo, a former master of the Soul Refining Sect, is at late Soul Transformation (in memory). The Forsaken Immortal Fourth Ancestor is a nine-leaf shaman, who mocks Zhu Quezi's opponent as only early Ascendant. Situ Nan's new body has a Demon Child physique and Ascendant cultivation. Situ Nan notes that Wang Lin has reached Soul Transformation despite having an Extreme Realm.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":97,"title":"Zhou Yi's Last Jar of Wine","summary":"Wang Lin plans to win back his own and Li Muwan's life souls from Zhu Quezi, then leave Planet Suzaku for Planet Tian Yun. Zhou Yi brings the last jar of their old wine and tells him how the war has turned: Yun Quezi has shown himself as the Second Ancestor of the Forsaken Immortal Clan, a ten-leaf shaman, and has given Zhu Quezi three months to split the planet with the clan. Zhu Quezi survives only because he holds the Cultivation Planet Heart and could destroy the crystal that holds the clan's life souls, and in those three months the clan kills the Di Po Sect's Ascendant ancestor, drives out Tianyu Sect master Chu Yunfei and overruns the countries of Shui Mo, Mu Dan and Qin. Zhou Yi says Yun Quezi has chosen him, Zi Xin and Wang Lin to fight Zhu Quezi's disciples, but Wang Lin refuses to go, and Zhou Yi leaves him a jade slip holding Liu Mei's Domain Intent. At the Corpse Yin Sect in the Country of Zhao, Wang Lin catches the primordial soul of Cao Yidou of Planet Tian Yun's Mi Le Sect and makes him his servant for a hundred years as a guide. Deeper inside he finds Lei Ji, ancestor of the Giant Demon Clan, sealed in place, and draws his Ancient God-laced blood with vines. When he sees that Lei Ji wants the blood drawn so he can break free, he leaves, and a woman's voice greets him in the dark.","events":["Wang Lin studies Giant Demon blood that carries Ancient God power and decides to look into the Corpse Yin Sect","Zhou Yi shares the last jar of wine and thanks him for killing Li Yuanfeng and avenging the Snow Domain","Flashback: Yun Quezi is revealed as the clan's Second Ancestor and offers Zhu Quezi half of Planet Suzaku within three months","The First Ancestor and Yun Quezi explain that the Cultivation Planet Heart keeps Zhu Quezi alive; the clan conquers the other powers in three months","Zhou Yi says Yun Quezi picked him, Zi Xin and Wang Lin; Wang Lin refuses and receives Liu Mei's Domain Intent slip","Wang Lin takes Cao Yidou's primordial soul as a servant at the Corpse Yin Sect","He draws blood from the sealed Giant Demon ancestor Lei Ji, sees through his trick and walks away","A woman who senses he is untouched by women calls to him"],"introduced":["Cao Yidou","Lei Ji","Li Qingping","Mi Le Sect","Planet Tian Yun (named)","Di Po Sect","Tianyu Sect","Shui Mo, Mu Dan and Qin (level-five cultivation countries)","Cultivation Planet Heart","Sky Splitting Iron (offered)","Liming Straw Hat (named)"],"cultivation":"Yun Quezi: ten-leaf shaman. Third Ancestor: nine-leaf shaman. First Ancestor: eleven-leaf shaman. Li Qingping: late Nascent Soul. Cao Yidou's primordial soul: mid Soul Formation. Wang Lin is at Soul Transformation. Zhu Quezi is the only Ascendant left on Planet Suzaku outside the clan.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":98,"title":"Zhu Quezi's Game","summary":"In the depths of the Corpse Yin Sect, the woman is the Third Ancestor of the Forsaken Immortal Clan, Mei Ji, who calls herself the Sorceress and wants Wang Lin for herself. He holds her off with the Billion Soul Flag and then with a scroll of beast totems; she recognises clan ancestors sealed in the scroll, and he slips away. Situ Nan wakes in his new body at early Ascendant and promises to help Wang Lin pull his life soul out of the Cultivation Planet Crystal. When the three months are up, Yun Quezi, the young clan leader Adai and the Fifth Ancestor come to Zhu Quezi for his answer, and Yun Quezi offers a soul-binding spell to guarantee his life. Zhu Quezi strikes down the Fifth Ancestor with the Suzaku Seal, burning his own lifespan, and pours out his hatred of their late master Qian Pinghai, who favoured Yun Quezi, and whose body Zhu Quezi sold to the Corpse Yin Sect. Then he cracks the Cultivation Planet Heart and announces a game: everyone below Ascendant may enter the Suzaku Tomb to take back their life souls or repair the crystal, and in three months he will destroy the Heart and all the rest will die. Situ Nan tells Wang Lin the layout of the tomb, and at the crowded entrance Man Huang Nanming lets him go ahead, before someone who knows him from long ago speaks to him.","events":["Mei Ji, the Third Ancestor, tries to keep Wang Lin; he shows the Billion Soul Flag and a beast-totem scroll and escapes","Situ Nan wakes in his new body at early Ascendant","The clan welcomes an ancestral spirit and starts a curse across the Southern Suzaku Continent","Yun Quezi, Adai and the Fifth Ancestor demand Zhu Quezi's answer; Zhu Quezi strikes the Fifth Ancestor with the Suzaku Seal","Zhu Quezi reveals how he took the Cultivation Planet Heart from his master Qian Pinghai and sold his body","He cracks the Heart and opens the Suzaku Tomb for a three-month game of life and death","Zhu Quezi gives Qian Feng a bronze device of outer-world iron; Situ Nan explains the tomb's two areas and the Star Attractor","Man Huang Nanming makes way for Wang Lin at the tomb entrance; a stranger recognises him"],"introduced":["Mei Ji (as the Sorceress)","Star Symbol Illustration (beast-totem scroll)","Adai (as Young Leader of the clan)","Qian Pinghai","Suzaku Seal","Vermilion Mystery Formation","Suzaku Tomb (opened)","Star Attractor","Man Huang Nanming","Soul-binding spell"],"cultivation":"Situ Nan: early Ascendant in his new body. Mei Ji: nine-leaf curse shaman. Wang Lin is said to have shed his mortal roots and reached Soul Transformation, with immortal energy in his veins.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":99,"title":"Thousand Illusions","summary":"In the outer Suzaku Tomb, Wang Lin finds a scorched land where every grain is a mortal's soul fragment and the fire spirits reform after they are smashed. A youth named Murong Yun begs for help and offers to show the way in, so Wang Lin and the cultivator Mo Yunhai follow him to an altar, but Wang Lin works out that Murong Yun is himself a spirit made of soul fragments, out to stop them. Sealed, the spirit gives up the real altar in a valley of nine peaks with white mist. Cultivators there are killing the reforming spirits again and again in search of their own fragments, and Mo Yunhai drops dead when someone destroys his. At the outer altar Liu Mei, now at mid Soul Transformation, waits for Wang Lin and tries to devour his Dao of life and death as the last illusion of her Thousand Illusions Emotionless Dao. He has slipped Mei Ji's curse of desire into his intent, and when Liu Mei swallows it the curse tries to take over her body. She survives by absorbing it, but her last illusion becomes desire, and she swears revenge as Wang Lin heads across the abyss toward the Spirit Mountain while the tomb falls apart.","events":["Wang Lin finds that the scorched outer tomb is made of mortal soul fragments that form fire spirits","Murong Yun asks for help; Mo Yunhai joins them at a false altar","Wang Lin exposes Murong Yun as a soul-fragment spirit, seals it and learns where the real altar is","Cultivators kill regenerating spirits to find their fragments; Mo Yunhai dies when his is destroyed","Liu Mei tries to take Wang Lin's Dao to finish her Thousand Illusions","Mei Ji's curse of desire, hidden in his intent, tries to seize Liu Mei's body","Liu Mei absorbs the curse, her Dao is twisted, and she vows revenge","Wang Lin reaches the abyss before the Spirit Mountain as the tomb collapses faster"],"introduced":["Murong Yun","Mo Yunhai","Outer Suzaku Tomb","Soul fragments (soul-fragment spirits)","Thousand Illusions Emotionless Dao","Outer Altar","Mountain Abyss"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin: early Soul Transformation. Liu Mei: mid Soul Transformation, one illusion short of late. Mo Yunhai: early Soul Transformation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":100,"title":"Hongdie's Farewell","summary":"Wang Lin finds a fragment of Li Muwan's soul about to reform in the outer tomb and stops the cultivator hunting there from burning it with his Soul Flag. With the place collapsing, he smashes the spirit creatures one after another until he recovers the spark of Wan'er's soul. In the Golden Soul Valley he sets Xu Liguo on a spirit formed from a golden life soul, a sword-like being whose pressure recalls the swords of the Immortal Realm; when a curved blade appears that will not hurt Xu Liguo, he leaves Xu Liguo behind to tame it. Outside the Spirit Mountain he meets Hongdie, driven mad after Qian Feng used her as a cultivation furnace, and she begs him to kill her. Wang Lin gives her a last duel as his greatest rival of two centuries, and as she dies she leaves him Qian Feng's Intent and the Kunji Whip and asks him to kill Qian Feng. The Forsaken Immortal Clan breaks into the tomb with Ancestor Xu's skull and Yun Quezi goes in alone to repair the crystal, while a crowd waits at the Spirit Mountain gate with a stranger at late Soul Transformation whose aura is not of Planet Suzaku. As the tomb tears apart, Qian Feng lies in wait, and Wang Lin meets Zhou Yi at the gate.","events":["Wang Lin saves Wan'er's soul fragment from another cultivator and recovers its spark","In the Golden Soul Valley, Xu Liguo fights a spirit born of a golden life soul","Wang Lin leaves Xu Liguo behind with a curved blade that will not harm him","Hongdie, made a furnace and driven mad by Qian Feng, asks Wang Lin to kill her","They fight a final duel; she dies and leaves him Qian Feng's Intent and the Kunji Whip","The clan opens the tomb with Ancestor Xu's skull and Yun Quezi enters alone","Cultivators wait at the Spirit Mountain gate; a late Soul Transformation stranger hides his true form","Qian Feng waits to ambush Wang Lin as Zhou Yi and Wang Lin meet"],"introduced":["Golden Soul Valley","Golden Soul spirit","Curved blade","Spirit Mountain","Kunji Whip","Ancestor Xu's skull","Blue rose of the northern plains"],"cultivation":"Hongdie reached Soul Formation within a century and has cultivated for two. The stranger at the gate is at late Soul Transformation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":101,"title":"The Star Guide","summary":"Yun Quezi lends Wang Lin the Liming Straw Hat again and reminds him of their old promise about the wooden statues, but Wang Lin only wants his life soul. Liu Mei vows to kill him, and Wang Lin guesses that the stranger with Ancient God aura is after the Cultivation Planet Crystal. When the Spirit Mountain gate breaks, a golden-armoured giant guards Ye Wuyou's tomb with a sword strike at Ascendant level, and Wang Lin takes the first blow himself after Qian Feng proposes they join forces. Inside, before Ye Wuyou's statue, a wounded Yun Quezi tells him the truth: the shattered Ancient God beneath Planet Suzaku, Tuo Sen, answered Ancestor Xu's plea, raised him to twelve leaves and drove him mad, and the whole war was Tuo Sen's plan to get the crystal and escape the Sea of Blood. Wang Lin sees that the glowing object is a Star Guide, which costs a life to use, and refuses when Yun Quezi tries to make him the sacrifice. He turns Tuo Sen's trapped puppet loose instead; it lunges for the real crystal and is wiped out at once. Wang Lin is pulled into the Immortal Seal Pavilion inside the crystal, where a voice asks if he will become the next Suzaku.","events":["Yun Quezi lends Wang Lin the Liming Straw Hat; Liu Mei swears to kill him","The Spirit Mountain gate collapses and cultivators storm in","A golden-armoured giant's Ascendant-level sword guards Ye Wuyou's tomb; Wang Lin takes the first strike","Yun Quezi explains that Tuo Sen drove Ancestor Xu mad and caused the war to reach the crystal","Wang Lin sees that the object is a Star Guide that costs a life to use","He refuses to sacrifice himself and releases Tuo Sen's puppet, which goes for the crystal","The crystal destroys the Ascendant puppet instantly","Wang Lin is drawn into the Immortal Seal Pavilion inside the crystal"],"introduced":["Star Guide","Temple Guardian Formation","Golden-armoured giant","Ye Wuyou's statue","Sea of Blood","Immortal Seal Pavilion"],"cultivation":"Tuo Sen's puppet is at Ascendant level. Ancestor Xu reached twelve leaves with Tuo Sen's help. Wang Lin has only just reached Soul Transformation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":102,"title":"Refusing the Suzaku Legacy","summary":"Inside the crystal, an image of Ye Wuyou, the first Suzaku, tells Wang Lin that the crystal picks its own master when someone tries to destroy it, and that it has chosen him. Wang Lin turns down the title, saying his path will not stop at one planet, and Ye Wuyou tells him a life soul can be won by killing its spirit creature or by trading one life for another. Outside, the cultivators fight over the ownerless crystal, and Zhu Quezi appears through a bronze figure of outer-world iron that he gave Qian Feng, meaning to seize his own disciple's body and lifespan. Wang Lin goes after Qian Feng for himself and for Hongdie, and Qian Feng draws the Ancient God Blood Sword, an heirloom of the Qian family carrying Nine-Star Ancient God blood. Tuo Sen then descends in his true avatar, a monkey, strengthened by that drop of blood. Wang Lin kills Qian Feng and uses his life to win back the life souls, while Zi Xin takes Qian Feng's cultivation through a reversal technique Yun Quezi taught her. Tuo Sen corners Wang Lin, who blows up the souls in his Soul Flag and hides in the Heaven Defying Bead, until a Cultivation Alliance envoy seals Tuo Sen, pardons Zhu Quezi, and greets Wang Lin as an old acquaintance.","events":["Ye Wuyou's image offers Wang Lin the Suzaku title and he refuses","Ye Wuyou explains two ways to win a life soul, including trading a life","Cultivators scramble for the ownerless crystal","Zhu Quezi arrives through the bronze figure to seize Qian Feng's body","Qian Feng draws the Ancient God Blood Sword; Tuo Sen descends as a monkey avatar","Wang Lin kills Qian Feng and trades his life for the life souls; Zi Xin absorbs Qian Feng's cultivation","Wang Lin self-destructs the Soul Flag's souls and hides in the Heaven Defying Bead","A Cultivation Alliance envoy seals Tuo Sen and pardons Zhu Quezi"],"introduced":["Ye Wuyou (image)","Ancient God Blood Sword","Nine-Star Ancient God blood","Tuo Sen's monkey avatar","Cultivation Alliance envoy"],"cultivation":"Qian Feng is at Soul Transformation; Zi Xin gains his cultivation. Wang Lin reached Foundation Establishment when he first obtained the Ancient God memory inheritance.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":103,"title":"Leaving Planet Suzaku","summary":"The Alliance envoy is Mo Zhi, who knew Wang Lin as Zeng Niu and chose him for the crystal. When Zi Xin, now at mid Soul Transformation after taking Qian Feng's cultivation, threatens Wang Lin, he takes the title of Suzaku and passes it straight to Zhou Wutai, who becomes the fifteenth Suzaku, while Mo Zhi gives the Forsaken Immortal Clan a third of the planet for a nine-leaf skull every thousand years. Wang Lin now has both his and Wan'er's life souls, though his Soul Flag is badly damaged, and Xu Liguo has tamed the curved blade. Over a year the clan retreats northwest, Zi Xin and Liu Mei flee beyond the stars, and Wang Lin says goodbye at the Snow Domain and at the memorial tablets of his parents, Wang Tianshui and Zhou Yingsu. Situ Nan, living as a prince in the level-four Zhou country, travels with him past the Astral Wind and teaches him three killing techniques: the Annihilation Finger, the Demon Transformation Finger and the Yellow Springs Finger. Situ also explains the realms after Ascendant, and they reach the Trading Planet in the Kunxu star region, where in Mingmei City Wang Lin meets Bai Wei of the Heavenly Fate Sect, who invites him to his master's birthday. Wang Lin gives Situ a divine chariot, and they part, Situ for Planet Feng Luan and Wang Lin for Planet Tian Yun.","events":["Mo Zhi reveals himself and asks why Wang Lin refused the Suzaku title","Wang Lin accepts the title and passes it to Zhou Wutai, the fifteenth Suzaku","The Alliance grants the Forsaken Immortal Clan a third of Planet Suzaku; Yun Quezi accepts","Xu Liguo shows off the tamed curved blade","A year passes; Wang Lin visits the Snow Domain and his parents' memorial tablets","Situ Nan teaches him the Annihilation, Demon Transformation and Yellow Springs Fingers","Situ explains Illusory Yin, Corporeal Yang and the three Nirvana realms","At the Trading Planet Wang Lin meets Bai Wei, gives Situ a divine chariot, and they part"],"introduced":["Mo Zhi (named)","Cultivation Planet Heart (as succession token)","Annihilation Finger","Demon Transformation Finger","Yellow Springs Finger","Astral Wind","Trading Planet","Kunxu star region","Mingmei City","Shang's Shop","Kunmu Stone","Moxue Liquid","Bai Wei","Planet Feng Luan","Illusory Yin, Corporeal Yang, Nirvana Scryer, Nirvana Cleanser, Nirvana Shatterer (named)"],"cultivation":"Zi Xin: mid Soul Transformation. Wang Lin: early Soul Transformation at the start, peak of mid Soul Transformation by the time he leaves. Bai Wei: mid Soul Transformation. After Ascendant come Illusory Yin and Corporeal Yang, then Nirvana Scryer, Nirvana Cleanser and Nirvana Shatterer.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":104,"title":"Three Trials of the Heavenly Fate Sect","summary":"Wang Lin arrives on Planet Tian Yun in the Kunxu domain, hides his Ancient God body, and finds that the All-Seer, Tian Yunzi of the Heavenly Fate Sect, has been expecting him. Purple Branch disciples Zhao Xingsha and Zhou Wan scorn him as a native of a backwater planet, and Tian Yunzi's three entry trials are set. In the Human Trial he lives through his parents' deaths again and again, and instead of breaking the illusion he goes on asking about his Dao into an eighty-fourth cycle, far past Sun Yun's record. Suspecting sabotage, he gives up the Earth Trial at the tenth Immortal Guardian and the Heaven Trial of comprehension, yet the Master orders him admitted anyway. Jin Ye bars him from Ziyun Pavilion, the old home of the traitor Sun Yun, which marks its next resident as a future member of the Seven Heavenly Fated Disciples. When enforcement elders and then Zhao Xinmeng, Zhou Wan and others attack him, Wang Lin fights back with the Demon Transformation Finger and the God Slaying War Chariot, renames the place Zilin Pavilion, and accuses Zhao Xingsha of setting it all up. Tian Yunzi then appears and takes him as a true disciple of the Purple Branch, saying he will announce it at his birthday in three months.","events":["Wang Lin reaches Planet Tian Yun and is expected by Tian Yunzi","Zhao Xingsha and Zhou Wan look down on him; three trials are set","Human Trial: he relives his parents' deaths for 84 cycles while questioning his Dao","He gives up the Earth and Heaven trials but is admitted by the Master's order","Jin Ye blocks Ziyun Pavilion; enforcement elders order his dwelling torn down","Wang Lin learns that Ziyun Pavilion marks the next of the Seven Heavenly Fated Disciples and renames it Zilin Pavilion","Zhao Xinmeng, Zhou Wan and others attack; he uses the Demon Transformation Finger and God Slaying War Chariot","Tian Yunzi takes him as a true disciple of the Purple Branch"],"introduced":["All-Seer (Tian Yunzi)","Heavenly Fate Sect","Purple Branch","Zhao Xingsha","Zhou Wan","Jin Ye","Zhao Xinmeng","Sun Yun (mentioned)","Human, Earth and Heaven Trials","Immortal Guardians","Ziyun Pavilion / Zilin Pavilion","Seven Heavenly Fated Disciples","Immortal Demonic Body","Seven Star Shatter"],"cultivation":"Zhao Xingsha: mid Soul Transformation. Zhou Wan: mid Soul Transformation. Jin Ye: early Soul Transformation. Zhao Xinmeng: late Soul Transformation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":105,"title":"Imprisoned Before the Banquet","summary":"Zhao Xingsha, who has waited two thousand years for the Purple Branch's place among the Seven Heavenly Fated Disciples, counts his rivals and decides Wang Lin is the only real threat. Bai Wei visits Wang Lin at night and explains the title fight: Zhao Xingsha lost it to Chen Tao, both lost to Sun Yun, and Sun Yun later betrayed the sect, leaving the seat empty. The title brings a private domain, help at the Ascendant breakthrough, endless immortal jade and, after three thousand years, a low-grade Immortal Art, and Wang Lin decides it is worth fighting for. At Pinling Pavilion the Seventh Elder Master senses Zhou Yi's sword aura on Wang Lin's flying sword and trades him a jade slip of eighteen seals for it, and Wang Lin collects 123,600 pieces of immortal jade left unclaimed for 103 years. Zhao Xinmeng then moves him by force to the Stone Forest, where Sima Rufeng of the Blue Branch and Wang Yu of the Green Branch shut him in a formation on someone's behalf, while Zhao Xinmeng says this repays an old debt. Three months later, as guests arrive for Tian Yunzi's ten-thousandth birthday, Wang Lin breaks out at mid Soul Transformation with the three killing fingers, has Cao Yidou guide him to the hall, and confronts Zhao Xingsha in front of everyone.","events":["Zhao Xingsha sizes up his rivals in the Purple Branch","Bai Wei explains the Seven Heavenly Fated Disciples and what the title brings","Wang Lin recalls Situ Nan's three fingers came from a fragment of a low-grade Immortal Art","The Seventh Elder Master takes his Zhou Yi-touched sword in exchange for an eighteen-seal jade slip","Wang Lin collects 123,600 pieces of immortal jade","Zhao Xinmeng transfers him to the Stone Forest, where Sima Rufeng and Wang Yu trap him","Guests, including Chi Lie, arrive for Tian Yunzi's ten-thousandth birthday","Wang Lin breaks out at mid Soul Transformation and calls out Zhao Xingsha at the banquet"],"introduced":["Bai Wei (as Third Senior)","Chen Tao (named)","Seventh Elder Master","Pinling Pavilion","Immortal Jade","Eighteen-seal jade slip","Stone Forest","Sima Rufeng","Wang Yu","Chi Lie","Title Battle of the Seven Heavenly Fated Disciples","Sky Prison (mentioned)"],"cultivation":"Sima Rufeng: late Soul Transformation, near perfection. Wang Yu: late Soul Transformation, half a step from Ascendant. Chi Lie: Nirvana Scryer. Wang Lin: mid Soul Transformation after three months. Zhao Xingsha was late Soul Transformation two thousand years ago; Chen Tao has reached Ascendant.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":106,"title":"Tian Yunzi's Lecture","summary":"At the birthday banquet, Wang Lin kills Zhou Wan, who provokes him a second time, and then faces Zhao Xingsha. Zhao Xinmeng refuses to help, saying her debt is paid, and Zhao Xingsha unleashes a Demon Spirit that Tian Yunzi himself planted in his body, and Wang Lin answers with the God Slaying War Chariot. Chi Lie stops the fight, and on Tian Yunzi's word Zhao Xingsha is barred from the title contest. Zhao Xinmeng gives Wang Lin a jade with the Great Teleportation movement art and the forbidden Nine Revolution Immortal Refining Law, which turns his immortal energy into golden immortal energy. At the lecture on the Sacred Altar, Cultivation Alliance envoy Sun Zhongan brings a gift, and Tian Yunzi explains the three steps of cultivation, answering Wang Lin's question about the word 'Dao' and saying he once saw someone who had reached the third step. Three days later the Sword Saint Ling Tianhou bursts in, and Tian Yunzi uses him as the target for a mid-grade Immortal Summoning Art that carries his disciples away, an art Wang Lin's golden energy resists. Ling Tianhou demands they meet at the Demon Spirit Gate of the East Sea in three months, and Tian Yunzi opens the title contest for the Yellow and Purple branches.","events":["Wang Lin kills Zhou Wan at the banquet","Zhao Xingsha uses the Demon Spirit in his body; Wang Lin answers with the God Slaying War Chariot","Chi Lie stops the fight and Zhao Xingsha is barred from the contest","Zhao Xinmeng gives Wang Lin a movement art and the Nine Revolution Immortal Refining Law","Sun Zhongan of the Cultivation Alliance arrives with gifts for the lecture","Tian Yunzi lectures on the three steps and answers Wang Lin about cultivating the Dao","Ling Tianhou arrives and Tian Yunzi sends his disciples away with the Immortal Summoning Art","Ling Tianhou names the East Sea Demon Spirit Gate; the title contest opens"],"introduced":["Demon Spirit","Unbound Law of Heaven and Earth","Great Teleportation technique","Nine Revolution Immortal Refining Law","Golden immortal energy","Sacred Altar","Sun Zhongan","Kunpeng Zi","Star-marked Mink","Ling Tianhou (on screen)","Immortal Summoning Art","Immortal Realm Envoy","Demon Spirit Gate of the East Sea","Three steps of cultivation"],"cultivation":"The Purple Branch disciples at the lecture range from late Soul Transformation to half-step Ascendant. Tian Yunzi says the first step runs from Qi Condensation to Ascendant, the second passes Illusory Yin and Corporeal Yang to Nirvana Scryer, and the third is the true Dao. Wang Lin refines his energy to three revolutions.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":107,"title":"Losing to Chen Tao","summary":"Every Yellow Branch disciple steps aside, so Kunpeng Zi becomes one of the Seven Heavenly Fated Disciples, and Wang Lin starts to wonder why core disciples give the title up so easily. In the Purple Branch, Bai Wei withdraws and Zhao Xinmeng challenges Wang Lin, and when he tries to withdraw too, Tian Yunzi presses him to fight. Zhao Xinmeng uses her Demon Shadow Dao to copy his Demon Transformation Finger as a Purple Demon Hand, hoping to take its mutated demon energy, but Wang Lin answers with golden immortal energy at three and then five revolutions, and she concedes. Chen Tao then returns at mid Ascendant, presents Tian Yunzi with a Seven-Coloured Glazed Light flower from Heimo Star, and claims the title. In the fight Wang Lin opens a seal of the God Slaying War Chariot against Chen Tao's spirit beast and strikes with the Yellow Springs Finger and his life-and-death Intent, then concedes, glad to dodge a title whose secrets worry him. Tian Yunzi takes him to the Three Black and White Peaks, where Wang Lin sees with the help of his Ancient God memories that the two side peaks are illusions, and sends him to climb the last hundred steps, the Immortal Extinction Ground.","events":["Yellow Branch disciples all withdraw; Kunpeng Zi takes the title","Bai Wei withdraws; Tian Yunzi pushes Wang Lin to fight Zhao Xinmeng","Zhao Xinmeng copies his finger with Demon Shadow Dao; he wins with golden immortal energy","Chen Tao returns at mid Ascendant with a Seven-Coloured Glazed Light flower","Wang Lin fights Chen Tao with the God Slaying War Chariot and the Yellow Springs Finger","Wang Lin concedes on purpose; Chen Tao takes the Purple Branch title","Tian Yunzi brings him to the Three Black and White Peaks and he sees through the illusory peaks","Wang Lin must climb the Immortal Extinction Ground"],"introduced":["Yun Daozi","Demon Shadow Dao","Purple Demon Hand","Chen Tao (on screen)","Heimo Star","Seven-Coloured Glazed Light","Dao of Heavenly Fortune","Three Black and White Peaks","True Illusion Art","Immortal Extinction Ground"],"cultivation":"Chen Tao: mid Ascendant. Wang Lin uses golden immortal energy at three and five revolutions. Tian Yunzi says he has failed for thirty thousand years to reach the third step.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":108,"title":"The Celestial Slaughter Art","summary":"On the Immortal Extinction Ground, Wang Lin climbs twenty-two steps, then uses his life-and-death Intent to force five more, reaching twenty-seven, beyond Sun Yun's twenty-six. Under nine-coloured light Tian Yunzi accepts him as the seventh disciple of the Purple Branch and lets him choose from 3,600 forbidden arts in his Seven-Coloured Space. There Wang Lin finds a grey-robed man outside the star positions, whose killing intent dwarfs his own, and who offers him the Celestial Slaughter Art, an imitation of an immortal art, along with the Life Mark it produces for defence. Tian Yunzi says the grey-robed man is his own second divine soul, split off long ago, and gives Wang Lin a purple ring that can block two full attacks from a late Ascendant cultivator but loses one for each broken sect rule. Made an Envoy, Wang Lin is sent to the level-five country of Lingyue on Earthstar and told to be at the Demon Spirit Land off the East Sea in three months. He hunts demons in the Northern Demon Earth region to train the Life Mark and feed his Mosquito Beast. In Brilliant Golden Fruit Valley he stops a fight between Da Luo Sword Sect elders and the Suiyi Sect's Qian Qin over a hundred golden fruits, which his Ancient God memories say can strengthen his body.","events":["Wang Lin reaches twenty-seven steps on the Immortal Extinction Ground","Tian Yunzi formally takes him as the seventh Purple Branch disciple","In the Seven-Coloured Space, Wang Lin meets the grey-robed man and learns the Celestial Slaughter Art","Tian Yunzi reveals the grey robe is his second soul and gives Wang Lin a protective purple ring","Wang Lin becomes an Envoy and is sent to Lingyue on Earthstar","He hunts in the Northern Demon Earth region and feeds the Mosquito Beast","Da Luo Sword Sect elders and Qian Qin fight over the Brilliant Golden Fruits","Wang Lin takes the fruits and questions the Da Luo elders"],"introduced":["Seven-Coloured Space","3,600 forbidden arts","Grey-robed man (All-Seer's second soul)","Celestial Slaughter Art","Life Mark","Purple light ring","Envoy","Lingyue Country","Earthstar","Tian Tai","Northern Demon Earth region","Brilliant Golden Fruit Valley","Lu Songyi","Shi Fang","Qian Qin","Suiyi Sect","Da Luo Sword Sect","Jiuli insects","Shapeless Metal"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin: mid Soul Transformation. Lu Songyi and Shi Fang: early Soul Transformation. Qian Qin: mid Core Formation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":109,"title":"The East Sea Tide","summary":"Wang Lin makes the Da Luo Sword Sect elders tell him what became of Zhou Yi's sword: after ten days of fighting, Ling Tianhou shattered the Sword Soul, scattering half of it as sword shards and sealing the other half in the Tidal Abyss beyond the East Sea's Demon Spirit Gate. One elder's Heaven-Devouring Ghost is torn apart by the Annihilation Finger, and Wang Lin lets Qian Qin go after feeding the sect's metal jade to his Mosquito Beast. A month later his Life Mark has three layers and his Celestial Slaughter Art reaches minor completion, and he vows to rescue Zhou Yi in the Demon Spirit Land. Meanwhile Tan Lang of the Shadow Void Realm tells Ling Tianhou of an old Alliance bounty for a bead, saying they once surrounded the second Suzaku over it and he fought his way out, and Ling Tianhou has Tan Lang guard his Twelve Sword Disciples in the coming trial. On Earthstar, Sun Yunshan of the Xuan Yuan Sect and his sister Sun Ruonan join Wang Lin. At the East Sea of Planet Tian Yun, a tide that comes every five thousand years drags treasures in, watched by Yao Xixue, the Blood Ancestor's daughter, and the sects' chosen disciples, while Tian Yunzi and Ling Tianhou, who fell out after a past trip inside, eye a token in the tide. The gate opens, everyone rushes in, and the two elders agree to go after the token together in two hundred years.","events":["The Da Luo elders reveal that half the Sword Soul is sealed in the Tidal Abyss","Wang Lin kills an elder with the Annihilation Finger and feeds metal jade to the Mosquito Beast","His Life Mark reaches three layers in a month","Tan Lang tells Ling Tianhou of the Alliance bounty for the bead and the siege of the second Suzaku","Sun Yunshan and Sun Ruonan of the Xuan Yuan Sect meet Wang Lin","The five-thousand-year tide gathers treasures at the East Sea; Yao Xixue and the Twelve Sword Disciples arrive","Tian Yunzi and Ling Tianhou notice a token in the tide that Wang Lin's divine sense can reach","The Demon Spirit Gate opens and the disciples go in"],"introduced":["Sword Soul","Tidal Abyss","Heaven-Devouring Ghost","Tan Lang","Shadow Void Realm","Xuan Yuan Sect","Sun Yunshan","Sun Ruonan","Yao Xixue","Blood Ancestor (Yao Xinghai, named)","Twelve Sword Disciples","Demon Spirit Land","The token"],"cultivation":"Sun Yunshan: early Soul Transformation. Sun Ruonan: mid Soul Formation. Yao Xixue: late Soul Transformation. Wang Lin's Celestial Slaughter Art reaches minor completion with three layers of Life Mark. No one above Ascendant may enter the Demon Spirit Land.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":110,"title":"The Valley of Mortals","summary":"Inside the Demon Spirit Land, Wang Lin finds the immortal energy so thin it feels like the mortal world, so he catches a local youth, Shi San, to learn where he is. Shi San leads him to a valley hidden by an ancient formation, and when its chief Ouyang Hua attacks, Wang Lin works out the formation and breaks it, only to find a village of mortals. He gives them healing pills, and they ask him to stay through the Night of the Haunting, when the land's spirits come out each full moon, explaining that an Immortal named Huang Long once settled their ancestors and set up the formation. In return for more pills, Ouyang Hua gives him what he was after, a spirit crystal of this world's own spirit power. That night Luo Yun of the Heavenly Ghost Path attacks for the crystal, and Wang Lin kills him with the Annihilation Finger and his forbidden arts, feeding the ghost's flame to his Kunji Whip. From Luo Yun's memories he learns that the land has nine regions under demon emperors, each sealing a Primordial Mystic Spirit, and that outsiders work their way up as soldiers through battle merit. Instead of joining an army right away, Wang Lin decides to build his own strength by teaching the villagers the Soul Flag technique.","events":["Wang Lin catches Shi San to learn about the Demon Spirit Land","He breaks the ancient formation guarding Ouyang Hua's valley and finds only mortals","The villagers tell him about the Night of the Haunting and the Immortal Huang Long","Ouyang Hua trades him a spirit crystal for healing pills","Luo Yun of the Heavenly Ghost Path attacks; Wang Lin kills him and feeds his ghost flame to the Kunji Whip","Luo Yun's memories explain the nine regions, the demon emperors and the Primordial Mystic Spirits","Wang Lin decides to teach the villagers the Soul Flag technique and build his own power"],"introduced":["Shi San","Ouyang Hua","Night of the Haunting","Huang Long (the Immortal of the valley)","Spirit crystal","Luo Yun","Heavenly Ghost Path","Ghost Immortal (Luo Yun's master, mentioned)","Primordial Mystic Spirit","Nine regions and demon emperors","Divine Genesis (rumoured realm)","Celestial Demon Region","Primordial Mystic City"],"cultivation":"Luo Yun: peak of late stage on the Heavenly Ghost Path. Wang Lin: mid Soul Transformation. The villagers have no immortal power. Merging with a Primordial Mystic Spirit is said to give a small chance at a realm called Divine Genesis.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":111,"title":"The Soul Refining Tribe","summary":"Wang Lin teaches Ouyang Hua a soul-refining incantation and how to make Soul Flags out of hide and wood, planning to grow the tribe and use it to restore his own badly damaged Soul Flag. Shi San is the first after the chief to finish a Soul Flag, and he captures the soul of a Winged Feathered Demon Lion, though Wang Lin warns him that refining souls has no shortcuts. With outsiders moving in, Ouyang Hua leads the valley in a raid on a nearby cave tribe, and the captives drink a Demon-Forgetting Brew and join them. Three months later Shi San comes back crippled, his friends dead and his flag taken by the Tianshui tribe, the strongest outside Tianyao City, as a direct challenge. Wang Lin goes to the Tianshui tribe, where elder Zeng Wei boasts that their ancient formation has never fallen, and starts refining the whole formation along with the people inside it. Chief Xie Hao gives in, the Tianshui tribe joins Ouyang Hua's, and when the people ask Wang Lin to name them, he remembers Dun Tian's last request and calls them the Soul Refining Tribe.","events":["Wang Lin gives Ouyang Hua the soul-refining incantation and the Soul Flag method","Shi San finishes the first Soul Flag and seals a Winged Feathered Demon Lion's soul","The valley raids a cave tribe and absorbs it with a Demon-Forgetting Brew","Shi San returns crippled; the Tianshui tribe took his flag as a challenge","Wang Lin starts refining the Tianshui tribe's ancient formation and the people in it","Xie Hao gives in and the Tianshui tribe joins Wang Lin's","Wang Lin names the tribe Soul Refining, in honour of Dun Tian"],"introduced":["Soul Flags of hide and wood","Grade-three demon crystal","Winged Feathered Demon Lion","Rongdong (cave) tribe","Demon-Forgetting Brew","Tianshui tribe","Xie Hao","Zeng Wei","General Zu Yi (mentioned)","Tianyao City","Demon power armours","Soul Refining Tribe (named)"],"cultivation":"Xie Hao: Thousand-Armour demon power, about Nascent Soul. Zeng Wei: Ten-Thousand-Armour demon power, about Soul Formation. A grade-three demon crystal holds demon energy worth about Foundation Establishment.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":112,"title":"Commander of Ten Thousand","summary":"Two years on, Wang Lin learns how demon power scales, three armours matching Foundation Establishment and thirty thousand needed for Soul Transformation, and turns the Sovereign Soul Flag into the Soul Refining Tribe's mountain-protecting formation. Shi San, his meridians severed, has forced demon power into his flesh for two years, so Wang Lin gives him the Giant Demon Clan's body-strengthening technique and promises him the first Ancient God mantra if he succeeds. Wang Lin also takes the gifted boy Hu Pao, maker of thirteen Soul Flags, as a personal disciple, wary that he could become another Hongdie if left alone in the tribe. Four years after arriving, he stops the tribe's expansion and leaves with Shi San for the Ancient Demon City, where Yao Xixue, now a commander, brings him to the city's undefeated Demon General, Mo Lihai. Mo Lihai tests him with the Ten Collapse Fist Conception, a power built on a thousand years of belief in victory: eight collapses make a commander, all ten a marshal. Wang Lin holds back the Yellow Springs Finger and the God Slaying War Chariot, counters with the Killing Law, and finds a way through by entering the demonic with his body for the Demon Transformation Finger, driving Mo Lihai back at the seventh collapse. Feeling the demonic mind eating at his Dao heart, he concedes, and Mo Lihai makes him a Commander of ten thousand demon soldiers.","events":["Wang Lin studies demon power armours and turns the Sovereign Soul Flag into the tribe's guardian formation","He gives the crippled Shi San the Giant Demon body-strengthening technique","He takes the gifted Hu Pao as a personal disciple","He stops the tribe's expansion and leaves for the Ancient Demon City with Shi San","Wang Lin corrects Shi San's punch on a guard; Yao Xixue brings him to the Demon General","Mo Lihai tests him with the Ten Collapse Fist Conception","Wang Lin breaks through with the Demon Transformation Finger and pushes Mo Lihai back, then concedes","Mo Lihai makes him a Commander of ten thousand demon soldiers"],"introduced":["Demon power armours (scale)","Sovereign Soul Flag as mountain formation","Giant Demon body-strengthening technique","Ancient God mantra","Hu Pao","Ancient Demon City","Mo Lihai","Ten Collapse Fist Conception","Inner and outer posts (commander, marshal)","Killing Law"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin: mid Soul Transformation, with almost enough immortal stones to reach late Soul Transformation. Mo Lihai is not yet Ascendant despite a thousand years undefeated. Hu Pao has two-star demon power and has reached the fourth stage of soul refining. Yao Xixue held out to the fifth collapse.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":113,"title":"Commander of the Black Armor Army","summary":"In the Demon Spirit Land, Wang Lin's clone cannot drive out the last demonic thought left from his earlier fight, and while drinking at a wine shop in Ancient Demon City it drags him into visions of Zhang Hu, his parents and the Heng Yue Sect. Sima Yan, the Black Armor Army commander who has been demoted to deputy because of Wang Lin, picks a fight there; Wang Lin absorbs the demon power of Sima Yan's spear and uses it to break the demonic thought. Supervising staff officer Han Jin then escorts Wang Lin to the Black Armor camp to take command of its 10,000 demon soldiers, but Sima Yan's men refuse him his tent. Wang Lin waits until captain Sun Xiao insults him openly, then kills him and his followers under military law and has Shi San record everything, so Han Jin rules in his favour and the whole army salutes him. At the Third Army camp, Yao Xixue keeps failing at something her father ordered and decides she needs someone skilled in restrictions.","events":["Wang Lin's clone fails to expel his last demonic thought","At a wine shop the demonic thought shows him Zhang Hu, his parents and the Heng Yue Sect","Sima Yan attacks; Wang Lin absorbs the demon power of his spear and breaks the demonic thought","Han Jin escorts Wang Lin to the Black Armor camp; Sima Yan becomes his deputy","Sima Yan's faction blocks the commander's tent; Wang Lin waits","Captain Sun Xiao insults him; Wang Lin kills him and his men under military law","Shi San's record clears Wang Lin before Han Jin; the army salutes its new commander","Yao Xixue fails again, kept alive by Blood Soul Pills, and wants a restriction expert"],"introduced":["Sima Yan","Han Jin","Sun Xiao","Yuan Shan","Black Armor Army","Third Army","Tianyao military law","Blood Soul Pill","Green Bamboo Wine"],"cultivation":"Sima Yan: early Soul Transformation, 100,000 armor of demon power. Sun Xiao and Yuan Shan: Soul Formation captains.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":114,"title":"Qin Lin's Immortal Palace","summary":"Yao Xixue, the Blood Ancestor's daughter, asks Wang Lin to help her break the seals of an old immortal abode in the Demon Spirit Land, paying him Immortal Jades and a Blood Soul Pill that is supposed to save his life. Wang Lin suspects her, and turns the jades into Immortal Crystals stored in his body instead of breaking through. At Gu Mountain they walk the Beast Sovereign Path, where Wang Lin draws golden talismans out of twelve sealed stone statues and finds they spell the name Qin Lin. At the gate she makes him take the first of three Ascendant-level sword qi slashes, sure that her pill was a fake and he will die, but he survives on the crystals, hides with Zhou Wutai's aura-hiding hat, seals her meridians and imprisons her rather than kill her, since a real Blood Soul Pill would only revive her. The abode's remnant soul greets Wang Lin as its new master and gives him the token; inside the jade palace, held shut by the Eighteen Plum Blossom Restriction, he finds a jar with ten drops of immortal wine, and one drop leaves him drunk for a full year.","events":["Yao Xixue asks Wang Lin to help open an immortal abode and pays Immortal Jades in advance","She gives him a Blood Soul Pill as a life-saving guarantee","At Gu Mountain they reach Qin Lin's Immortal Palace and walk the Beast Sovereign Path","Wang Lin takes golden talismans from twelve sealed stone statues; they form the character 'Lin'","At the gate she uses him as a shield against three Ascendant sword slashes","He survives with Immortal Crystals, seals her meridians and imprisons her with his Life and Death concept","The abode's remnant soul accepts him as master and gives him the token","Inside, behind the Eighteen Plum Blossom Restriction, one drop of immortal wine knocks him out for a year"],"introduced":["Qin Lin's Immortal Palace","Gu Mountain","Beast Sovereign Path","Golden Talismans","Qin Lin (named)","Eighteen Plum Blossom Restriction","Immortal Crystals","Immortal wine","Blood Compass"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's clone is mid Soul Transformation and saving resources to reach late Soul Transformation. The three sword slashes at the palace gate carry Ascendant-level force.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":115,"title":"Storming the Demon General's Residence","summary":"Half a year after Wang Lin vanished, Hu Pao leaves the Black Armor camp, and Shi San is nearly killed by Sima Yan before the new commander He Kun stops him and sends him to Demon General Mo Lihai, who wants strong bodies. In the immortal palace Wang Lin's clone wakes after a year: the single drop of wine has lifted him to great perfection of Soul Transformation, and he loots Yao Xixue's storage bags of Immortal Jades, Blood Protection Talismans, Blood Soul Pills and a Blood Compass, and booby-traps the Blood Ancestor's new teleport array. Back at the camp he crushes He Kun, learns where Shi San is, and smashes his way through the gates of Ancient Demon City, defeating First Commander Li Qing with his Yellow Springs. Mo Lihai meets him with the Hundred Waves Demon Sea, which Wang Lin's golden talismans block on their own, and Wang Lin ends the fight by showing an illusory heavenly palm. Mo Lihai returns Shi San, calls Wang Lin brother and names him his first Vice General, asking his help at the Demon General Tournament in Sky Demon City in three months.","events":["Six months earlier: Hu Pao leaves; He Kun saves Shi San from Sima Yan and sends him to Mo Lihai","Wang Lin wakes after a year at great perfection Soul Transformation, nine drops of wine left","He loots Yao Xixue's bags and sets restrictions on the Blood Ancestor's teleport array","He retakes the Black Armor camp from He Kun","He breaks the gates of Ancient Demon City and defeats Li Qing","Golden talismans guard him against Mo Lihai's Hundred Waves Demon Sea","An illusory heavenly palm ends the duel; Mo Lihai returns Shi San","Mo Lihai makes Wang Lin his Vice General for the Demon General Tournament"],"introduced":["He Kun","Li Qing","Hundred Waves Demon Sea","Blood Protection Talismans","Blood Compass","Demon General Tournament (named)","Tianyao military law"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's clone reaches great perfection of Soul Transformation from one drop of immortal wine. He Kun: mid Soul Transformation, 100,000 armor. Li Qing: late Soul Transformation, 150,000 armor.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":116,"title":"To Sky Demon City","summary":"Mo Lihai explains that Sky Demon Country, one of the nine demon countries, holds a Demon General Tournament every 300 years, and this time two Vice Commander-in-Chief seats are open after a war with Fire Demon Country. Wang Lin returns to the Soul Refining Tribe for two months, teaches Ouyang Hua the second half of the Soul Refining Technique, Soul Extraction, gives Shi San the next stage of the Giant Demon body-refining art, and leaves the damaged Holy Soul Flag behind to guard the tribe. Hu Pao is alive at the Demon Tower on the Ancient Battlefield, serving the Scattered Devil through the man who rescued him, while the Scattered Devil watches Wang Lin's progress. Wang Lin travels with Mo Lihai to Sky Demon City, where they meet the rival generals Shi Xiao and, by reputation, Mo Fei; Shi Xiao's companion is Chen Tao, a wounded fellow disciple of All-Seer, who warns him about the Da Lou Sword Sect. Wanting a place to kill freely to train his Slaughter Immortal Art, Wang Lin is sent by Mo Lihai into Hong Prison for seven days, where Xu Huichuan receives him.","events":["Mo Lihai explains the Demon General Tournament and the two open Vice Commander-in-Chief seats","Wang Lin returns to the Soul Refining Tribe, teaching Soul Extraction to Ouyang Hua and body refining to Shi San","He leaves the Holy Soul Flag to protect the tribe and orders it to grow to a million members","Hu Pao serves the Scattered Devil at the Demon Tower on the Ancient Battlefield","Wang Lin questions the captive Yao Xixue about the Blood Soul Pill; she refuses","Wang Lin and Mo Lihai arrive in Sky Demon City and stay at the Mo residence","They meet Shi Xiao and Chen Tao, who warns about the Da Lou Sword Sect","Mo Lihai arranges for Wang Lin to enter Hong Prison to kill prisoners"],"introduced":["Sky Demon Country","Sky Demon City","Fire Demon Country (named)","Scattered Devil (San Mo)","Demon Tower","Ancient Battlefield","Shi Xiao","Mo Fei (named)","Chen Tao","Da Lou Sword Sect (named)","Hong Prison","Xu Huichuan","Soul Extraction","Six Finger Sword Technique (named)"],"cultivation":"Shi Xiao: great perfection Soul Transformation. Xu Huichuan: great perfection Soul Transformation. Chen Tao is an Ascendant who hid his cultivation to enter, now wounded below Ascendant. Wang Lin is at the peak of Soul Transformation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":117,"title":"The Emperor Sword","summary":"Inside Hong Prison, Wang Lin's clone kills the condemned prisoners for five days but gains only useless death qi, not killing intent. The prison head Xu Huichuan offers him a real path of slaughter if he will later kill a Demon General for him, and leads him to the Slaughter Blood Pool, where the Demon Emperor nurtures the Emperor Sword on the blood mist of prisoners forced to fight each other forever. Watching how the sword turns death into life, Wang Lin understands that the Slaughter Immortal Art is really a Dao of life and death in cycle, and he breaks out with killing intent and his Life Seal, even holding off the Emperor Sword's attack. The enraged sword flies through Sky Demon City, alarming Mo Fei and the Da Lou Sword Sect disciples Kang Ni and Wei Yang at the Sword Pavilion. Xu Huichuan hurries Wang Lin out and away, and in hiding Wang Lin finishes refining 3,792 strands of killing intent.","events":["Wang Lin kills Hong Prison's prisoners but gets only death qi","Xu Huichuan offers him the path of slaughter in exchange for killing a Demon General","He enters the Slaughter Blood Pool where the Emperor Sword is nurtured","He grasps that the Slaughter Immortal Art is a cycle of life and death","He breaks free with killing intent and blocks the Emperor Sword with his Life Seal","The angry Emperor Sword flies over the city; Mo Fei and the Da Lou Sword disciples notice","Wang Lin hides and finishes 3,792 strands of killing intent"],"introduced":["Slaughter Blood Pool","Emperor Sword","Sword Pavilion","Kang Ni","Wei Yang","Life Seal","Slaughter Heart"],"cultivation":"Kang Ni and Wei Yang: late Soul Transformation. Mo Fei: great perfection Soul Transformation.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":118,"title":"Sound of the Zither","summary":"Demon Emperor Gu Yunchi scolds the Emperor Sword Spirit, a spoiled girl, for nearly wrecking Sky Demon City over Wang Lin, then takes her out into the city. Alone, Wang Lin listens to a sad zither tune and thinks of Li Muwan, deciding that defying heaven means keeping feeling in one's heart. Mo Lihai takes him to Vice Commander-in-Chief Xuan, who has just received Mo Fei; Xuan tests Wang Lin and says that with him Mo Lihai's chance rises from forty to ninety percent. That night two of Mo Fei's men try to assassinate Wang Lin with the Ink Dot Spear and the Chaos Heaven Seal, and his killing intent destroys them. Mo Fei gets the Emperor's leave for a private duel with Mo Lihai, and his messenger Wei Yang of the Da Lou Sword Sect attacks Wang Lin as All-Seer's disciple; Wang Lin breaks his sword qi and his goat soul, survives the life-staked sword qi of Ling Tianhou, and takes that sword qi from him. Mo Lihai loses the duel to Mo Fei, which bars him from fighting in the tournament, so everything now rests on Wang Lin.","events":["Gu Yunchi scolds the Emperor Sword Spirit and takes her into the city","Wang Lin hears a zither and thinks of Li Muwan","Vice Commander-in-Chief Xuan receives Mo Fei, then tests Wang Lin","Mo Lihai warns that Mo Fei kills Demon Generals' assistants","Two of Mo Fei's men attack Wang Lin and are killed","The Emperor approves a private duel between Mo Fei and Mo Lihai","Wei Yang delivers the challenge, fights Wang Lin and loses Ling Tianhou's sword qi to him","Mo Lihai loses to Mo Fei and cannot fight in the tournament"],"introduced":["Gu Yunchi","Vice Commander-in-Chief Xuan","Xuan Residence","Mo Residence","Dragon Pool (named)","Ink Dot Spear","Chaos Heaven Seal","Revolving Wheel Art","Ling Tianhou (named)","Sheep Soul Slash"],"cultivation":"Gu Yunchi: Illusory Yin. Vice Commander-in-Chief Xuan: early Ascendant. Mo Fei's Revolving Wheel Art is at the 18th layer.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":119,"title":"Reverse Cultivation","summary":"The Demon General Tournament opens on the Grand Plaza of Sky Demon City under the steward Jin Wuxu and the sixteen Commanders-in-Chief: each Demon General fights, then his assistant, and Demon Generals may not be killed but assistants can be. Shi Xiao easily beats Mu Yun and kills Mu Yun's assistant Master Tiankui of the Giant Spirit Sect, then calls Wang Lin a toy. Vice Commander-in-Chief Xuan bets Vice Commander-in-Chief Huang his Heavenly Omen Banners that Wang Lin will win the whole tournament. Demon General Ao Di challenges Wang Lin and fires his life-bound serpent's Blood God Arrow; Wang Lin blocks it and cripples him without killing him, and with four wins Mo Lihai goes through to the second round. In the city Wang Lin's sword spirit Xu Liguo chases the Emperor Sword Spirit until Wang Lin reins him in, and some assistants who are quitting the tournament tell Wang Lin to go with the flow. Thinking it over alone, he decides that every step from Qi Condensation to the peak of Soul Transformation came from defiance, and that reverse cultivation against heaven is his road to Ascendant.","events":["Jin Wuxu opens the tournament and explains the rules","Shi Xiao beats Mu Yun and kills his assistant Master Tiankui","Vice Commander-in-Chief Xuan bets Vice Commander-in-Chief Huang that Wang Lin will win","Wang Lin blocks Ao Di's Blood God Arrow and cripples him","Mo Lihai advances with four wins","Xu Liguo flirts with the Emperor Sword Spirit and is restrained by Wang Lin","Assistants say goodbye and urge Wang Lin to go with the flow","Wang Lin chooses defiance as his path to Ascendant"],"introduced":["Grand Plaza","Jin Wuxu","Vice Commander-in-Chief Huang","Mu Yun","Master Tiankui","Giant Spirit Sect","Ao Di","Blood God Arrow","Heavenly Omen Banners","Xuanhuang Pill","Xiao Hei"],"cultivation":"Jin Wuxu: mid Ascendant, 400,000 armor. Vice Commander-in-Chief Huang: early Ascendant. Mu Yun, Master Tiankui and Ao Di: late Soul Transformation. Wang Lin: peak Soul Transformation.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":120,"title":"The Demonic Battle Drum","summary":"For the second round the Heaven Commander-in-Chief brings out the Demonic Battle Drum, made from an Ancient Demon's hide and normally sounded only when a Commander-in-Chief is installed, and generals are ranked by how many strikes they and their assistants land. Most generals manage three to six strikes; Mo Fei lands eight and his assistant three, eleven in all. Jin Wuxu bets Wang Lin that he cannot make five strikes, and Wang Lin stakes Jin Wuxu's hand; after five Jin Wuxu refuses to pay and dares him to reach fifteen. Wang Lin realises the drum is a chance rather than a test, stops resisting its rebound and lets the drum's sound temper him, and its sorrow brings up memories of his parents, Zhang Hu and Li Muwan in him and in the watching crowd. At the fifteenth strike he is meant to cut all emotional ties to become Ascendant, but he refuses to give up his feelings and chooses to defy the Heavenly Dao, and a second heavenly punishment begins to fall.","events":["The Heaven and Earth Commanders-in-Chief attend; the Heaven Commander-in-Chief reveals the Demonic Battle Drum","Generals strike the drum; Yu Sen, Ming Luo, Jin Yuan and others reach three to six","Mo Fei and his assistant reach eleven strikes","Jin Wuxu bets Wang Lin he cannot reach five, then demands fifteen","Wang Lin lets the drum's sound temper him","The drum brings up memories of his parents, Zhang Hu and Li Muwan","He refuses to cut his emotions at the fifteenth strike and calls down a second heavenly punishment"],"introduced":["Heaven Commander-in-Chief","Earth Commander-in-Chief","Demonic Battle Drum","Yu Sen","Ming Luo","Jin Yuan"],"cultivation":"Heaven Commander-in-Chief: peak Ascendant. Earth Commander-in-Chief: late Ascendant. Fifteen drum strikes with full understanding of the Dao would let Wang Lin become Ascendant.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":121,"title":"Stepping on the Sky","summary":"Jin Wuxu tries to kill Wang Lin and is stopped, and the fifteenth drum strike brings a Heavenly Tribulation down on the Demon Spirit Land, felt as far as the Blood Ancestor at the East Sea entrance. Wang Lin turns his immortal power into demonic energy and survives the tribulation lightning by reverse cultivation, but a second punishment, Heaven's Wrath, locks onto his soul and the city is evacuated as the two Ancestors of Sky Demon Country come out of seclusion. A remnant soul of an Ancient Demon, trapped in the Demonic Battle Drum, saves him: it explains that the Gu clan, born with the Heavenly Dao, split into the Ancient Gods, Ancient Devils and Ancient Demons, and in return asks Wang Lin to gather its remnant souls from the treasures of the other eight countries. Gu Yunchi, grandson of the Second Ancestor, is told to bring Wang Lin to the Dragon Pool in three months. Wang Lin goes into seclusion in the immortal palace, where the Ancient Demon's Ascendant Crystal and the Ascendant method 'Understanding the Dao at Dawn' guide him, and after ten years his clone reaches Ascendant.","events":["Jin Wuxu tries to kill Wang Lin and is stopped","The fifteenth strike calls a Heavenly Tribulation; the Blood Ancestor senses it","Wang Lin survives the lightning by reverse cultivation","Heaven's Wrath falls; the city is evacuated and the First and Second Ancestors appear","The Ancient Demon soul in the drum explains the Gu clan and shields Wang Lin","It asks him to collect its remnant souls from the other eight countries","The Second Ancestor orders Gu Yunchi to bring Wang Lin to the Dragon Pool","After ten years of seclusion Wang Lin's clone reaches Ascendant"],"introduced":["Heavenly Tribulation","Heaven's Wrath","Reverse cultivation","Gu clan","Ancient Demon","Ancient God","Ancient Devil","Blood Ancestor","East Sea entrance to the Demon Spirit Land","First Ancestor of Sky Demon Country","Second Ancestor of Sky Demon Country","Ascendant Crystal","Primordial Qi","Understanding the Dao at Dawn"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's clone reaches Ascendant by reverse cultivation after seven hundred years on the Dao. Blood Ancestor: Nirvana Cleanser.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":122,"title":"The Scattered Devil","summary":"As Wang Lin's clone steadies his new Ascendant cultivation, a giant arm reaches into the immortal palace to swallow his Primordial Qi: it is the Scattered Devil, badly hurt and feeding on every new Ascendant in the land. Wang Lin keeps his mind clear with killing intent and flees, but his teleport is disrupted and he lands in Fire Demon Country, where he eats a Mad Demon Fruit and summons Xu Liguo. When the Scattered Devil catches him, Wang Lin fights it with pure killing intent and a Life and Death concept until it backs off, then drinks four drops of immortal wine and goes on a rampage. Maddened, he wipes out a Fire Demon division and its Da Lou Sword Sect leader Zi Shu, then breaks General Liu Qi's Sinful Fire Demon Abyss formation of a hundred thousand soldiers at Tianyi City. In that fight his Dao takes form as the Yellow Springs, and he declares he will cultivate only his own Dao, while the Scattered Devil sends its servant Ming Yuan to receive him.","events":["The Scattered Devil reaches into the immortal palace for Wang Lin's Primordial Qi","Wang Lin escapes; the teleport throws him into Fire Demon Country","He eats a Mad Demon Fruit and summons Xu Liguo","He fights the Scattered Devil with killing intent and it withdraws","He drinks four drops of immortal wine and kills Zi Shu and his division","He breaks Liu Qi's Sinful Fire Demon Abyss formation at Tianyi City","His Dao forms as the Yellow Springs; Ming Yuan is ordered to act"],"introduced":["Mad Demon Fruit","Zi Shu","Fire Demon Emperor","Liu Qi","Tianyi City","Sinful Fire Demon Abyss Formation","Yellow Springs Finger","Ming Yuan (named)"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's clone is early Ascendant and opens a branch of the Yellow Springs, touching the edge of the second step of the Dao. Zi Shu: great perfection Soul Transformation. Liu Qi: early Ascendant. Ming Yuan: late Ascendant.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":123,"title":"Slay the Demon","summary":"On the Ancient Battlefield of Sky Demon Country, the Scattered Devil sends its Demon Servants Feng Yin, De Gui and Hu Pao to kill Wang Lin, but his Annihilation Finger and an Immortal Realm hand seal turn back the first attackers. Hu Pao, Wang Lin's former disciple, now hates him for not saving him from prison, and plans to kill everyone who knows the Soul Refining Technique so that only he holds it. Using the Time Spell from his benefactor, Hu Pao jumps from late Soul Transformation to early Ascendant with his Hundred Million Soul Flag, but Wang Lin, as the true heir of the technique, calls the souls back, and the spell drains Hu Pao's life until he falls back to mid Soul Transformation. Ming Yuan, a late Ascendant, then fights Wang Lin with demonic energy, while Wang Lin uses the Yellow Springs, the Soul Gathering Spring and the Slaughter Immortal Art and finally Ling Tianhou's sword qi to strike the Demon Tower itself. The Scattered Devil comes out in a flesh body far above Ascendant, and Wang Lin's clone blows itself up to destroy the Demon Tower and a million years of the devil's savings.","events":["Feng Yin, De Gui and Hu Pao are sent to kill Wang Lin","Wang Lin repels the first servants with Annihilation Finger and an Immortal Realm hand seal","Xu Liguo appears; Hu Pao confronts Wang Lin and declares his hatred","Hu Pao reaches early Ascendant with the Time Spell and his Hundred Million Soul Flag","Wang Lin takes back the souls; the spell drains Hu Pao to mid Soul Transformation","Ming Yuan fights Wang Lin; Wang Lin aims Ling Tianhou's sword qi at the Demon Tower","The Scattered Devil appears and Wang Lin's clone self-destructs, wrecking the tower"],"introduced":["Feng Yin","De Gui","Demon Servants","Hundred Million Soul Flag","Time Spell","Immortal Realm hand seal","Soul Gathering Spring","Ascendant Self-Destruction"],"cultivation":"Hu Pao: late Soul Transformation, forced to early Ascendant by the Time Spell, then falls back to late and mid Soul Transformation. Ming Yuan: late Ascendant. The Scattered Devil's flesh body is above Ascendant.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":124,"title":"Ancient Demon","summary":"An hour earlier, knowing the Mad Demon Fruit would wear off, Wang Lin forced the captive Yao Xixue to reveal how the Blood Soul Pill works, so his clone survives the self-destruction that wrecks the Demon Tower. The Scattered Devil, in a body that looks like Ling Tianhou's, hunts him on the plains outside Sky Demon City, and Wang Lin calls on the Ancient Demon, who arrives and fights the devil, revealing it is only one of nine Scattered Devils serving another Ancient. Watching their fight, which resembles the Ancient God arts, gives Wang Lin's true body insight into Ancient God techniques, and Wang Lin finally lures the Scattered Devil into his own divine soul with Xu Liguo and the Holy Soul Flag so that the Ancient Demon, Bei Lou, has to help seal it. Back on Planet Vermilion, people of the Cloud Sky Sect in the Chu Country remember Wang Lin as a legend and light candles for him. In his sea of consciousness Wang Lin stabilises Ascendant and suppresses the devil to devour later as a second soul, and at the Dragon Pool Bei Lou names him Heavenly Demon Envoy, above the Demon Emperor, promising to find his friend in the coming war with Fire Demon Country.","events":["Flashback: Wang Lin forces the Blood Soul Pill's method from Yao Xixue","His clone survives the self-destruction","The Scattered Devil, in a Ling Tianhou-like body, attacks; Bei Lou intervenes","The fight teaches Wang Lin's true body something of the Ancient God arts","Wang Lin baits the Scattered Devil into his divine soul and Bei Lou seals it","On Planet Vermilion the Cloud Sky Sect remembers Wang Lin","Wang Lin stabilises Ascendant and keeps the devil to devour later","Bei Lou makes him Heavenly Demon Envoy and sends him toward the Fire Demon war"],"introduced":["Bei Lou (named)","Nine Scattered Devils","Demon seed","Devil-Transforming Finger","Heavenly Demon Envoy","Cloud Sky Sect (Chu Country)"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's clone stabilises Ascendant after months of seclusion.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":125,"title":"Reality and Illusion","summary":"Looking for weapons against Fire Demon Country, Wang Lin searches the deep wilderness for Ling Tianhou's sword qi lost with Zi Shu, but Teng Yun of the Heyun Sect claims the body and the sword qi turns out to be his own sect's. Demon Emperor Gu Yunchi, whom Wang Lin had once drunk with on a pleasure boat, gives him a jade slip with his authority, and on the Songtao City battlefield Wang Lin captures Mo Fei, whose men had tried to kill him. Using soul search on Mo Fei, he learns that all twelve Da Lou swords were summoned to Fire Demon Country by Tan Lang, an Illusory Yin cultivator who helped kill Situ Nan. Yao Xixue then reveals that the Demon Spirit Land is the abode of Celestial Emperor Qin Lin, made of four illusory abodes and one real one, and that in ten years the Blood Ancestor, All-Seer and Ling Tianhou will come for it. Wang Lin moves the Soul Refining Tribe to the border, opens the second seal on his thunder beast, and ten years later Jin Shaofei of the Cultivation Alliance comes with Sun Yunshan and Immortal Guard Xiang Dingxiu to take him; Wang Lin defeats the guard, and Sun Yunshan begs him to save the Xuanyuan Sect from the alliance's Immortal Ancestor, who controls cultivators with immortal seeds.","events":["Wang Lin gives Teng Yun the body of his junior Zhou Qu and the sword qi","Gu Yunchi hands Wang Lin a jade slip with imperial authority","Wang Lin captures Mo Fei at the Songtao City battlefield","Soul search on Mo Fei reveals Tan Lang summoned the Twelve Swords","Yao Xixue explains Qin Lin's four illusory abodes and one real one","Wang Lin moves the Soul Refining Tribe and opens his beast's second seal","Ten years later Jin Shaofei and Xiang Dingxiu come to take him and lose","Sun Yunshan tells him about the Immortal Ancestor's immortal seeds"],"introduced":["Teng Yun","Heyun Sect","Zixiao Sword Technique","Songtao City","Twelve Swords of Da Lou","Tan Lang (named)","Four illusory abodes","Jin Shaofei","Xiang Dingxiu","Immortal Guards","Cultivation Alliance (Demon Spirit Land)","Immortal seeds","Xuanyuan Sect"],"cultivation":"Teng Yun: mid Soul Transformation. Jin Shaofei: early Soul Transformation. Xiang Dingxiu: early Ascendant. Tan Lang is said to be at Illusory Yin.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":126,"title":"Fairy Tale","summary":"At the Cultivation Alliance, Huang Yu poses as a true immortal from the Upper Realm, the Immortal Ancestor, and Tianyun Sect disciple Qu Yichang greets Wang Lin as his junior brother and urges him to submit. Wang Lin kills two Immortal Guards and sees through Huang Yu, who only reached mid Ascendant with outside help; he feeds Huang Yu's immortal-beast feed to his Qilin, dodges the Immortal-Pointing Brush and the Immortal-Binding Net, and frees Sun Ruonan. Captured, Huang Yu admits he is a Lianyu Sect cultivator who found two storage bags of Immortal Realm treasures in a cave abode, one of which a couple stole. A jade slip in the bags, written by Celestial Emperor Qin Lin to his daughter Qing Shuang, Immortal Lord of the Rain Immortal Realm, describes the brush, the net, a scabbard for the Rain Immortal Sword and the low-grade immortal art Immobilization Technique, and Wang Lin wonders if Qing Shuang is the woman Zhou Yi loved. Seventy years later, as Thunder Demon and Water Demon forces strike at Sky Demon Country, Wang Lin freezes their Commanders-in-Chief for three breaths with the Immobilization Technique, then leaves for Fire Demon City and gathers a million strands of killing aura to break its ten-thousand-year demon barrier.","events":["Huang Yu poses as the Immortal Ancestor of the Cultivation Alliance","Qu Yichang meets Wang Lin and urges him to submit","Wang Lin kills two Immortal Guards and exposes Huang Yu","His Qilin eats the immortal-beast feed; Wang Lin beats the brush and the net","Sun Ruonan is freed and reunited with Sun Yunshan","Huang Yu confesses; Qin Lin's jade slip to Qing Shuang lists the treasures","Seventy years later Wang Lin stops the Thunder and Water Demon Commanders-in-Chief with the Immobilization Technique","He breaks the demon barrier of Fire Demon City with a million strands of killing aura"],"introduced":["Huang Yu","Qu Yichang","Immortal-Pointing Brush (Celestial Brush)","Immortal-Binding Net","Immortal-beast feed","Qing Shuang (named)","Rain Immortal Realm","Rain Immortal Sword","Spirit-Offering Scabbard","Immobilization Technique","Lianyu Sect","Thunder Demon Commander-in-Chief","Water Demon Commander-in-Chief","Fire Demon City"],"cultivation":"Huang Yu: mid Ascendant (reached with outside help). Immortal Guards: early Ascendant. Qu Yichang: late Soul Transformation. Thunder and Water Demon Commanders-in-Chief: early Ascendant. Even a lower-grade true Immortal Guard equals a great perfection Ascendant.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":127,"title":"Devouring the Demon","summary":"With the demon barrier broken, Sky Demon Country's armies storm Fire Demon City, and the Fire Demon, an Ancient Demon fragment who has not moved in millions of years, comes out in a rage after smelling Bei Lou's scent on Wang Lin. Wang Lin holds him off with the Devil-Transforming Finger and a million strands of slaughter aura, then gets within a hundred zhang so Bei Lou can use Wang Lin's blood to form a demonic body and leave Sky Demon Country to fight. Bei Lou pins down the Fire Demon's main body while Wang Lin enters the Fire Demon Tower, uses the Immobilization Technique and the God Slaying Chariot against the great-perfection Ascendant Fire Demon clone, and destroys the Fire Demon statue that feeds their power, letting Bei Lou devour the Fire Demon. In return Bei Lou opens the Ancient Demon inheritance to him, which only two others have received, among them Sun Yun; when Wang Lin deduces the Slaughter Immortal Art to completion he sees it would kill him and turn him into a strand of slaughter aura, and he begins to suspect All-Seer. Bei Lou then locates Zhou Yi's divine sense in the Tidal Abyss in Water Demon Country, gives Wang Lin a viewing jade slip, and privately resists the urge to devour Wang Lin's Ancient God aura.","events":["The Fire Demon appears and attacks Wang Lin","Wang Lin fights him with the Devil-Transforming Finger and slaughter aura","Bei Lou forms a demonic body from Wang Lin's blood and engages the Fire Demon","Wang Lin freezes the Fire Demon clone and destroys the Fire Demon statue","Bei Lou devours the Fire Demon fragment","Wang Lin's true body masters an art with Situ Nan in the Seven-Coloured Space","The Ancient Demon inheritance shows the Slaughter Immortal Art would kill him","Bei Lou points him to Zhou Yi in the Tidal Abyss"],"introduced":["Fire Demon","Fire Demon Tower","Fire Demon statue","Fire Demon clone","Ancient Demon inheritance","Sun Yun (named)","Tidal Abyss","Water Demon Country","Ta Jia (named)"],"cultivation":"Fire Demon clone: great perfection Ascendant.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":128,"title":"Burning Soul","summary":"Deep in the Tidal Abyss, Da Lou Sword Sect disciples led by Chen Long have been trapped by beasts for a hundred years under Tan Lang, a cultivator fallen from Illusory Yin who waits for Ling Tianhou to come for them. At the Water Demon Country entrance Wang Lin meets Du Jian of the Tianyun Sect's Red Division, Murong Zhuo of the Ink Sect, and Zhao Yixuan and Xu Fei of the Floating Cloud Sect, and joins them. Du Jian leads them to a supposed Tianyun Sword lost by Sun Yun of the Purple Division, but it is a trap set on a poison-insect tree, which Wang Lin sees through; he parts from the group after warning Murong Zhuo that the two women are Corpse Yin Sect, one a puppet. Guided by Bei Lou's jade slip, Wang Lin finds Zhou Yi's sword spirit sealed deep under a rock wall by Ling Tianhou's divine sense, at least late Nirvana Cleanser in strength. Against Xu Liguo's pleas he burns his own divine soul, using his immortal art and Origin Soul with the Immobilization Technique, the Yellow Springs and the golden talismans to trap Ling Tianhou's divine sense and break the seal on Zhou Yi.","events":["Chen Long's Da Lou disciples beg Tan Lang to lead them out of the abyss","Wang Lin enters the Tidal Abyss with Du Jian, Murong Zhuo, Zhao Yixuan and Xu Fei","Du Jian's Tianyun Sword turns out to be a poison-insect trap","Wang Lin exposes the trap and leaves the group","He warns Murong Zhuo that the two women are Corpse Yin Sect","He finds Zhou Yi sealed by Ling Tianhou's divine sense","He burns his divine soul to trap Ling Tianhou's divine sense and reach Zhou Yi"],"introduced":["Si She","Xu Gou","You Ji","Chen Long","Wu Ma","Shen Hou (named, dead)","Du Jian","Murong Zhuo","Zhao Yixuan","Xu Fei (Corpse Yin Sect)","Ink Sect","Floating Cloud Sect","Red Division","Purple Division","Tianyun Sword","Seven Sons of Heavenly Fortune"],"cultivation":"Tan Lang: fell from Illusory Yin, now great perfection Ascendant. Chen Long and Murong Zhuo: early Ascendant. Si She, Xu Gou and Zhao Yixuan: late Soul Transformation. You Ji and Xu Fei: mid Soul Transformation. Du Jian and Wu Ma: great perfection Soul Transformation. Ling Tianhou is judged to be at least late Nirvana Cleanser.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":129,"title":"Rising Abyss","summary":"Inside Ling Tianhou's sword formation deep in the Tidal Abyss, Wang Lin finds Zhou Yi, the spirit of the Rain sword, dying of his own will because Ting'er is gone. Wang Lin tells him her true name is Qing Shuang, daughter of the Immortal Emperor Qing Lin, who may still be recovering somewhere in the Demon Spirit Land, and the hope wakes Zhou Yi. Zhou Yi breaks free, gives Wang Lin an immortal sword that answers only to him, plants ancient sword intent and a loyalty seal in Wang Lin's unruly sword spirit, and asks only for help finding Ting'er's father. They dive to the bottom of the abyss through a violet fog that eats consciousness, looking for the previous Rain sword spirit, and find the old Fortune sword whose copy Wang Lin once saw at the Heng Yue Sect, while the figure in Wang Lin's scroll keeps urging him further down. In the Fire Demon Prefecture the Nirvana Shatterer couple Wang Wei and Hu Juan leave seclusion and guess that Tan Lang is after the Tidal Token. Wang Lin finds Tan Lang and the Da Lou Sword Sect disciples trapped by beasts at the exit, works out that the violet fog is tied to the token that opens Qing Lin's hidden cave, and walks in alone while Zhou Yi hides.","events":["Wang Lin wakes Zhou Yi, the Rain sword spirit, inside Ling Tianhou's sword formation","Wang Lin reveals Ting'er's real name, Qing Shuang, daughter of Immortal Emperor Qing Lin, who may be hiding in the Demon Spirit Land","Zhou Yi breaks out, gives Wang Lin an immortal sword bound to him alone and seals loyalty into Wang Lin's sword spirit","They dive through the violet fog to the abyss floor and find the previous-generation Fortune sword","Wang Wei and Hu Juan, a Nirvana Shatterer couple, leave seclusion and talk about Tan Lang and the Tidal Token","Wang Lin spots Tan Lang and the Da Lou Sword Sect disciples trapped at the exit by mosquito beasts","Wang Lin links the violet fog to the token that opens Qing Lin's cave and goes in alone"],"introduced":["Qing Shuang (Ting'er's true name)","Qing Lin, Immortal Emperor","Wang Wei","Hu Juan","Tidal Token","Fortune sword (previous generation)","Fire Demon Prefecture","Cloud Immortal Sanctum"],"cultivation":"Wang Wei and Hu Juan, the Celestial Cloud cultivation couple: Nirvana Shatterer. Tan Lang claims his injuries may make his cultivation fall.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":130,"title":"No Way Out","summary":"Wang Lin confronts the Da Lou Sword Sect disciples at the abyss exit, takes a zodiac sword from one who attacks him, and their leader Chen Long hands it over as an apology. Chen Long introduces Tan Lang, a senior of their masters' generation, who supposedly can only use late Ascendant strength because the mosquito beasts wounded him, but Wang Lin sees that Tan Lang is faking and that he lured the beasts here himself. When the violet fog merges, Tan Lang sacrifices the sword disciples' flesh, blood and souls to bring down the Tidal Token. Zhou Yi offers to carry Wang Lin out, but Wang Lin holds on for ten more breaths and seizes swords and loot, then he and Chen Long gang up on Tan Lang. Tan Lang answers with Devour Death, a Mountain Soul torn from the Immortal Realm, the Celestial Scent, the Ancient God Tu Si cauldron, Axis Inversion and his Atlas Seal, and Wang Lin grabs the token anyway. Tan Lang then releases his second soul, and when Wang Lin breaks its controlling mark it turns out to be a free Ancient Thunder Dragon, which Wang Lin faces with the Net-Severing Sword Art.","events":["Wang Lin takes a sword from a rash Da Lou disciple; Chen Long gives it to him as an apology","Chen Long explains Tan Lang and the twelve disciples have been stuck in the abyss for a century","Wang Lin realises Tan Lang is faking his wounds and drew the mosquito beasts there","Tan Lang sacrifices the sword disciples to form the Tidal Token as the violet fog merges","Wang Lin buys ten breaths, then joins Chen Long against Tan Lang","Tan Lang uses Devour Death, the Mountain Soul, Celestial Scent, Axis Inversion and the Atlas Seal; Wang Lin snatches the token","Breaking Tan Lang's mark frees his second soul, an Ancient Thunder Dragon; Wang Lin draws the Net-Severing Sword"],"introduced":["Twelve Sword Zodiacs of the Da Lou Sword Sect","Heptad Demon Needles","Devour Death (Tan Lang's technique)","Mountain Soul","Celestial Scent","Axis Inversion","Atlas Seal","Ancient Thunder Dragon","Net-Severing Sword Art"],"cultivation":"Tan Lang is said to be limited to late Ascendant peak strength by his injuries (Wang Lin judges he is not really hurt).","confidence":"high"},{"ep":131,"title":"Unsealing the Mark","summary":"Fleeing the Ancient Thunder Dragon, Wang Lin uses the pull of the abyss to slip into a rift at the bottom of the Tidal Abyss, finds a ruined teleportation array, and devours the weakened dragon with Soul-Devour. After a year he has absorbed only a fifth of it, but his soul has turned into lightning, though it can no longer leave his body. Trapped with him is Du Jian, who trades a secret for his life: he saw his master, Tian Yunzi (All-Seer), wearing a grey robe, devour Sun Yun after a strange mark appeared on Sun Yun's forehead. Wang Lin realises the same mark sits on Tian Yunzi's disciples as a shackle, and offers Du Jian a deal: reach Ascendant and become his Immortal Guard for a thousand years. Du Jian agrees, and Wang Lin forges him into an Immortal Guard with Illusory Yin strength, then spends three years grasping the Net-Severing Sword Art and a year and a half wiping out the 1,083,220 strands of killing intent in his body. Far away, the Sword Sect's master rages at Tan Lang over his dead disciples, Tian Yunzi moves the opening of the Demon Spirit Land ten years earlier, and he vows to kill Wang Lin for tearing out the mark.","events":["Wang Lin escapes the Thunder Dragon into a rift at the abyss floor and finds a teleportation array","He devours the dying Ancient Thunder Dragon; his soul becomes lightning","Du Jian reveals he saw Tian Yunzi devour Sun Yun after a mark appeared on Sun Yun's forehead","Du Jian reaches Ascendant and becomes Wang Lin's Immortal Guard for a thousand years","Wang Lin takes seven of the Twelve Sword Zodiac swords for a Seven-Star Sword Formation","After three years he masters the Net-Severing Sword Art: cutting the net of rules that binds all life","He uses the abyss's pull to erase over a million strands of killing intent","Tian Yunzi brings the Demon Spirit Land's opening forward and vows to kill Wang Lin"],"introduced":["Immortal Guard","Shadow Cloak","Seven-Star Sword Formation","Soul-Devour"],"cultivation":"Du Jian breaks through to Ascendant, then is forged into an Immortal Guard (bronze tier body) shown with Illusory Yin strength. Wang Lin says his lightning soul lets him fight late Ascendant cultivators.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":132,"title":"All Evils","summary":"After eleven years trapped by the abyss's pull, Wang Lin turns the force into his own and gains a third form of Dao intent, Netherworld Force, which frees him. The woman sealed in his scroll begs to be taken down and offers secrets: she shows him the Allheaven Star System, her homeland, and says the Heaven Defying Bead first appeared there before turning up in the Rain Celestial Realm of the Alliance Star System, and that her family, the Xiang family of Planet Dong Lin, can revive the remnant soul inside it. Wang Lin judges she knows too much and seals her for good, but decides to go to Allheaven for the slim chance of waking Li Muwan. He seals the cave behind him, settles an old promise at a stone mansion in Sky Demon City, and hands the Soul Refining Tribe to his disciple Shi San with Giant Demon Clan techniques. Tian Yunzi, the Sword Sect's master, Tan Lang and the Blood Ancestor corner him; Tan Lang swears he does not have the token and names Wang Lin as the thief. Wang Lin flees, throwing the elders into chaos by revealing there are four hidden cave domains, not three, and the elders agree to send one restricted cultivator after him across the star boundary.","events":["Wang Lin masters Netherworld Force, the third form of his Dao intent, and breaks the abyss's pull","The woman in his scroll shows him the Allheaven Star System and the history of the Heaven Defying Bead","She claims to be of the Xiang family of Planet Dong Lin; Wang Lin seals her permanently","Wang Lin decides to go to Allheaven for a chance to wake Li Muwan, and seals the cave","In Sky Demon City he confronts a man who boasted he would kill him, to keep an old promise","He leaves the Soul Refining Tribe to Shi San with Giant Demon Clan techniques","Tan Lang tells Tian Yunzi and the others that Wang Lin has the token; the Blood Ancestor demands his daughter","Wang Lin reveals a fourth cave domain and escapes; the elders plan to send one restricted pursuer after him"],"introduced":["Netherworld Force (third form of Dao intent)","Allheaven Star System","Xiang family of Planet Dong Lin","Four Celestial Realms: Wind, Rain, Thunder, Lightning","Thunder Celestial Realm","Allheaven Stone"],"confidence":"medium"},{"ep":133,"title":"Cosmic Star","summary":"Wang Lin arrives in the void of the Allheaven Star System and saves two clan juniors, Sun Xueshan and Ran Yue, from Nether Mist Insects with lightning, and they take him for a Thunder Celestial Temple envoy. They lead him to Planet Ran Yun, ruled by the Ran, Sun and Zhao clans, and tell him Planet Dong Lin is the feared 'killing star' of the Eastern Domain. Disguised as Xu Mu at late Core Formation, Wang Lin rents a room at a Sun family residence and forges fake ancient pseudo-immortal treasures to raise the immortal jade he needs to reach the second step. At Baohe Hall, Sun Ning buys his sword for 3,000 immortal jade and a Dao-infused mirror for 50,000, and the manager turns out to be Sun Tai, the former Grand Elder of the Corpse Yin Sect, who recognises him as Zeng Niu. Sun Tai explains he was teleported here long ago, enslaved by the Lv clan, lost his cultivation and has under twenty years left, and that the Thunder Celestial Temple is the strongest force in Allheaven. Sun Ning then ambushes Wang Lin outside the city for a hairpin, is beaten, and runs home crying that Wang Lin attacked the Sun family, which shows Wang Lin where to get his immortal jade.","events":["Wang Lin saves Sun Xueshan and Ran Yue from Nether Mist Insects; they mistake him for a Thunder Celestial envoy","They guide him to Planet Ran Yun and tell him Planet Dong Lin is the 'killing star' of the Eastern Domain","Disguised as Xu Mu (late Core Formation), he enters Ran Yun City and sees its three Ascendant ancestors","He rents a room from Sun Ling and forges fake ancient treasures to sell","At Baohe Hall Sun Ning buys a sword and a mirror from him","The manager Sun Tai recognises him as Zeng Niu and tells his own fall from Corpse Yin Sect Grand Elder to slave","Sun Ning ambushes Wang Lin for a hairpin, loses, and runs to the Sun family claiming he was attacked"],"introduced":["Sun Xueshan","Ran Yue","Ran Xuefeng","Sun Xi","Zhao Chuanwen","Sun Ling","Sun Feng","Sun Ning","Planet Ran Yun","Ran Yun City","Baohe Hall","Planet Thousand Illusion","Thunder Celestial Temple","Nether Mist Insects","Lv clan"],"cultivation":"Sun Xueshan: early Soul Transformation. Ran Yue: mid Soul Transformation. Ran Xuefeng: mid Ascendant; Sun Xi and Zhao Chuanwen: early Ascendant. Sun Ling: mid Nascent Soul. Sun Ning: early Soul Transformation. Sun Tai: early Soul Formation (fallen). Wang Lin disguises himself as late Core Formation; Sun Ning later judges him at least mid Soul Transformation.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":134,"title":"Entering the Game","summary":"Three Sun family guardian elders and the clan's First Elder Sun Qiming trap Wang Lin in a Demon-Sealing Array over Sun Ning, until Wang Lin's Ascendant divine sense makes them back down and pay 200,000 immortal jade. While waiting, the young Sun Ling lectures 'Xu Mu' on hard work without knowing who he is, and Wang Lin finds it refreshing. Even with the jade he cannot reach mid Ascendant, so when Sun Qiming invites him to an auction with an eighth-grade demi-divine pill, he goes. Sun Tai warns him it is bait: four years earlier Sun Xi, Ran Xuefeng and the rogue cultivator Zhao Chuanwen killed a wounded Huan clan member for five such pills, and the Huan clan of Planet Thousand Illusion wipes out anyone tied to such a death. On Planet Thousand Illusion, the Huan ancestor Huan Wuqing orders everyone involved killed and hands the task to Huan Mei, his newly adopted final disciple from the Alliance, who sends the guard Huan Dong. Sun Xi tests Wang Lin's strength and escorts him to the auction, where the pill is the last item and no one dares bid until Wang Lin offers a single immortal jade.","events":["The Sun elders trap Wang Lin; his Ascendant divine sense forces Sun Qiming to pay 200,000 immortal jade","Sun Ling innocently lectures Wang Lin about diligence","Sun Qiming invites him to an auction with an eighth-grade demi-divine pill","Sun Tai reveals the three ancestors killed a Huan clan member four years ago and want a scapegoat","Huan Wuqing orders everyone involved wiped out and gives the task to Huan Mei; Huan Dong is sent","Sun Xi tests Wang Lin, then escorts him to Baohe Hall","Wang Lin bids one immortal jade for the pill"],"introduced":["Sun Qiming","Sun Xu","Sun Huan","Sun Leng","Huan Wuqing","Huan Fengshen","Huan Dong","Huan clan","Eighth-grade demi-divine pill","Demon-Sealing Array"],"cultivation":"Sun Xu, Sun Huan, Sun Leng and Sun Qiming: peak Soul Transformation. Huan Dong: peak mid Ascendant. Wang Lin's 200,000 jade still is not enough for mid Ascendant.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":135,"title":"Karma","summary":"Baohe Hall accepts Wang Lin's bid of one immortal jade for the eighth-grade pill, which tells everyone the sale was a trap. Sun Tai gives Wang Lin his savings of over 50,000 immortal jade and his notes on alchemy and forging, and Wang Lin comes to understand karma as the next step after life and death. With nearly 300,000 immortal jade he breaks through in the wasteland outside Ran Yun City, then makes the three ancestors pay for dragging him in: the Ran clan gives ninety percent of its jade, the Sun family seventy, Zhao Chuanwen ninety, plus the Huan clan loot and future supplies. In the loot Wang Lin finds a Huan token tied to its dead owner's soul, and news of an intact Golden Flame vein on Planet Yun Xia, the metal element the Heaven Defying Bead still needs. Huan Dong arrives, Wang Lin crushes him with lightning, and a soul search reveals that his mistress Huan Mei is Liu Mei. Wang Lin leaves for Planet Yun Xia promising to return within three months, while Huan Wuqing seals all star routes around Planet Ran Yun with the Star-Locking Grand Array and speeds up Huan Mei's Blood Reforging Art so she can take revenge herself.","events":["Wang Lin wins the pill for one immortal jade","Sun Tai gives him his life savings and notes","Wang Lin grasps karma and breaks through in the wasteland outside Ran Yun City","He forces the Ran, Sun and Zhao clans to pay most of their immortal jade for his protection","He learns of a Golden Flame vein on Planet Yun Xia that the Heaven Defying Bead needs","He crushes Huan Dong and finds by soul search that Huan Mei is Liu Mei","Huan Wuqing locks down Planet Ran Yun and speeds up Huan Mei's Blood Reforging Art"],"introduced":["Golden Flame vein","Planet Yun Xia","Star-Locking Grand Array","Blood Reforging Art"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin breaks through on Planet Ran Yun, aiming at mid Ascendant; the target is stated, the result is not confirmed on screen. Huan Dong says Huan Wuqing reached Illusory Yin / Corporeal Yang thousands of years ago.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":136,"title":"Shattering the Illusion","summary":"On Planet Yun Xia Wang Lin finds no life at all and spots a Moonwatcher, a parasite of the Ancient Gods known from Tu Si's memories. He realises the whole planet is a sleeping Moonwatcher whose skeleton is the Golden Flame vein, so digging would wake it, and he holds back. On Planet Thousand Illusion, Huan Wuqing drops a whole realm of his own cultivation to perform the Blood Reforging Art on Huan Mei, and her domain evolves into the long-lost Archdemon Myriad Illusions Dao as she reaches Ascendant great perfection. She goes to Planet Ran Yun, and her illusions make Ran Xuefeng, Sun Xi and Zhao Chuanwen kill each other while they burn their souls, then she hunts down the avatars they hid. Wang Lin returns through the lockdown and saves Sun Xi's avatar, but Liu Mei sees through his disguise and attacks him with illusions of a red butterfly, his master, his parents and his mother calling him home, trying to light his Soul Fire. Wang Lin breaks through her domain with the lightning in his soul and tells her his Dao heart cannot be bound by it.","events":["Wang Lin finds Planet Yun Xia lifeless and spots a Moonwatcher","He realises the planet is a sleeping Moonwatcher with the Golden Flame vein as its bones","Huan Wuqing gives up a realm to perform the Blood Reforging Art on Huan Mei","Huan Mei's domain evolves into the Archdemon Myriad Illusions Dao","She makes the three Ran Yun ancestors kill each other and hunts their avatars","Wang Lin saves Sun Xi's avatar; Liu Mei recognises him","She attacks him with illusions of his loved ones; lightning in his soul breaks her domain"],"introduced":["Moonwatcher","Moonlit Mirage Pool","Formless Myriad Illusions Dao","Archdemon Myriad Illusions Dao","Soul Fire"],"cultivation":"Huan Mei (Liu Mei): Ascendant great perfection after the Blood Reforging Art. Huan Wuqing: Corporeal Yang, fallen from Nirvana Scryer. Sun Xi's avatar: late Core Formation. Liu Mei calls Wang Lin early Ascendant.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":137,"title":"Secret Treasure","summary":"Liu Mei summons Li'er, a creature she refined for a hundred years with hatred from a fragment of Wang Lin's blood soul, and its pain goes straight to his soul. Wang Lin fights on with his Immortal Guard, the Seven-Star Sword Formation and his domain, freezes her and takes back the Three Golden Souls of the Soul Refining Sect she was holding. Huan Wuqing arrives to save her, but Wang Lin strikes with Ling Tianhou's Nirvana Cleanser sword qi, and Huan Wuqing retreats because Liu Mei is his only chance to reach the Nirvana stage, asking the Qian clan for help. Wang Lin restores Sun Xi, whose foundation was shattered, to Soul Transformation, and asks Sun Tai to find a herb that can put giant beasts to sleep. On Planet Thousand Illusion, Qian Kuizi, the Qian clan's Illusory Yin third ancestor, tries to take Wang Lin's Illusory Yin puppet, but backs down in terror when Wang Lin's lightning beast appears, takes him for a Thunder Celestial envoy, and pays all his immortal jade. Wang Lin reaches the Huan clan's grand formation and demands that they hand over Liu Mei.","events":["Liu Mei unleashes Li'er, refined from Wang Lin's blood soul with resentment","Wang Lin fights with his Immortal Guard, the Seven-Star Sword Formation and his domain, and recovers the Three Golden Souls","Huan Wuqing intervenes; Wang Lin's Nirvana Cleanser sword qi drives him back","Wang Lin restores Sun Xi to Soul Transformation to settle their karma","He asks Sun Tai to find a herb that paralyses giant beasts","Qian Kuizi tries to seize the puppet, then grovels when he sees the Thunder Beast and pays his immortal jade","Wang Lin demands the Huan clan hand over Liu Mei"],"introduced":["Li'er","Qian Kuizi","Qian clan","Three Golden Souls","Phantom Mirror","Thousand-Tribulation Thunder"],"cultivation":"Qian Kuizi, Qian clan third ancestor: Illusory Yin. Huan Wuqing fears dying unless he regains Nirvana Scryer. Sun Xi is restored to Soul Transformation for good. Liu Mei and Qian Kuizi both call Wang Lin early Ascendant.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":138,"title":"Clouds Scatter","summary":"Wang Lin breaks the Huan clan's ten-thousand-year grand formation with the Net-Severing Sword Art, and clan head Huan Fengshen begs to stay out of his feud with Huan Wuqing. Huan Wuqing fights back with the Ancient Jade Slip, an immortal's relic, and drains the spirit of the whole of Planet Thousand Illusion for one strike, but Wang Lin calls up the Scattered Devil, promising him freedom after this battle, and rips out the planet's star soul. Cornered, Huan Wuqing devours Liu Mei to gain the Way of the Formless Archdemon he had wanted from her all along; before dying she asks him to kill Wang Lin, or else give Wang Lin a pouch. Huan Wuqing becomes a demon, and the Scattered Devil devours him as easy prey. Huan Fengshen hands over the pouch, which holds the cure for the resentment in Li'er and Liu Mei's last words: she hated Wang Lin all her life, but Li'er was the only one who was ever sincere with her. Wang Lin renames Li'er as Wang Ping, his son, and sends him into the mortal world to dissolve the resentment and live a peaceful life.","events":["Wang Lin breaks the Huan grand formation with the Net-Severing Sword Art","Huan Fengshen asks to keep the clan out of the feud","Huan Wuqing uses the Ancient Jade Slip and the spirit of the whole planet; Wang Lin calls the Scattered Devil and rips out the star soul","Huan Wuqing devours Liu Mei to take the Way of the Formless Archdemon","The Scattered Devil devours the newly demonic Huan Wuqing","Huan Fengshen gives Wang Lin Liu Mei's pouch with the cure for Li'er","Wang Lin names Li'er Wang Ping and sends him to live as a mortal"],"introduced":["Ancient Jade Slip","Way of the Formless Archdemon","Star soul","Wang Ping (name)"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":139,"title":"Wang Ping","summary":"Four years later Wang Lin lives as a carpenter in Moonfall Village on Planet Ran Yun, raising Wang Ping, who has lost his past and drinks bitter medicine every day as Liu Mei's cure and Wang Lin's lightning slowly clear the resentment. Sun Tai brings him the record of every Celestial Ascension Fruit in the seventeen clans of Allheaven's Northern Domain, a fruit that can put even a giant beast to sleep for a hundred days, and Wang Lin promises to bury Sun Tai's ashes back in the Alliance. Wang Ping calls him Grandpa Sun and asks him to stay, and the old man settles next door. As the years pass, matchmakers keep chasing Wang Lin, he firmly refuses to let Wang Ping cultivate, and Sun Tai keeps trying to tempt the boy with corpse puppets and secret arts, but Wang Ping will not lie to his father. Living as a mortal makes Wang Lin's Dao heart clearer and his intent of life and death begins to change. After ten years Sun Tai dies at peace, Wang Ping carves his tomb, and after nineteen years in the village Wang Lin leaves to show his grown son the world.","events":["Wang Lin lives as a carpenter in Moonfall Village with Wang Ping","Wang Ping takes daily medicine to clear the resentment","Sun Tai brings the record of Celestial Ascension Fruits in the Northern Domain","Wang Ping asks Grandpa Sun to stay; he moves in next door","Wang Lin refuses to let Wang Ping cultivate; Sun Tai keeps tempting the boy","Sun Tai dies after ten years and is buried by Wang Ping","After nineteen years Wang Lin and Wang Ping leave the village"],"introduced":["Moonfall Village","Zhou Dahan","Celestial Ascension Fruit","Qilian Peak"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":140,"title":"Leaving Home","summary":"Wang Lin and Wang Ping spend eight years wandering mountains, rivers and seas, and Wang Ping visits Qilian Peak and Sun Tai's tomb, still begging to learn cultivation. They settle in Qishui City on Planet Ran Yun, where Sun family members mock Wang Ping and Sun Hai tries to cripple him, and Wang Lin destroys Sun Hai's Golden Core and silences his elders with Dao intent. Qing Yi, a young Sun family member, warns them to run, and is locked up for siding with outsiders. Sun Qiming, now clan master, comes to the Wang Residence, recognises Wang Lin's aura, and orders the whole clan to keep away from the benefactor their ancestor bows to. Wang Lin offers Wang Ping thirty years of wealth instead of cultivation, but Wang Ping vows to become supreme among mortals by his own effort. Wang Lin asks Qing Yi, now cast out of her clan, to spend sixty years by Wang Ping's side in return for a chance at cultivation, and she accepts.","events":["Eight years of travel; Wang Ping visits Qilian Peak and Sun Tai's tomb","They settle in Qishui City and buy the Wang Residence","Wang Lin cripples Sun Hai for attacking Wang Ping and scares off his elders","Qing Yi warns them and is locked up by Sun Kaiping","Sun Qiming recognises Wang Lin and orders the Sun family to keep away","Wang Ping refuses gifted wealth and vows to rise among mortals himself","Qing Yi agrees to stay by Wang Ping for sixty years"],"introduced":["Qishui City","Qing Yi","Yun Wufeng","Sun Hai","Sun Kaiping","Wang Residence"],"cultivation":"Qing Yi says she has not yet reached Foundation Establishment. Sun Hai has a Golden Core (Core Formation), which Wang Lin destroys.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":141,"title":"Origins","summary":"Twenty years later a storyteller tells how Wang Ping and his wife Qing Yi rose from famine relief in the cruel Empire Mountain Kingdom, let themselves be captured as part of a plan, toppled the tyrant and founded the Tianxing Empire. Great Zhou and Chenyun hire cultivators of the Qu clan to kill him, but they all die, and the Ran, Zhao and Sun clans ban every cultivator from mortal affairs. Within five years Tianxing unifies the land, but Wang Ping finds no children, an emptiness inside, and after ten more years gives up the throne. He returns to the Wang Residence and asks Wang Lin who he really is, and Wang Lin tells him the story of a young man from the Heng Yue Sect on Planet Suzaku. Wang Ping understands he was born from resentment and retires with Qing Yi to a mountain village, asking that his ashes be sent to his father and that his carvings be burned with him. Meanwhile Lei Daozi, an Illusory Yin envoy of the Thunder Celestial Temple, arrives to hunt the man impersonating an envoy and notices a mortal staying conscious under his divine sense.","events":["A storyteller recounts Wang Ping founding the Tianxing Empire","Cultivators hired by Great Zhou and Chenyun die; the three clans ban interference in mortal kingdoms","Tianxing unifies the land","Wang Ping abdicates after ten years and returns home","Wang Lin tells him the story of his own past","Wang Ping learns he was born from resentment and retires to a mountain village with Qing Yi","Lei Daozi of the Thunder Celestial Temple arrives on Planet Ran Yun"],"introduced":["Tianxing Empire","Great Zhou","Chenyun","Empire Mountain Kingdom","Qu clan","Lei Daozi"],"cultivation":"Lei Daozi, envoy of the Thunder Celestial Temple: Illusory Yin.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":142,"title":"Return to Dust","summary":"Lei Daozi finds Wang Ping and the Immortal Guard protecting him and moves to seize the peak Illusory Yin puppet, until Wang Lin arrives and drags him off to the wastes of Planet Ran Yun. Lei Daozi's lightning cannot hurt Wang Lin, whose Life and Death domain has quietly reached Ascendant great perfection, and Wang Lin's Thunder Beast terrifies Lei Daozi's young lightning beast, but Lei Daozi's Second Step origin power still outmatches mere arts. Looking for a weak spot, Lei Daozi reveals that Wang Ping's flesh no longer exists and his soul is held together by Nirvana sword qi, then uses his Origin Lightning Cauldron. Wang Lin breaks out with the third seal of the God Slaying War Chariot and cuts him down with the Net-Severing Sword. Wang Ping finally understands why he could never cultivate, never have children and never fall ill in seventy years, thanks his father for a full life and fades away. Qing Yi chooses to follow him into death, and Wang Lin is left with memories of the son who once said the medicine was bitter.","events":["Lei Daozi finds Wang Ping and his Immortal Guard","Wang Lin takes Lei Daozi to the wasteland and fights him","Wang Lin's Life and Death domain is at Ascendant great perfection; the Thunder Beast cows Lei Daozi's beast","Lei Daozi reveals Wang Ping's body is gone and held together by sword qi","Lei Daozi uses the Origin Lightning Cauldron; Wang Lin opens the third seal of the God Slaying War Chariot","Wang Ping learns the truth, thanks Wang Lin and fades away","Qing Yi chooses to die with Wang Ping"],"introduced":["Origin power","Origin Lightning Cauldron","Silver-horned lightning beast","Life and Death domain"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's Life and Death domain: Ascendant great perfection. The body fighting here is Wang Lin's avatar at mid Ascendant. Lei Daozi: Illusory Yin, Second Step.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":143,"title":"Thunder Envoy","summary":"Lei Daozi survives and flees Planet Ran Yun, but his own lightning beast turns on him, and Wang Lin catches him with his origin power spent. Lei Daozi agrees to a 'slave seal', but Wang Lin draws out his soul and forges his Illusory Yin body into a second Immortal Guard, offering freedom after thirty years. The soul is destroyed in the forging, so the new guard reaches peak silver tier but cannot use divine arts. From Lei Daozi's belongings Wang Lin gains the Thunder Origin Art, which turns lightning into origin power and could halve his time to the Second Step, a real Thunder Celestial Temple token and a fortune in immortal jade that lifts his avatar to late Ascendant. Using the envoy title, he makes the Huan clan hand over its Celestial Ascension Fruits, turns down Qian Kuizi's oath of loyalty, and gathers more fruit across the Northern Domain over half a year. Near Planet Yun Xia, Tan Lang, trapped somewhere for seventy years, fails his eighth escape attempt and curses Wang Lin for bringing him to Allheaven.","events":["Lei Daozi flees and is caught when his lightning beast turns on him","Wang Lin draws out Lei Daozi's soul and forges his body into a second Immortal Guard","The soul is destroyed; the guard is peak silver tier but cannot use divine arts","Wang Lin learns the Thunder Origin Art and uses the immortal jade to reach late Ascendant","Posing as a Thunder envoy, he takes the Huan clan's Celestial Ascension Fruits","He declines Qian Kuizi's offer to pledge the Qian clan","Tan Lang, trapped for seventy years, curses Wang Lin"],"introduced":["Thunder Origin Art","Second Immortal Guard","Cauldron Forging Heaven and Earth","Thunder Celestial Temple token"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's avatar reaches late Ascendant. The second Immortal Guard (Lei Daozi's body): peak silver tier. Qian Kuizi notes Wang Lin has cultivated less than a century.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":144,"title":"Hunting the Moon","summary":"On Planet Yun Xia Wang Lin finds the Moonwatcher partly awake, and plants Celestial Ascension Fruits at the roots of most of its tentacles to numb it. He learns that Tan Lang, the elders' pursuer from the Alliance, broke one of its bones and disturbed its deadly Moonblight, and found him trapped in its gut, the only one to follow him. Wang Lin uses the tearing Netherworld Force he learned in the abyss to rip out the Moonwatcher's bone, but the beast wakes and speaks Ancient God words that shatter the sky. He sacrifices his Restriction Flag and the Seven-Star Sword Formation to slow it, while Tan Lang breaks out and attacks him with the Landscape Screen and the Immortal Emperor Crown. Wang Lin throws Tan Lang half the bone as bait and answers the Moonwatcher's finger with his life imprint, his second Immortal Guard and Ling Tianhou's sword qi. To get away he abandons his body and flees in soul form, until a month later the Moonwatcher stops at the edge of Allheaven's Southern Domain, and Wang Lin looks for a place to forge a new body and refine the bone.","events":["Wang Lin plants Celestial Ascension Fruits on the Moonwatcher's tentacles","He finds Tan Lang trapped inside it after disturbing its Moonblight","He rips out the Moonwatcher's bone with Netherworld Force","The Moonwatcher wakes and uses Ancient God speech","Wang Lin loses the Restriction Flag and the Seven-Star Sword Formation; Tan Lang escapes and attacks","Wang Lin uses half the bone as bait and blocks the beast's finger with his life imprint, second Immortal Guard and Ling Tianhou's sword qi","He abandons his body and escapes in soul form; the Moonwatcher stops at the Southern Domain"],"introduced":["Moonblight","Moonwatcher bone","Ancient God speech","Immortal Emperor Crown","Landscape Screen","Life imprint","Allheaven Southern Domain"],"confidence":"high"},{"ep":145,"title":"A Glimpse of the Dao","summary":"With his body broken and his soul damaged after the escape from the Moongazer, Wang Lin follows his soul to a hidden lightning planet in the Southern Domain of the Allheaven Star System. In ten years he swallows its Heavenly Lightning to heal his soul, then spends sixty more years using the Ancient God Tactic to forge his avatar a new body out of lightning. He lets the Heaven Defying Bead absorb the Moongazer bone and sorts through Greed's treasures: a mountain stone holding an immortal mountain's soul, a folding-screen copy of the Mountain and River Map, and the Immortal Emperor Crown, whose five pearls of the Five Elements seem to search him, which makes him think of Hongdie's Five Spirit body. Three months later the bead reaches completion and, when he claims it as master, a huge gate and a giant sky-piercing arm appear, its pressure meant to make any cultivator kneel; Wang Lin refuses to bend, but the arm's Law power forces him back. He moves to the Thunder Pool of the Southern Domain, refines origin power there with his Thunder Origin art, and uses it to reopen the gate. Inside the Heaven Defying space he sees a vision of an old figure teaching about the Dao, and grasps that at the end of seeking the Dao one finds oneself.","events":["Wang Lin finds a hidden lightning planet in the Southern Domain and heals his soul in ten years by swallowing its lightning","Over sixty years he forges his avatar a new lightning body with the Ancient God Tactic","The Heaven Defying Bead absorbs the Moongazer bone while he sorts Greed's treasures","He studies the mountain stone, the copy of the Mountain and River Map and the Immortal Emperor Crown","The completed bead shows a vast gate and a giant arm that tries to force him to kneel","He refines origin power in the Southern Domain's Thunder Pool and reopens the gate","Inside the Heaven Defying space he watches a vision of an old teacher speaking about the Dao"],"introduced":["Southern Domain (Allheaven)","Thunder Pool","Immortal Emperor Crown (examined)","Mountain and River Map copy (folding screen)","Heaven Defying Gate and the giant arm","Heaven Defying space","Thunder Origin art"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's avatar forges a new body that holds lightning power. The Heaven Defying Bead reaches completion after absorbing the Moongazer bone.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":146,"title":"Commanding Thunder","summary":"While Wang Lin cultivates in the Thunder Pool, Shengong Hu of the Southern Domain's Shengong family, a second-rank envoy of the Thunder Celestial Temple, catches a single glance from him that shakes his Dao heart and drops him from Corporeal Yang to Illusory Yin. Taking Wang Lin for a hidden master, Shengong Hu begs to serve him for a thousand years and hands over his Dao soul; Wang Lin accepts and learns that the Thunder Celestial Realm opens in thirty years, takes Ascendant cultivators and below, can be entered with a Thunder Cauldron, and forbids divine powers above early Nirvana Scryer. Wang Lin, drained by his fight with Lei Daozi, can only walk ten steps into the pool until he stops forcing it and merges his Dao with the thunder, walking on lightning. Envoy Zhan Konglie, a Corporeal Yang cultivator, arrives, wants the treasure he thinks Wang Lin owns, and fights Shengong Hu. Wang Lin points out that Shengong Hu's Dao heart is not one with thunder; Shengong Hu grasps it at once, and Zhan Konglie apologises, says he has a summons from the Thunder Celestial Temple and leaves. Wang Lin sends Shengong Hu away with a message jade slip and a star map, and after ten years of refining his soul is whole, but he has hit the bottleneck before the second step.","events":["Shengong Hu loses his cultivation from Corporeal Yang to Illusory Yin after one glance at Wang Lin","Shengong Hu gives Wang Lin his Dao soul and swears to serve him","Shengong Hu explains the Thunder Celestial Realm's opening, entry rules and Thunder Cauldrons","Wang Lin learns to walk deep into the Thunder Pool by merging his Dao with the thunder","Zhan Konglie challenges them and fights Shengong Hu","Wang Lin's advice on the Dao of thunder lets Shengong Hu force Zhan Konglie to back down","Wang Lin's soul is whole after ten years, and he faces the second-step bottleneck"],"introduced":["Shengong Hu","Zhan Konglie","Shengong family","Thunder Celestial Temple","Thunder Celestial Realm","Thunder Cauldron","Silver-Horned Thunder Beast"],"cultivation":"Shengong Hu: Illusory Yin, fallen from Corporeal Yang. Zhan Konglie: Corporeal Yang. Wang Lin appears to others as late Ascendant. Thunder Celestial Realm: Ascendant late great perfection and below may enter, and no divine power above early Nirvana Scryer may be used inside. After ten years Wang Lin's soul is complete and he is at the bottleneck of the first step.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":147,"title":"Claiming a Planet","summary":"With twenty years left before the Thunder Celestial Realm opens, Wang Lin goes to Qing Ling Star, a planet of mortals in the poor Southern Domain where the strongest cultivators are Nascent Soul. There he meets Zhang Xinhai, the dying head of the Zhang family, extends his life by ten years, and in return orders the family to collect the resentment of dying mortals across the planet for his Yellow Springs (Netherworld) Dao. He declares the land within ten thousand miles of Hengyun Peak forbidden and spends the years merging his domain into the Karma Whip, shifting it from life and death toward karma; when Xu Liguo, proud of the ancient sword intent he has taken in, mouths off, Wang Lin uses the whip's karma on him until he begs. Zhang Yang becomes head of the Zhang family and plants Ascension Fruit across the planet, the Yellow Springs gains the shadow of a spring soul, and Wang Lin's avatar reaches Ascendant great perfection, the end of the first step. Three months before the realm opens he goes to Sheng Tan Planet to get a Thunder Cauldron, where the Zhang ancestor Zhang Zhen, an Illusory Yin cultivator, calls him an impostor posing as an envoy.","events":["Xu Liguo boasts that he has conquered an ancient sword intent","Wang Lin extends Zhang Xinhai's life by ten years on Qing Ling Star","He orders the Zhang family to collect mortal resentment and claims Hengyun Peak as forbidden land","He merges his domain into the Karma Whip and tests its karma on Xu Liguo","Zhang Yang leads the family and plants Ascension Fruit across the planet","Wang Lin's avatar reaches Ascendant great perfection","On Sheng Tan Planet, Zhang Zhen calls Wang Lin an impostor envoy"],"introduced":["Qing Ling Star (Planet Qing Ling)","Zhang Xinhai","Zhang Yang","Zhang family","Hengyun Peak","Karma Whip","Sheng Tan Planet (Planet Sheng Tan)","Zhang Zhen"],"cultivation":"Zhang Xinhai: late Nascent Soul. Zhang Yang: early Nascent Soul. Wang Lin's avatar: Ascendant great perfection, one year and eight months after his life and death domain reached perfection. Zhang Zhen: Illusory Yin.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":148,"title":"Devouring Thunder","summary":"On Sheng Tan Planet, Zhang Zhen mocks Wang Lin as a fake envoy and attacks with his family's soul-burning flame, which cannot harm Wang Lin's Illusory Yin puppet; when Wang Lin's thunder arts and the mountain stone push him hard, he hands over a Thunder Cauldron. Zhang Zhen then trades his family's Third Eye divine art for the Celestial Slaughter Art, and each side quietly slips flaws into the copy they give. When the realm opens, immortal thunder comes down to fetch the cauldron's holder; Wang Lin and the Ancient Thunder Dragon swallow as much of it as they can, while the Zhang family on Qing Ling Star worship the light as an immortal. At the gate of the Thunder Celestial Realm, Tang Yanfeng of the Tang family mocks Shengong Hu for losing his standing, just before Wang Lin forces his way through the closed gate. Inside, on the Fragment Continent, Wang Lin heals, while Nirvana Shatterer Yan Leizi on the Black Mountain notices him and plots a grand formation to crush the Alliance and Master Zhong Xuan. Shengong Hu tells Wang Lin about the realm's immortal corpses and origin energy, and when Wang Lin finds a piece of rare origin energy, Xu Fenghan of the Xu family demands he hand it over.","events":["Zhang Zhen fights Wang Lin and then hands over a Thunder Cauldron","Wang Lin trades the Celestial Slaughter Art for the Zhang family's Third Eye divine art","Wang Lin swallows the immortal thunder sent to fetch the cauldron's holder","Tang Yanfeng mocks Shengong Hu at the entrance to the Thunder Celestial Realm","Wang Lin forces his way through the sealed immortal gate","Yan Leizi senses him and plans to crush the Alliance and Master Zhong Xuan","Xu Fenghan orders Wang Lin to give up the origin energy he has found"],"introduced":["Third Eye divine art","Celestial Slaughter Art (traded)","Ancient Thunder Dragon","Tang Yanfeng","Tang family","Fragment Continent","Black Mountain","Yan Leizi","Master Zhong Xuan (named)","Xu Fenghan","Xu family","immortal thunder","origin energy"],"cultivation":"Zhang Zhen has just reached Illusory Yin. Tang Yanfeng: Corporeal Yang. Yan Leizi: Nirvana Shatterer. Xu Fenghan: Illusory Yin. Wang Lin passes as Ascendant.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":149,"title":"A Game of Strategy","summary":"Xu Fenghan attacks Wang Lin over the origin energy and, losing, shows his Dao intent as a demon lotus; Wang Lin answers with his own Yellow Springs Dao intent and the Karma Whip, and Xu Liguo, proud of his ancient sword intent, finishes Xu Fenghan off. In the mountains of the Fragment Continent, Ge Hong of the Ge family, who holds the life soul of her escort Li Yuan, uses an immortal trap to feed cultivators to her family's Heavenly Ghost. Wang Lin sees that Li Yuan built the trap, which is the Eighteen Plum Restriction, and destroys the Heavenly Ghost; Li Yuan then talks him into joining them to find an intact Origin Artifact in a hidden place, with the Ge family taking half. Going by the name Xu Mu, Wang Lin crosses the Lightning Layer on his lightning body and gets through a living trap to reach the Thunder Celestial Realm's graveyard of immortals, where an immortal general's sword became a mountain. There Li Yuan reveals he is the last heir of the Li family of Annihilation Star, cursed with an immortal's slave mark thirty thousand years ago. The sword Ge Hong brought was forged from half his clan to break that mark and was stolen ten thousand years ago when Ge Yunfeng ambushed Li Jinglan. Using the mountain's Annihilation Restriction, Li Yuan takes his life soul back and reveals that for years he has been carving the Heart Illusion Restriction into Ge Hong's mind so that she would bring the sword back to him.","events":["Wang Lin and Xu Liguo defeat Xu Fenghan in a contest of Dao intent","Ge Hong's trap feeds cultivators to the Heavenly Ghost","Wang Lin finds out Li Yuan made the trap, recognises the Eighteen Plum Restriction and destroys the Heavenly Ghost","Li Yuan offers a share of an Origin Artifact in exchange for Wang Lin's help","Wang Lin, as Xu Mu, crosses the Lightning Layer and a living trap","They reach the graveyard of immortals around a general's sword-mountain","Li Yuan reveals his clan's slave mark and the history of the stolen sword","Li Yuan takes back his life soul and turns on Ge Hong"],"introduced":["Ge Hong","Li Yuan","Yuan Ningwang","Ge family","Li family of Annihilation Star","Heavenly Ghost","Lightning Layer","Thunderward Sword","Graveyard of immortals","Annihilation Restriction","Heart Illusion Restriction","Li Jinglan (named)","Ge Yunfeng (named)","Demon Lotus Dao intent"],"cultivation":"Ge Hong: Ascendant great perfection. Li Yuan: Ascendant great perfection. Yuan Ningwang: Soul Transformation.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":150,"title":"The Dao Servant","summary":"Li Yuan admits he used Wang Lin and asks for his Stillness spell, explaining that the Li family, once famous for restrictions, has been dying since an immortal put a slave mark on them thirty thousand years ago: every Li who reaches Ascendant goes no further, and only he, his sister and his mother are left. As an apology he gives Wang Lin the first thirteen restrictions of the Eighteen Plum Restriction and explains that the Annihilation Restriction, one of four great ancient restrictions, belongs to a fifth level above the four ranks, the Void level. Wang Lin agrees to break the source of the mark, an immortal statue at the summit. But the Immortal Servant Soul hiding in Li Yuan's blood wakes in his sea of consciousness, says it created the slave mark, possessed Li Jinglan ten thousand years ago while Ge Yunfeng's family helped, and made the sword to nourish an immortal soul rather than to break the mark. Wang Lin sees a vision of the Thunder Celestial Realm's fall and of the general Gu Ziyuan's sword strike, and works out with Xu Liguo that the real sword is inside the statue. He refuses to help the possessing spirit revive the Immortal Lord and fights its Eighteen Plum Restriction, Frost Bloom and Phantom Bough, inside its domain, until the trap slips because Li Yuan is fighting back.","events":["Li Yuan explains the Li family's slave mark and asks for Wang Lin's Stillness spell","He gives Wang Lin the first thirteen restrictions of the Eighteen Plum Restriction","Li Yuan explains the Annihilation Restriction and the Void level above the four ranks","The Immortal Servant Soul wakes in Li Yuan and reveals the history of the slave mark","A flashback shows Li Jinglan possessed and Ge Yunfeng helping, ten thousand years ago","Wang Lin sees a vision of Gu Ziyuan's last battle as the Thunder Celestial Realm fell","Wang Lin finds the sword hidden in the statue and turns on the possessing spirit","They fight with the Eighteen Plum Restriction until Li Yuan pushes back from inside"],"introduced":["Immortal Servant Soul","Li Jinglan","Ge Yunfeng","Gu Ziyuan","Eighteen Plum Restriction: first seal Frost Bloom, fourth seal Phantom Bough","Void level of restrictions","Illusion Restriction","Stillness spell (named)"],"cultivation":"Li Jinglan: early Ascendant. Ge Yunfeng: early Ascendant. The Annihilation Restriction is said to stand above the four known ranks of restrictions, at a fifth level called the Void level.","confidence":"high"},{"ep":151,"title":"Kindred Spirits","summary":"Wang Lin tells the sword spirit that its plan failed ten thousand years ago only because its own master, Gu Ziyuan, chose not to come back. The spirit, Feijing, the soul of Gu Ziyuan's sword, tells how it arrived one step too late in the last battle, built him a stone body from the sword, put the slave mark on the Li family to leave the mountain, and used the Li bloodline to forge a sword that made his soul whole. With Li Yuan fighting back from inside, Wang Lin uses his Net-Severing Sword Art and Stillness spell on the statue, and Gu Ziyuan's fading soul appears, tells Feijing he died without regret, apologises for breaking his promise and fades away with the sword. Freed, Li Yuan helps Wang Lin through a valley sealed by an immortal restriction to an ancient immortal's home, where they find armor made from an Ancient God's hide, a finger bone and murals of a battle with an Eight Star Ancient God. A dying immortal's record tells of the Immortal Emperor going mad and dying while pointing at the sky as something that should not exist appeared above, watching. Wang Lin keeps the armor, gives Li Yuan first pick of the other two items (Li Yuan takes a sword), and they part with a contact jade slip.","events":["Wang Lin tells the sword spirit that Gu Ziyuan chose not to return","The sword spirit tells its story and the history of the slave mark","Li Yuan fights back as Wang Lin attacks with the Net-Severing Sword Art and Stillness spell","Gu Ziyuan's soul says goodbye to his sword spirit and both fade","Li Yuan breaks a sealed valley with the Eighteen Plum Restriction's ninth seal","They find Ancient God Hide Armor, a finger bone and murals of an Eight Star Ancient God","An immortal's record describes the Immortal Emperor's death and a pair of eyes in the sky","Wang Lin and Li Yuan share the loot and part"],"introduced":["Feijing (sword spirit)","Valley of the Immortal Relics","Ancient Immortal Residence","Ancient God Hide Armor","Eighteen Plum Restriction: eighteenth seal (a thousand plums pay court) and ninth seal Plum Frost","Li family Heart Restriction (inheritance mark)"],"cultivation":"Gu Ziyuan is called an Immortal King of the Thunder Celestial Realm.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":152,"title":"Guardian Essence","summary":"A year later, Yao Luo of a Yao family branch and his cousin Ru Yun, guarded by the Illusory Yin elder Yan Chou, have been hunting Li Yuan for thirteen days over nine immortal swords. Li Yuan uses his Annihilation Heart Restriction, then calls for Xu Mu: Wang Lin arrives with the Earthfold Step, now at Corporeal Yang, and kills them, hitting Yan Chou once for each of the thirteen days. In a cave he pours origin power into Li Yuan to help him toward Illusory Yin. Wang Lin reflects that during the year he was hunted by a Nirvana Cleanser expert, the Blood Ancestor, and that this immortal-slaying journey won him Corporeal Yang, a refined Thunder Celestial Realm fragment seal, and a treasure made from half of the Blood Ancestor's blood body; he still means to go to Planet Dong Lin to try to wake Li Muwan. Breaking eight linked seals hidden between the swords and a beast bone, he claims a true immortal treasure, the Wither Dao Pair, and learns from a Yao talisman of the Collection Pavilion, a vault of immortal arts sealed by four ancient families with immortal blood. Li Yuan gives him an ancient Restriction Breaking Mirror and leads him to an immortal market, where he revives a dead formation; when Tang Yanyun of the Tang family demands a share, Wang Lin declares that anyone who enters will die, kills a Tang cultivator, and leaves Tang Ping, the Tang family's young master, shaken by his killing intent.","events":["Yao Luo, Ru Yun and Yan Chou torment Li Yuan after a thirteen-day hunt","Wang Lin, now at Corporeal Yang, kills them and makes Yan Chou pay for each day","Wang Lin pours origin power into Li Yuan","He looks over the year's gains, including half of the Blood Ancestor's blood body","He breaks the hidden seals and claims the Wither Dao Pair","He learns of the Collection Pavilion and asks Li Yuan to come with him","Li Yuan revives a dead formation in an immortal market ruin","Wang Lin forbids anyone to enter, kills a Tang cultivator and faces Tang Ping"],"introduced":["Yao Luo","Ru Yun","Yan Chou","Yao family (Allheaven)","Wither Dao Pair","Thunder Celestial Realm fragment seal","Collection Pavilion","Restriction Breaking Mirror","Immortal market","Tang Yanyun","Tang Ping","Earthfold Step","Annihilation Heart Restriction"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin's avatar: Corporeal Yang (breakthrough happened during the one-year gap). Yao Luo: Ascendant great perfection. Ru Yun: early Ascendant. Yan Chou: Illusory Yin. Li Yuan has been stuck at Ascendant great perfection for years and is fed origin power to aim for Illusory Yin. Tang Yanyun and Tang Ping: Illusory Yin.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":153,"title":"The Collection Pavilion","summary":"After the fight, the Tang family decides it must not provoke Xu Mu, thinking a Corporeal Yang this strong could only have been trained by the Xu family of Planet Dong Lin. In the underground cave beneath the immortal market, Wang Lin notices that the tunnels form runes; Li Yuan works out that nine such tunnels make a huge healing formation that has run for ages, keeping someone alive. A voice inside offers Wang Lin any immortal art if he has Li Yuan open the seal, and drives Li Yuan half mad, but Wang Lin refuses a free gift and they flee. Chased by a crimson Ji Realm force that floods his sea of consciousness, Wang Lin holds it with origin power and keeps part of it sealed inside himself for later, while the sealed being cries out for Qi Condensation cultivators and swears that Qing Shui's day of death is coming. A month and a half later they see crowds heading to four fragment continents where immortal power has surged; Zhan Konglie, now a Thunder Celestial Temple envoy, greets Wang Lin respectfully and hears about the Three Heroes of the South. At the realm's center, Li Yuan finds the hidden restriction of the Collection Pavilion and uses his Heart Restriction to send Wang Lin inside, where the four guardians of the four families, among them a Yao family Corporeal Yang guardian, say outsiders may not enter; Wang Lin fights them until they ask whether he is now qualified.","events":["The Tang family decides not to provoke Xu Mu","Wang Lin and Li Yuan find rune tunnels forming an ancient healing formation","A sealed being tempts Wang Lin with immortal arts and drives Li Yuan wild","Wang Lin takes in and holds a Ji Realm force, keeping part of it for later","The sealed being vows revenge on Qing Shui","Zhan Konglie greets Wang Lin on the way to the four fragment continents","Li Yuan opens a way into the Collection Pavilion","Wang Lin fights the four guardians who bar outsiders"],"introduced":["Underground cave of the immortal abode","Healing formation","Ji Realm (Extreme Point) force","Three Heroes of the South","Center of the Thunder Celestial Realm","Collection Pavilion guardians (four families)","Xu family of Planet Dong Lin (named)"],"cultivation":"Zhan Konglie and the Three Heroes of the South reached Corporeal Yang young. A Yao family guardian of the Collection Pavilion is Corporeal Yang. Wang Lin openly shows Corporeal Yang.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":154,"title":"Call Wind","summary":"The guardians stop the fight; Chen of the Chen family invites Xu Mu to become an honorary elder, and the guardians open the Collection Pavilion together, though privately they plan to use him and expect a Corporeal Yang to reach no higher than its fourth level. Wang Lin climbs past the eighth level, as high as the four ancestors who sealed it, to the ninth, but finds only an empty painting until he steps inside it. In the painting he sees the pavilion's opening in the old Thunder Celestial Realm: the Ninth Grade Immortal King Xiaoyao Zi paints a tree, Immortal Emperor Bai Fan watches, and Bai Fan's disciple Qing Shui says the tree lacks wind, so Bai Fan seals his first immortal art, Call Wind, into the painting for a fated heir. Wang Lin learns what wind is, from the breeze on green leaves to a force that tears flesh and soul, and comes out with Call Wind. When the guardians attack to seize it, he kills them with Call Wind, using two of their Nascent Souls to make up his origin power, then absorbs the pavilion's core seal and takes the whole Collection Pavilion. Leaving the guardians' bodies as a gift to the four families, he and Li Yuan watch Lu Hecheng and Chen Pingnian find the pavilion gone, and they head for the Immortal Gate in the west to leave the realm.","events":["Chen of the Chen family invites Xu Mu to be an honorary elder and the pavilion is opened","Wang Lin climbs to the ninth level of the Collection Pavilion","He enters the painting and sees Xiaoyao Zi, Bai Fan and Qing Shui at the pavilion's opening","Bai Fan seals the immortal art Call Wind into the painting","Wang Lin learns Call Wind and kills the guardians who attack him","He absorbs the pavilion's core seal and takes the Collection Pavilion","The four families find the pavilion gone; Wang Lin and Li Yuan head for the western Immortal Gate"],"introduced":["Chen family of Allheaven","Xiaoyao Zi (Celestial King Carefree)","Bai Fan","Qing Shui","Call Wind (immortal art)","Lu Hecheng","Chen Pingnian","Lu family","Western Plains of the Thunder Celestial Realm"],"cultivation":"Bai Fan: Immortal Emperor of the Thunder Celestial Realm, early Nirvana Void. Qing Shui: Immortal Lord, peak Nirvana Shatterer. Xiaoyao Zi: Ninth Grade Immortal King. Lu Hecheng and Chen Pingnian: Illusory Yin. A Corporeal Yang cultivator is expected to reach the fourth level of the pavilion; Wang Lin reaches the ninth.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":155,"title":"The Sealed Immortal","summary":"At a fragment continent, Shengong Hu and Zhan Konglie watch a huge new formation open far too fast, and a white-haired old man breaks out of it, crying that he has returned and is reborn. On the way to the Immortal Gate, Wang Lin and Li Yuan are attacked by a severed arm close to Nirvana Scryer in power that swallows thunder; Wang Lin uses the Third Eye to survive what he calls his most dangerous fight since reaching Corporeal Yang, and guesses that a great expert is reassembling his body through slaughter. The old man curses Qing Shui, who he says cut his body apart and sealed it, a seal that saved him from the destruction of the Celestial Realm, and he sets out to devour the cultivators in the realm. At the gate he seals the Immortal Gate so no one can leave; the Zhan, Tang, Sun, Lu and Zheng families charge him together and he crushes them with the immortal True Form art. Instead of hiding, Wang Lin asks Li Yuan to trust him and uses the Earthfold Step to merge fully with heaven and earth and vanish, an escape art the old man admits few ancient immortals mastered, but the old man finds him anyway.","events":["The white-haired old man breaks out of a sealed formation","A thunder-swallowing severed arm attacks Wang Lin and Li Yuan; Wang Lin uses the Third Eye","The old man curses Qing Shui, who sealed his body, and begins to devour cultivators","He seals the Immortal Gate, trapping everyone in the realm","The families charge him together and are crushed by his True Form art","Wang Lin merges with heaven and earth to hide, and the old man still finds him"],"introduced":["White-haired old man (sealed immortal)","Severed arm","True Form art (immortal art)","Sun, Lu and Zheng families","Immortal Gate"],"cultivation":"The severed arm's power is close to Nirvana Scryer. Wang Lin calls this his most dangerous fight since reaching Corporeal Yang.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":156,"title":"Immortal Lord Qing Shui","summary":"The old man traps Wang Lin in a cage of divine sense, but Wang Lin breaks out with Call Wind and the Earthfold Step, and the old man, recognising Bai Fan's art, demands to know his connection to the Immortal Emperor. Wang Lin throws everything at him: the Wither Dao Pair, the Rain Celestial sword, and an explosion of the origin power in half of the Blood Ancestor's blood body. A presence inside Wang Lin's sea of consciousness then borrows his body and uses the Ji Realm power he kept to fight the old man, while Xu Liguo wonders who his master really is. When the old man tries to devour the young cultivators, Yan Leizi calls him the Crown Prince of Qing Shui Country, Bai Fan's disciple, Immortal Lord Qing Shui, and the old man screams that Qing Shui is his enemy. Shengong Hu joins in with thunder built from Wang Lin's old advice, and Yan Leizi draws Qing Shui to the Immortal Ascension Altar, the old core of the Thunder Celestial Realm, where each heavy blow pushes him back toward his peak. Wang Lin holds Qing Shui off with the Net-Severing Sword Art and the copy of the Mountain and River Map while Yan Leizi completes a formation that refines the whole Thunder Celestial Realm into a treasure. Yan Leizi says he planned it for tens of thousands of years so the cultivators of Allheaven can roam free of the Allheaven Stone, and vows to lead them to destroy the Alliance and Master Zhong Xuan.","events":["The old man traps Wang Lin, who breaks free with Call Wind and the Earthfold Step","Wang Lin attacks with the Wither Dao Pair and the Blood Ancestor's blood body","A presence in Wang Lin's mind borrows his body and fights with the Ji Realm","Yan Leizi names the old man as Immortal Lord Qing Shui, which he denies","Shengong Hu fights with the thunder Wang Lin taught him","Yan Leizi lures Qing Shui to the Immortal Ascension Altar","Wang Lin holds Qing Shui off with the Net-Severing Sword Art and the Mountain and River Map","Yan Leizi refines the Thunder Celestial Realm into a treasure and vows to crush the Alliance"],"introduced":["Immortal Ascension Altar","Qing Shui Country","Allheaven Stone","Rain Celestial sword"],"cultivation":"The old man says Wang Lin's present cultivation is not even at the level of an Immortal King.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":157,"title":"The Thunder Celestial Formation","summary":"Yan Leizi completes his great Thunder Celestial Formation, using it to turn the realm into a treasure, and gives it treasure spirits made from souls he has taken: twenty-eight Illusory Yin Nascent Souls, then a Nirvana Scryer and a line of captured immortals of rising grade, up to a first-grade Immortal Lord of the Thunder Celestial Realm and a sixth-grade slaughter Immortal Lord from the Rain Celestial Realm; Wang Lin recognises the Blood Ancestor's soul among them. Yan Leizi admits he lured Qing Shui here to borrow his Ji Realm, then uses a jade slip, found after entering the realm hundreds of times, to remind him of his past. Qing Shui was the Crown Prince of Qing Shui Country and became Bai Fan's disciple at this altar; one night he went mad, everyone around him died, and his beloved Han Yan died in his arms, until Bai Fan himself stopped him. Near death, Qing Shui cut his own body apart and sealed it, and Bai Fan built the healing formation hoping he would wake. Qing Shui rages, using Call Wind and Call Rain, but Yan Leizi tells him that Bai Fan died mysteriously and the realm collapsed soon after, and offers the survivors of a similar madness in the Rain Celestial Realm and a hidden scroll in the Cultivation Alliance tied to the fall. Qing Shui agrees to go with him to the Alliance. Before leaving, Qing Shui gives Wang Lin a token for the Thunder Celestial Temple and calls him an indirect disciple of Bai Fan, since Call Wind is one of Bai Fan's six great arts, and Shengong Hu tells Wang Lin of the temple's ancient teleportation formation, now the only way out with the Immortal Gate destroyed.","events":["Yan Leizi brings out treasure spirits made from the souls of cultivators and immortals","Wang Lin recognises the Blood Ancestor among the spirits","Yan Leizi uses a jade slip to show Qing Shui his past as Bai Fan's disciple","A flashback shows Qing Shui's madness and Han Yan's death","Qing Shui fights back with Call Wind and Call Rain","Yan Leizi wins him over with the mystery of Bai Fan's death and the realm's fall","Qing Shui gives Wang Lin a Thunder Celestial Temple token","Shengong Hu points Wang Lin to the temple's teleportation formation"],"introduced":["Thunder Celestial Formation","Treasure spirits","Han Yan","Call Rain","Ice Seal","Cultivation Alliance hidden scroll","Thunder Celestial Temple teleportation formation"],"cultivation":"Yan Leizi's treasure spirits include Illusory Yin souls, a Nirvana Scryer, and immortals from fourth-grade Immortal up to first-grade Immortal Lord. Call Wind is one of Bai Fan's six great arts.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":158,"title":"The Last Way Out","summary":"As the Thunder Celestial Realm breaks apart and void cracks open, Wang Lin turns his Thunder Celestial Realm fragment seal into a vessel that the cracks cannot destroy and steers it toward the Thunder Celestial Temple's teleportation formation. He saves Zhan Yun, Zhan Konglie's cousin, and charges every rescued cultivator ten thousand Immortal Stones for their life plus ten thousand per hour, and soon Xizi Feng, Zhou Zhou, Hu Kailai, Liu Wenying and many others pay to come aboard. Shengong Hu joins him, calls him Master in front of everyone, and is told to disguise himself and stay out of any fight. At the teleportation fragment, the second-rank envoy Liao Qian and the other temple envoys mean to leave, destroy the formation and let the trespassers die with the realm. Wang Lin attacks with the Net-Severing Sword Art, the rescued cultivators pour their origin power into him, and he overpowers the envoys, but the formation is wrecked in the struggle. Li Yuan uses his family's restriction art, which can revive dead formations, to power it once, and the grateful survivors ask the name of their savior: Xu Mu.","events":["Wang Lin uses the realm fragment seal as a vessel through the void cracks","He rescues Zhan Yun and charges Immortal Stones for each passenger","Xizi Feng, Zhou Zhou, Hu Kailai, Liu Wenying and others come aboard","Shengong Hu joins and calls Wang Lin Master","Envoy Liao Qian plans to destroy the teleportation formation and leave the others to die","Wang Lin fights the envoys with the rescued cultivators' origin power","Li Yuan revives the damaged formation for one use"],"introduced":["Zhan Yun","Xizi Feng","Zhou Zhou","Hu Kailai","Liu Wenying","Liao Qian","Zhan, Xizi and Zhou families","Immortal Stones (fare)","Teleportation formation fragment"],"cultivation":"Zhan Yun: late Ascendant, fallen from Illusory Yin. Xizi Feng: late Ascendant. Zhou Zhou: early Ascendant. Hu Kailai and Liu Wenying: Corporeal Yang. Liao Qian: second-rank envoy, Corporeal Yang. Among the rescued, the strongest are three early Corporeal Yang.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":159,"title":"The Chosen Immortal Clan","summary":"The survivors land on a coast in the Allheaven Star System, and storytellers spread the tale of how Xu Mu killed three Thunder Celestial Temple envoys and broke their formation to save countless lives, though everyone was scattered at random and his whereabouts are unknown. In the Zhan family's hall, clan head Zhan Lie Yunzi decides the family should neither get too close to Xu Mu nor make him an enemy. Wang Lin has landed in an unknown region of Western Allheaven, a land sealed in living fog that blocks even divine sense, and after three days he reaches Reed Marsh, home of the Chosen Immortal Clan, whose people speak their own Chosen Immortal tongue. Seeing the Wither Dao Pair, the clan head takes him for a messenger of Celestial King Xiaoyao Zi, who ordered the clan to guard the Xuanyin Tripod for thirty thousand years, and Wang Lin realises they do not know the Celestial Realm has fallen. The altar guardian Ta Shan, who calls the clan head grandfather and resents the immortals, attacks him with the Thirteen Leaves warrior curse and the Scattered Devil armor, and Wang Lin beats him without killing him. When fog beasts break the clan's formation, Wang Lin uses his Yellow Springs Dao and the Wither Dao Pair to kill even the human-shaped ones that copy their attackers' arts, and asks to be taken to the tripod.","events":["Survivors spread the story of Xu Mu killing three envoys","Zhan Lie Yunzi decides the Zhan family should keep a careful distance from Xu Mu","Wang Lin is trapped in a fog-sealed land in Western Allheaven","He reaches Reed Marsh, home of the Chosen Immortal Clan","The clan head takes him for Xiaoyao Zi's messenger, guardian of the Xuanyin Tripod","Ta Shan attacks him with the Thirteen Leaves curse and Scattered Devil armor and is beaten","Fog beasts break the clan's formation and Wang Lin destroys them"],"introduced":["Zhan Lie Yunzi","Western Allheaven","Reed Marsh","Chosen Immortal Clan","A Qing","Zu Zhang (clan head)","Ta Shan","Xuanyin Tripod (named)","fog beasts","Celestial Slaying Formation","Scattered Devil armor","Chosen Immortal tongue"],"cultivation":"Ta Shan: Thirteen Leaves warrior curse, at Corporeal Yang.","confidence":"medium"},{"ep":160,"title":"The Third God Slaying War Chariot","summary":"Ta Shan leads Wang Lin to the Xuanyin Tripod and, alone, asks whether he is really an immortal; Wang Lin says no, and Ta Shan reveals that the tripod the clan has guarded for thirty thousand years is itself the source of the fog beasts that kill them, and begs him to lead the clan out in the immortals' name. Wang Lin explains that they are inside the belly of a giant beast that is itself a great restriction formation, with the fog as its source and the formation's eye where the fog comes out. The tripod spirit attacks with sound that strikes the soul, and Wang Lin glimpses a teleportation formation hidden under the tripod, but the clan head refuses to abandon their duty. Wang Lin settles near the tripod with Xu Liguo, the Mosquito Beast and the Thunder Toad on guard, binds the Ancient God Hide Armor to his soul against the tripod spirit, and takes a sealing rune from the hidden pouch of a captured Thunder Celestial Temple envoy's Nascent Soul, who also offers to lead him to the Allheaven Stone. After eight days he turns the rune into his own Heaven Seal. Wanting enough power to face any immortal behind the scheme, he refines a third God Slaying War Chariot, binds its beast to his life over seven trials, and wins, but its soul beast turns out to be a single butterfly.","events":["Ta Shan learns Wang Lin is not an immortal and reveals the tripod creates the fog beasts","Wang Lin explains they are inside a giant beast that is also a restriction formation","The tripod spirit attacks and a hidden teleportation formation is seen under the tripod","The clan head refuses to leave","Wang Lin binds the Ancient God Hide Armor to his soul","He takes a sealing rune from a captured envoy's soul and creates the Heaven Seal","He refines the third God Slaying War Chariot and subdues it over seven trials","Its soul beast turns out to be a butterfly"],"introduced":["Xuanyin Tripod (seen)","Tripod spirit","Giant beast (its belly holds the fog land)","Heaven Seal","Third God Slaying War Chariot","Butterfly soul beast","Allheaven Stone location (offered)"],"cultivation":"Wang Lin recalls the earlier chariots: the first could kill late Soul Formation when he was early Soul Formation, the second could shake early Ascendant when he was at Soul Transformation, and opening another seal at his peak let him fight Illusory Yin.","confidence":"medium"}];
